<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Bodjenga</book>
  <para style="h">MATAYO</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="toc2">MATIE</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mwako Mopele ma Matie</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mwako Mopele imakoma</para>
  <para style="mt1">Matie</para>
  <para style="imt">Eingeli</para>
  <para style="ip">Lotanealea odii Matie midjɔ ma tina ma Mwako Mopele imakimana Malako:</para>
  <para style="io1">Eleho ɛ Yoane Mobatisi (3, 1-12).</para>
  <para style="io1">Oinama na omekama ba Yesu (3, 13-4, 11).</para>
  <para style="io1">Misala ma Yesu ta Galilai: oleha, olaka bimumu na oheledja bato ba bipeko (4, 12-18, 35).</para>
  <para style="io1">Mwɛngɔ ta dɔngɔ la Yelusalɛmɛ (19-20).</para>
  <para style="io1">Oho Yesu akɔɔ maswi makɛkɛ imasukea na etumbu, na ogwa, na opusoa ko na oenɛmɛ ba nde mbala djike (21-28).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ta ibange la buku (1-2) Matie akoma boso diko la mbota, obotama na obwɛngɛ ba Yesu. Okimana na Mwako Mopele ma nde, aenɛmɛdjaka boo: Yesu adii Kumu na moheledja ona ɔbunedjama, na koko boo Emanuɛlɛ (Ndjambe engbanga na su), edii na ndjia ɛ nde Ndjambe akokedja mbuno ɛpa yo ta Edhimaneli Eeyou.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mwako Mopele moda imakoma Matie motikoani na bakomi bakina tina ɛ boo aputoanedja bileho ba Yesu na bikenge binɛnɛ bitano:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) «Eleho ta diko la ngomba» (5-7), ena ɛbalaka diko la basɔmi ba yanie ibaboani na «Okumu ba diko».</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Bileho odii bato ibaboani otɔndɔɔ Okumu bua (10).</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Mbombi ɛ Okumu, ena ɛinedjama na mandjɛ saambo: Okumu bua bodii hadɛdi bobombamake, endolo elonga ɛ bu edabi enɛnɛ (13).</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Moda ma ohelama ta Okumu bua (18).</para>
  <para style="io1">5) Moda ma oomba elonga ɛ suka ɛ Okumu bua (24-25).</para>
  <para style="ip">Bea ta Mwako Mopele imakoma Matie, Yesu aenɛmɛ elɛngɛɛ Molehi ona odoa aemea ngondo ɛ yanie ɛ Okumu ba diko ko adoa na eleho odii ibaingiabi bɛngɛ bapɛ tati odii bato bakina.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Bakɔkɔ ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luk 3, 23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Hee edii kombe dja bakɔkɔ ba Yesu Klisto, motitani ɔ Davidi, ko David motitani ɔ Abalayama.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Abalayama abota Isaka, Isaka abota Yakobo, Yakobo abota Yuda na bana ba nango; <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yuda abota Pelesi nɔbɔ Djela ngwabu adaka Tamala, Pelesi abota Esɔlɔme, Esɔlɔme abota Alame; <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Alame abota Aminadaba, Aminadaba abota Nasɔni, Nasɔni abota Salamane; <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salamane nɔbɔ Laba babota Boadja, Boadja nɔbɔ Luta babota Obede, Obede abota Yese, <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />ko Yese abota kumu Davidi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Davidi nɔbɔ mwali ɔ Uli babota Sɔlɔmɔ, <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Sɔlɔmɔ abota Loboama, Loboama abota Abia, Abia abota Asafa; <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asafa abota Yoyafata, Yoyafata abota Yolama, Yolama abota Odjiasi; <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Odjiasi abota Yotama, Yotama abota Akadja, Akadja abota Edjekiasi; <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Edjekiasi abota Manase, Manase abota Amoni, Amoni abota Yodjiasi; <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Yodjiasi abota Yekonia na bana ba nango, ta ehole ɛtombama bana ba Isalɛlɛ ta Babilone.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Ngɔngɔ dja otombama ba Isalɛlɛ ta Babilone, Yekonia abota Salatiele, Salatiele abota Yolobabɛlɛ; <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Yolobabɛlɛ abota Abiudi, Abiudi abota Eliakimi, Eliakimi abota Adjolo; <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Adjolo abota Sadoki, Sadoki abota Akimi, Akimi abota Eliudi; <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliudi abota Eleadjala, Eleadjala abota Matani, Matani abota Yakobo; <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Yakobo abota Yosepu, moomi ɔ Malia nɛngɛ ɛ Yesu, okabee bo Klisto.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Bea, donga Abalayama mbunoko Davidi, yangola djadaka doomi na inei, ko doomi na inei donga Davidi mbunoko ehole ɛtombama bana ba Isalɛlɛ ta Babilone, ko ikina doomi na inei donga ehole ena mbunoko obotama ba Klisto.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obotama ba Yesu Klisto</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luk 2, 1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Hokea moda mabotama Yesu Klisto. Malia, nango, apandamaka na Yosepu boo amoosɛ; endolo boso baodjebana mwali na moomi, Malia alwa deemi na ndjia ɛ Mwembo Mosɛnɔke. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Yosepu, moomi ɔ nde, adaka moto ɔ odjoo ko aipala omosambodja ta miso ma bato, aenɛ opele boo babɔtɔe na mbombi. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Oko ta ehole ɛdaka yo alɛdja modjɔ mua, obwɛndi ɔ Kumu aenɛmɛ na nde ta ndjɔti ko abala na nde boo: «Yosepu, motitani ɔ Davidi, pɛpɛ oda na bɔɔ ba osɔɔ Malia mwali ɔ wɛ, tina ɛ boo deemi ilidii na nde idongi odii Mwembo Mosɛnɔke. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Abotalea mwana moomi ko omobakealea kombe ɛ Yesu, tina ɛ boo edii yo moto oheledjalea bato ba nde ta masumu ma bobo.»<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Midjɔ mia misusu makɔɔmɔ tina ɛ okokedja ebaeli ɛbala Kumu na ndjia ɛ motɛli:<verse eid="MAT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />«Moseka mwali ɔ pɛpɛ odjeba baami alwalea deemi ko abotalea mwana moomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:23">bamobealea Emanuɛlɛ.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 1:23">Kombe ena etingodjai boo: «Ndjambe engbanga na su».<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Ehole ɛongɔɔ Yosepu ta hiɔ, akɔɔ midjɔ misusu oko moda imabala obwɛndi ɔ Kumu na nde. Atomba mwali ɔ nde Malia ta ndako ɛ nde. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Endolo aiputoana na nde mbunoko ehole ɛbota Malia mwana moomi, Yosepu amobakea kombe ɛ Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Bato ba owɛi badoi aindja Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Yesu abotama ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ ɛ Yuda, ta ehole ɛdaka Elode kumu. Ngɔngɔ dja obotama ba nde, bato ba owɛi, badonga ta dɔɔngɔ ikaimane diso la busa. Baimea ta Yelusalɛmɛ <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />ko bahɔdja boo: «Odii Kumu ɔ Bayuda hoo ɔhulake abotama hɔɔ? Loeni mondjɔtɔ ɔ nde dɔngɔ ikaimane diso la busa ko lodoi akwa magunda boso ba nde.» <verse eid="MAT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Ehole ɛoka kumu Elode gala ena, atungeama obuke, engbanga na bato basusu ba Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Abolea bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe na bato ba edjebeli ɛ Mobeko, ko abahɔdja esika eboani Masia obotama. <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ, ɛ Yuda. Tina ɛkomama na motɛli boo:<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />“Bea wɛ, Bɛtɛlɛmɛ, ta ekomi ɛ Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">oditi mokɛkɛ ta mabonga ma Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">tina ɛ boo kumu aimanabi odii wɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">ona odabi mobanyei ɔ bato ba mbai, Isalɛlɛ.”»<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Bea, Elode abea na mbombi bato ba owɛi bɛngɛ adjebe ehole ɛimana mondjɔtɔ. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Bea, abaloma ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ ko abala na bu boo: «Kɛɛ ahombeni mwana ona, ko okamodihani, djebedjanini bɛngɛ boo mbai koko nakɛɛ akwa magunda boso ba nde.»<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Ngɔngɔ dja ooka bibaeli ba kumu, bakɛɛ. Baenɛ koko mondjɔtɔ ona oɛnɛ bo dɔngɔ ikaimane diso la busa. Mondjɔtɔ ona adalaka boso ba bobo mbunoko ehole ɛema yo diko la esika ɛdaka mwana. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Ehole ɛenɛ bo koko mondjɔtɔ ona, baluma na sepi enɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Baimea ta ndako ena, baenɛ mwana na nango, Malia. Bakwa magunda tina eokumedja mwana; ngɔngɔ djia badipoa bhodjo dja bobo, bamopa bipeeli bii: ɔɔlɔ, malasi ma otumba, na miile. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Ngɔngɔ djia, Ndjambe abakebedja ta tei ɛ ndjɔti boo badae koko pɛpɛ osɔmbɔ odii Elode, batomba ndjia ekina bɛngɛ bayane ta ngando ɛ bobo.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otili ta Edjipito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Ngɔngɔ dja iyane la bato ba owɛi, Obwɛndi ɔ Ndjambe aenɛmɛ na Yosepu ta ndjɔti ko abala na nde boo: «Ema, tomba mwana na nango, tiani ta Edjipito ko nɛngedjani oho mbunoko ehole eodjebedjalea mbai koko boo osɔmbɛ. Tina ɛ boo, Elode ahombalea mwana bɛngɛ amoowoe.» <verse eid="MAT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Yosepu aema, atomba mwana na nango, oko na bulu bua, batia ta Edjipito. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Adikama oho mbunoko ogwa ba Elode. Ekɔɔmɔ bea bɛngɛ boo modjɔ imabala Kumu na ndjia ɛ motɛli makokedjame: «Nabea mwana ɔ mbai aimane ta Edjipito.»<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oowama ba bana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Ehole ɛsipoa Elode boo bato ba owɛi bamokosea, aoka kɛlɛ enɛnɛ. Apa enɔli baowoe bana baami bakɛkɛkɛ basusu donga mbua babae mbunoko otita ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ na ta ngando dja mbuti-mbuti, okimana na ehole ɛenɛ bato ba owɛi mondjɔtɔ. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Na bea, ebaeli ɛ motɛli Yelemia ɛkokedjama:<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />«Mongoli mookami ta Lama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Bie na miyeano minɛnɛ miokami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Edii Laele moto ɔyeaka bana ba nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Ko aloni opingedjama, tina e boo bagwa.»<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihule ta Edjipito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Ngɔngɔ dja ogwa ba Elode, Obwɛndi ɔ Kumu aenɛmɛ na ndjɔti odii Yosepu ta Edjipito. <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />Abala na nde boo: «Emaa, tomba mwana nɔbɔ nango ko sɔmbɔ ta ekomi ɛ Isalɛlɛ, tina ɛ boo, bato ibapalaka baowoe mwana bagwa.» <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Yosepu aemaa, atomba Mwana nɔbɔ nango ko bayana ta ekomi ɛ Isalɛlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Endolo ehole ɛoka yo boo Alikelausi asulungana ta egboto ɛ sango Elode elɛngɛɛ kumu ɔ Yuda, abanga osɔmbɔ oho. Ndjambe amokebedja ta tei ɛ ndjɔti ko Yosepu akɛɛ ta ekenge ɛ mokpɔtɔ ma Galilai. <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />Akɛɛ adikama ta ibonga ilabeaka bo Nasalɛta. Bɛngɛ ebaeli ɛ batɛli ekokedjame: «Bamobealea moto ɔ Nasalɛta.»<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Eleho ɛ Yoani Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mal 1, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3, 1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoa 1, 19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Ta ehole ena, Yoani Mobatisi adoa ko abanga oleha ta esobe ɛ Yuda boo: <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />«Sɔmbɔtɔnɔni milema tina ɛ boo Okumu ba busa bobatami!» <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Yoani adii moto ona obala motɛli Isaya boo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">«Hee edii moholi ma moto ona ɔdumbeaka ta esobe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">Bɔngɛdjani ndjia ɛ Kumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">Ninodjani migase ma nde odjoo!»<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Yoani alwaka esendja ɛ ngungi dja kamela na mosenge ma yobo ɛ tito; ayaaka ndoko na pɔki. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Bato ba Yelusalɛmɛ, ba Yuda esusu na iba ekulu ɛ dua ɛ Yolodani, badaka bakɛɛ odii yo. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Badaka bahuodja masumu ma bobo ko yo adaka abaina ta dua ɛ Yolodani.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Bea Yoane, ehole ɛenɛ yo Bafalusai na Basadukai badoa ainama odii yo, abala na bu boo: «Bana ba mabate, ona olehini moda maotia kɛlɛ ɛdoake nda? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Inedjani na mikɔɔ ma bono bo osɔmbɔtɔnini milema. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Pɛpɛ olɛdjanani ta milema ma boono boo: “Abalayama adii taatasu.” Nabalaka na nu sooti boo donga ta ndeke djii djaenɛkɛ no Ndjambe ahɔni oimanedja bana tina ɛ Abalayama! <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Epondo eboanedjami tina ɛ olena mele ta nginga dja mu: mole mosusu modii pɛpɛ obota mbuma djipele, bamolenaalea ko bamodumbalea ta mosa. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Mbai, naoinakani na madiba tina ɛ oenidja boo osɔmbɔtɔnini milema. Endolo ngɔngɔ dja mbai, moto omɔti adoake, anɔini na kpati, naboaniti noko ololoa nguulu dja sapato dja nde, yo moto oinaleani ta tei ɛ Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ko na mosa. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Apeli inyongela ta ebɔ ɛ nde ko abɔtɔdjalea ndongo na ndjani. Abolealea ndongo dja nde ta ebombelo, endolo atumbalea ndjani ta mosa imokadae pɛpɛ odimea.»<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oinama ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mal 1, 9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3, 21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Bea Yesu adonga ta Galilai ko akɛɛ ta Yolodani bɛngɛ boo ainame na Yoani. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Endolo Yoani alona omoina ko abala na nde boo: «Edii mbai moto odii na posa boo nainame na wɛ, endolo moda ndani wɛ owi doa odii mbai!» <verse eid="MAT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Bea Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Yɛɛ boo ɛkɔɔme bea hadɛdi! Edii opele tina ɛ booso okɔ bea tina ɛ okokedja odjoo bosusu.» Ngɔngɔ djia Yoani adhima. <verse eid="MAT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Ngɔngɔ dja oinama, Yesu ainoa ta madiba. Ambuku diko ladipoa tina ɛ nde: aɛnɛ Mwembo ma Ndjambe otita diko la nde elɛngɛ embenga. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Bea moholi maokama odiko ko mabala boo: «Hoo adii Mwana ɔ mbai ɔ epaeli, nakasepe na nde obuke.»<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Omekama ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mal 1, 12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk 4, 1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Mwembo alɔndɔ Yesu ta esobe bɛngɛ boo amekame na djabulu. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Ngɔngɔ dja osabekea maswi tuku inei, Yesu aoka ndja. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Momeki adoa odii yo ko abala na nde boo: «Okadaa Mwana ɔ Ndjambe, bala na ndeke djii boo dja imee mapa.» <verse eid="MAT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja: «Ɛkomama boo: “Moto atahela etoko na ipa, endolo na bibaeli bisusu bikaimane ta monɔkɔ ma Ndjambe.”»<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Na bea, djabulu amotomba ta ibonga isɛnɔke, amoemea ta sɔngɔ ɛ tepelo <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />ko abala na nde boo: «Okadaa Mwana ɔ Ndjambe, sadumba onase; tina ɛ Makomi mabalaka boo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">“Alomalea Babwɛndi ba nde</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">ko baotombalea ta mabɔ ma bobo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">ta elone ɛ boo egbota ɛ wɛ esaka taa mondeke.”»<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Ɛkomama koko boo: “Pɛpɛ omeka Kumu, Ndjambe ɔ wɛ.”»<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Djabulu amotomba koko diko la ngomba ena eenɔi na oyai, amoinedja bikumu bisusu ba ngondo engbanga na ekumu ɛ mu, <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />ko abala na nde boo: «Naopalea lua losusu ilaenɛkɛ wɛ, nga okakwa magunda boso ba mbai tina ɛ okumedjani.» <verse eid="MAT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Bea Yesu abala na nde boo: «Satana, donga ena! Tina ɛkomama boo: “Okwalea magunda oko odii Kumu Ndjambe ɔ wɛ ko oongɔɔnɔlea oko yo buki.”» <verse eid="MAT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Bea djabulu amokina. Babwɛndi badoa odii yo ko bamopa mia ma oyaka.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abangi mosala ma nde ta Galilai</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mal 1, 14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4, 14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Ehole ɛoka Yesu boo baisi Yoani ta bɔlɔkɔ, akɛɛ ta Galilai. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Adonga ta Nasaleta, endolo akɛɛ adaa ta Kapalanauma, ibonga la ekulu ɛ ibeke inɛnɛ la Galilai, ta tei ɛ bikenge ba mokpɔtɔ ba Djabulona ko Nefetali. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Ekɔɔmɔ bea tina ɛ okokedja bibaeli ba motɛli Isaya:<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />«Mokpɔtɔ ma Djabulona ko ma Nefetali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">ndjia ɛ ibeke inɛnɛ, mbuti na Yolodani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">Galilai ɛ bikomi ba bakɛndɛli!<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Bato ibahelamaka ta modidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">baeni ohuu bonɛnɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Bii ibadaka modidi ma bago,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">ihuu lienɛmɛbi odii bo!»<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Donga ehole hee, Yesu abanga oleha boo: «Sɔmbɔtɔnɔni milema ma boono, tina ɛ boo Okumu ba diko boimei mbuti!»<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abei balubi ba swi banei</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mal 1, 16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5, 1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Yesu adaka adale ta ekulu ɛ ibeke inɛnɛ la Galilai, aenɛ balubi ba swi babae yɛngɛ na osuku, Simo, ona ɔbeaka bo Piɛlɛ, na mwanango Andele; ibadaka baluba na ehea ta ibeke inɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Yesu abala na bu boo: «Kimananini ko naoimedjaleani balubi ba bato.» <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Ambuku, bakina bihea ba bobo ko bamokimana. <verse eid="MAT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Ehole ɛdonga Yesu ena, aenɛ koko bato bakina babae, yɛngɛ na osuku, Djake nɔbɔ Yoani, bana ba Zebedai. Badaka na sangwabu Zebedai ta bwato babɔngɛdja bihea. Yesu ababea; <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />ambuku, baakina bwato na sangwabu ko bamokimana.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alehi ko aheledjai bato ba bipeko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Yesu adala ta Galilai esusu, alehaka ta ndako dja miongɔɔnɔ dja Bayuda, alehaka Mwako Mopele ma Okumu ba busa ko aheledjaka bato na bipeko ba bobo na biɛmɛ ba bobo bisusu. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Gala ɛ nde enangana ta Sulia esusu ko badaka bamolwɛ bato basusu ibanɔngɔmɔkɔ na bipeko mindumba na mindumba kaoko ibatungeamaka na miembo mibe, engbanga na bato ba mosinga na bitumbɛ. Yesu abaheledjaka. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Bato bike bamokimanaka, ibadongaka ta Galilai, ta mabonga doomi, ta Yelusalɛmɛ, ta Yuda ko ta ekenge ɛ mokpɔtɔ ɛ dɔngɔ la dua la Yolodani.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Eleho ta diko la ngomba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Ehole ɛenɛ Yesu emumu ɛ bato, aihwea ta ngomba ko adaa. Batingami ba nde babatama mbuti na nde <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />ko abanga obaleha boo:<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Sepi ɛ sooti</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luk 6, 20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />«Sepi odii bia ibasaenɛkɛ bakwali ta mwembo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:3">tina ɛ boo Okumu ba busa bodii ba bobo!<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Sepi odii bia ibayeaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:4">tina boo Ndjambe abapingedjabi!<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Sepi odii bato ba bwɛli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:5">tina ɛ boo basangoabi mokpɔtɔ!<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Sepi odii bato ibadii na ndja ko ibadii na posa ɛ odjoo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:6">tina ɛ boo bagolabi!<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Sepi odii bato bakaoke bato bakina ndjokwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:7">tina ɛ boo baokeamabi ndjokwa!<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Sepi odii bia ibadii na milema misɛnɔke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:8">tina ɛ boo baenɛbi Ndjambe!<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Sepi odii bia ibakapɛ ogoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:9">tina ɛ boo babeamabi bana ba Ndjambe!<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Sepi odii bia ibanyɔkolɔkɔ bo tina ɛ odjoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:10">tina ɛ boo Okumu ba Ndjambe bodii ba bobo!<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />Sepi ɛ boono ehole ɛosingakani bo ko ɛonyɔkɔlɔkɔni bo, ehole ɛokoseakani bo midjɔ mindumba na mindumba diko la mbai. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Sepani ko daani na monanga, tina ɛ boo odabini na iputi inɛnɛ ta busa; tina ɛ boo edii oko moda mua momɔti imanyɔkɔlɔ bo batɛli ibadaka boso ba boono.»<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Mokwa na ihuu la ngondo</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mal 9, 50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luk 14, 34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />«Ino odini mokwa ma ngondo. Endolo mokwa mokasia ngɛngɛ, moda ndani bahɔni koko osɔmbɛdja ngɛngɛ ɛ mu? Modɛtelea koko na tina; bamodumbalea osokolu, ko bato bamominakakalea.»<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />«Ino odini ihuu la ngondo. Ibonga ilipikami diko la ngomba lihɔniti obombama. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Tebayodjae moinda tina ɛ omoisa nase dja poke. Endolo, bakamobakee diko la mesa tina opaa ohuu odii bato bia ibadii ta tei ɛ ndako. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Yɛɛ ihuu la boono langɛngɛ boso ba bato basusu, bɛngɛ boo baenɛ misala mipele ma boono ko basakoe Sangwanu ona odii ta busa.»<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Eleho diko la Mobeko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />«Pɛpɛ olɛdjani boo nadoa adongedja Mobeko kaoko batɛli; naidoa tina ɛ odongedja; endolo tina ɛ okokedja. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Nabalaka na nu sooti boo: boso boo diko na kpɔtɔ ladimoe, pɛpɛ ikomi noko imɔti ilinɔi na okɛkɛ ihɔni odonga ta tei ɛ Mobeko, mbunoko okokedjama ba midjɔ misusu. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Bea, moto ona odongedjabi mobeko momɔti imonɔi na okɛkɛ, ko olehabi bato bakina bakoe moda mua, bamotombabi moto onɔi na okɛkɛ ta Okumu ba diko. Endolo moto osumabi ko olehabi Mibeko mii odii bato bakina, adabi moto monɛnɛ ta Okumu ba diko. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Nabalaka na nu sooti boo: nga odjoo ba boono bomiti nɔɔ buu ba bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko na Bafalusai, oingetebini ta Okumu ba diko.»<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Bileho tina ɛ kɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />«Ɔokani babala na bataatasu boo: “pɛpɛ oowa moto; moto mosusu oowoi moto okina aboani na esambi boso ba badjudji.” <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Na bea, mbai nabali na nu boo: moto mosusu ookei mwanango kɛlɛ aboani na esambi boso ba djudji; ona obali na mwanango boo: “endanga” aboani na esambi ta ibolea inɛnɛ; ona obali na mwanango boo: “elole” aboani odumbama ta mosa ma gena. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Okakɛɛ apa epeeli boso ba kinda ɛ mbeka ko olɛdjai boo odii na modjɔ na mwangwao, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />kina epeeli ɛ wɛ boso ba kinda ɛ mbeka, ko kɛɛ boso ahomba ogoo na mwangwao; ngɔngɔ djia sɔmbɔ ko kɛɛ apɛ epeeli ɛ wɛ odii Ndjambe.»<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />«Nga okadaa na modjɔ na moto omɔti, kɔɔ pɛpɛlɛ boo ɔokane nɔnɔ nde ehole edii no na ndjia. Ta bɔɔ ba boo moto odii na wɛ na ikambo asaka okaba ta mabɔ ma djudji, djudji asaka onɔdja ta mabɔ ma pɔlisi ko pɔlisi asaka omaa ta bɔlɔkɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Nabali na wɛ sooti boo: oimanetelea ena oko okaputa nyongo ɛ wɛ esusu.»<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Bileho tina ɛ bɔɔli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />«Ɔokaani babala boo: “pɛpɛ okɔ bɔɔli.” <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Endolo, mbai nabali na nu boo: moomi mosusu oohokei mwali na malɛi ma omomungoa akɔi bɔɔli nɔbɔ nde ta molema. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Nga diiso la wɛ la ebɔ ɛ baami likaotɛdja ibaku, lidongedja ko lidumba ohali na wɛ: enɔi na opele tina ɛ wɛ obungedja enama ɛ wɛ ɛ emɔti na boo ɔdumbame mokuku ma wɛ mosusu ta ipelu. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Nga ebɔ ɛ wɛ ɛ baami ekaotɛdja ibaku yelena ko yedumba ohali na wɛ; enɔi na opele tina ɛ wɛ obungedja enama ɛ mokuku emɔti ta esika ɛ boo mokuku ma wɛ mosusu madumbame ta ipelu.»<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Bileho tina ɛ moki</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat 19, 9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mal 10, 11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16, 18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />«Ɔokaani babala koko boo: “yɛɛ moomi ona oodongedjai mwali ɔ nde amopɛ mokanda ma oowa moki.” <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Endolo, mbai nabali na nu boo: moomi mosusu odongedjai mwali ɔ nde ta moki, dongedja oko mwali ona akakwaa na bɔɔli, amodipoi ndjia ɛ ndukeli; ko moomi ona oobali mwali ona ɔdongedja bo ta moki akɔi bɔɔli.»<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Bileho tina ɛ olena seleka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />«Ɔokaani koko babala na bataatasu boo: “Pɛpɛ olena seleka ɛ epulu, endolo kokedja mbuno idjapa wɛ na olena seleka boso ba Kumu.” <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Endolo, mbai nabalaka na nu boo pɛpɛ olena selake: edae na kombe ɛ busa, tina ɛ boo edii gbɛndɛ ɛ Ndjambe; <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />kaoko na kombe ɛ ngondo tina ɛ boo edii ebakeli ɛ Ndjambe ɛ mako; kaoko na kombe ɛ Yelusalɛmɛ tina ɛ boo edii ibonga la Kumu monɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Pɛpɛ olena seleka na ndjia ɛ molo ma wɛ, tina ɛ boo otahɔnɔ oimedja moswee ma wɛ momɔti mopu kaoko mohindo. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Balani boo: “edii bea” nga ekada bea, “pɛpɛ” nga ekadaa pɛpɛ. Midjɔ misusu imikabakee bo mikadonge odii Mokosi.»<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Bileho tina ɛ obukanedja</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luk 6, 29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />«Ɔokaani babala boo: “Diiso tina ɛ diiso ko diino tina ɛ diino.” <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Endolo, mbai nabalaka na nu boo pɛpɛ obukanedja obe na moto ookɔi obe. Nga moto akaoboma mbata ta mobanga ma ebɔ ɛ baami, molɛkɛɛ koko mobanga ma ebɔ ɛ bali. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Nga moto akapala aopunde tina ɛ otomba esendja ɛ wɛ, mokinea koko mokoto ma wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Nga moto akaoloma na ngulu boo ɔdale kilomɛtɛlɛ emɔti, dala engbanga na nde kilomɛtɛlɛ ibae. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Paa odii ona osɛngɛkɛ eka; pɛpɛ olona obekedja moto ɔpalaka abeke odii wɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Opala baloni</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luk 6, 27-28</ref>. <ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />«Ɔokani babala boo: “Pala mwangwao ko lona moloni ɔ wɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Endolo, mbai nabalalaka na nu boo: Palani baloni ba boono ko ongɔɔnɔni tina ɛ bia ibakaonyɔkɔleni. <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />Bea, odabini bana ba Sangwanu ona odii odiko. Tina ɛ boo akaimanedjae diiso la busa tina ɛ bato bapele na bato babe, ko akadumbe mbua tina ɛ bato ba odjoo na ibataki odjoo. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Nga okapalani otoko bato ibakaopaleni, iputi idihalea no nda? Noko baputedjeli ba puti bakakɔe bea! <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Nga okaisiani oko banaangwanu, modjɔ ma okamoa makɔkɔ no nda? Noko bapagano bakakɔe koko bea! <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Odabini bato ibakoki moda modii Sangwanu ona odii odiko mokokake.»<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s2">Bileho tina ɛ bipeeli odii bakwali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />«Angatanani tina ɛ okokedja odjoo ba boono boso ba bato bɛngɛ baoenɛni; emiti da bea otakaleani iputi ilaobombeani Sangwanu ona odii odiko. <verse eid="MAT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />Ehole ekapɛ wɛ epeeli ɛ ndjokwa, pɛpɛ oboma mondulɛ boso ba wɛ, moda mokakɔɛ bato ba owɛi bobe ta ndako dja miongɔɔnɔ dja Bayuda na ta matilinga ma ndjia bɛngɛ bato babakumedjae. Nabalaka na nu sooti, badihi iputi la bobo ehele. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Endolo ehole ɛkabeaka wɛ bakwali, kɔɔ boo ebɔ ɛ wɛ ɛ bali etadjeba modjɔ mokɔi ebɔ ɛ wɛ ɛ baami. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Bɛngɛ boo epeeli ɛ wɛ ɛ ndjokwa edae modjɔ ma mbombi, bea Sangwao okaenɛ midjɔ imakɔkɔ wɛ ta mbombi, aopalea iputi.»<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Bileho tina ɛ miongɔɔnɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luk 11, 2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />«Ehole ɛongɔɔnɔkɔ no, pɛpɛ odani elɛngɛ bato ba owɛi bobe: bakapale oongɔɔnɔ baemi diko ta ndako dja miongɔɔnɔ dja Bayuda ko ta maatano ma ndjia bɛngɛ boo bato ba baenɛ. Nabalaka na nu, sooti boo: badihi iputi la bobo ehele. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Endolo wɛ, ehole oɔngɔɔnɔkɔ wɛ, ingea ta ekenge ɛ ndako, dipa edipako ko oɔngɔɔnɔ Sangwao ona odii ta esika ena ɛ mbombi, bea Sangwao ona ookaɛnɛ midjɔ imikakɔɔme ta mbombi, aoputalea.»<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />Ehole eongɔɔnɔkɔ no, pɛpɛ obalakakani obuke moda mokakɔe bapagano: bakalɛdjae boo Ndjambe oasɔlea miongɔɔnɔ ma bobo nga bakabala obuke. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Pɛpɛ okɔɔni elɛngɛ ibo, tina ɛ boo, Sangwanu akadjebe posa dja boono boso ba omosɛngɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Hokeani moda moboani no oɔngɔɔnɔ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">Sangwasu ona odii odiko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">yɛɛ kombe ɛ wɛ ɛdae ɛsɛnɔke,<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />yɛɛ Okumu ba wɛ badoe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">yɛɛ opala ba wɛ bakɔɔme ta ngondo elɛngɛ okakɔɔme bo ta busa.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Lopa mia ma booso ma engi busa.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Loyɛɛ mabunga ma booso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:12">moda mokayɛɛ so bato ibakalokɔmɛɛ mabunga.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Pɛpɛ olokina boo lakwae ta lomeko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">endolo lotingoa ta obe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">[Ɛlɔkɛɛ boo okumu, ngulu na ekumu lodii la wɛ tina ɛ kɔbili. Oko bea.]<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />«Tina ɛ boo, nga okayɛɛni baminanu mabe maokɔmɛɛni bo, Sangwanu odii odiko aoyɛɛbini koko. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Endolo nga omiti yɛɛni baminanu, Sangwanu aoyɛɛtebini mabe ma boono.»<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Bileho tina ɛ osabekea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />«Ehole esabekeino, pɛpɛ osubuani moda mokakɔe bato ba owɛi bobe: bakasubue bɛngɛ bato baenɛ boo basabekei. Nabali na nu, sooti boo: badihi ibondo la bobo ehele. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Endolo wɛ, ehole esabekeaka wɛ, sasosa boso ko sasua malasi ta molo, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />bɛngɛ bato badae pɛpɛ odjeba boo osabekei. Dongedja oko Sangwao, ona okadae pɛpɛ oenɛmɛ, bea, yo ona okaenɛ midjɔ mikakɔɔme ta mbombi, aoputalia.»<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Bileho diko la odiheli</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luk 12, 33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />«Pɛpɛ oboleani odiheli haa ta kpɔtɔ, tina ɛ boo bohɔni obeha na sɛ, na mbalanga ko baibi bahɔni obuka ndako bɛngɛ baboibe. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Endolo boleani odiheli ba boono ta busa, oho sɛ na mbalanga tebabedjae ko baibi batahɔnɔ oboiba. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Tina ɛ boo esika edii odiheli ba wɛ molema ma wɛ modii oho.»<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ohuu ba mokuku</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luk 11, 34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />«Miiso madii ohuu ba mokuku: miiso ma wɛ makadaa mapele, mokuku ma wɛ mosusu modalea ta ohuu; <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />endolo nga miiso ma wɛ makapeka, mokuku ma wɛ mosusu modii ta modidi. Bea nga ohuu ibodii ta tei ɛ wɛ bokaimea modidi, modidi mua modalea mopipo mɛɛnɛ!»<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ndjambe kaoko falanga</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luk 16, 13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />«Moto omɔti atahɔnɔ osalea bakumu babae: tina ɛ boo alonalea omɔti ko apalalea okina; kaoko akatanalea na omɔti ko alonalea okina. Ohɔnitini osalea Ndjambe na falanga engbanga emɔti.»<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Oisa molema odii Ndjambe</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">Luk 12, 22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />«Ta tina ena, nabalaka na nu boo: pɛpɛ osatungeani tina ɛ mohelo ma boono na osahɔdja boo: Eyakalea so nde kaoko emwalea so nde? Kaoko tina ɛ mikuku ma boono na osahɔdja boo: elwalea so nde? Enao, mohelo monɔiti mia ma oyaka na tina ko mokuku monɔiti bisendja na tina, editi bea? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Hokeani mbulu badiko: tebaone ko tebabuke mbuma, tebabolee mbuma ta bibombelo, endolo Sangwanu odii odiko akabayakedjae! Bea, ino obanɔitini na tina? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Moto ndani ta ndanda ɛ bono ohɔni obakea noko iswi imɔti ta mohelo ma nde na ndjia ɛosatungea?»<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />«Ko tina ndani okasatungeeni diko la bisendja ba olwa? Hokeani fulɛlɛ dja gue: moda mokakandoe djo: tedjisale ko tedjisatongee bisendja. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Endolo, nabalaka na nu sooti boo, noko Sɔlɔmɔ, ta ekumu ɛ nde esusu, ailwa bisendja ba omwenga onɔ fulɛlɛ emɔti ta ndanda ɛ dju. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Nga Ndjambe akalwɛdja busabu ndjani dja gue bea ko idjidumbamalea puma ta mosa: aolwɛdjaeteleani ino na onɔ? Bato ba edhimeli ekɛkɛ! <verse eid="MAT 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />Bea pɛpɛ osatungeani na obala boo: “eyakalea so nde? Emwalea so nde? Elwalea so nde?” <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Edii bapagano bato bakahombe midjɔ mia misusu. Endolo Sangwanu odii odiko adjebaka opele mɛɛnɛ boo odini na otaka ba leka lua losusu. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Hombani boso mɛɛnɛ Okumu ba Ndjambe na odjoo ba bu ko yo aopaleani leka lua losusu. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Pɛpɛ osatungeani tina ɛ puma sɛɛnɛ: tina ɛ boo busa ba puma sɛɛnɛ bosatungealea tina ɛ bu mɛɛnɛ. Engi iswi idii na monɔngɔ ma lu.»<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s2">Pɛpɛ osambedjani bato bakina</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luk 6, 37-38</ref>. <ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />«Pɛpɛ osambedjani, bɛngɛ boo basaka osambedjani koko ino. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Tina ɛ boo baosambedjaleani oko moda masambedjaka no bato bakina; ko baoɛdjɛleani oko na mwɛngi imaɛdjɛkɛ no bato bakina. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Tina ndani ohokeaka oko mondjani imodii ta diiso la mwangwao, ko otaenɛkɛ yaale ɛ ibaya ena edii ta diiso la wɛ? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Moda ndani ohɔni obala na mwangwao boo: “kina nadongedjae mondjani imodii ta diiso la wɛ”, ena bea odii na yaale ɛ ibaya ta diiso la wɛ? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Moto ɔ owɛi bobe, dongedja boso mɛɛnɛ yaale ɛ ibaya eedii ta diiso la wɛ, bea oenɛlea opele moda ma odongedja mondjani ta diiso la mwangwao.»<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />«Pɛpɛ opaani leka losɛnɔke odii mvwa, asaka sɔmbɔ aotwani; ko pɛpɛ odumbani leka la boono la motsuia monɛnɛ boso ba ngulu, basaka lominakaka.»<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Hɔdjaa, homba ko boma edipako</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luk 11, 9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />«Hɔdjani, ko baopaleani; hombani, ko odihaleani; bomani edipako, ko baodipualeani. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Tina ɛ boo, moto na moto ɔhɔdjaka akaosɛ, ona ɔhombaka akadihe ko moto ona ɔbomaka edipako bakamodipoe. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Moto ndani ta ndanda ɛ boono opalea mondeke odii mwana ɔ nde nga akamosɛngɛ ipa? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Kaoko ndani ona opalea mwana ɔ nde ndjɔ nga akamosɛngɛ moswi? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Nga ino bato babe okadjeba opaani bana ba boono leka lopele, na onɔ Sangwanu ona odii odiko, apɛtelea leka lopele odii bia ibamohɔdjaka lo?»<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />«Midjɔ misusu mikapale no boo bato bakina baokɔmɛɛni, kɔɔni moda mua tina ɛ bobo: tina ɛ boo edii bileho bisusu bikalehe Mobeko na Batɛli.»<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ndjia djibae</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luk 13, 24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />«Ingeani na ndjia ɛ edipako eekɛkɛ! Tina ɛ boo edipako na ndjia eekakɛɛ ta ogwa edii enɛnɛ ko bato bike bakaingee ena. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Endolo edipako ko ndjia eekakɛɛ ta mohelo edii ekɛkɛ ko edii oko bato bakɛkɛ ibakayeenɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Batɛli ba epulu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luk 6, 43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />«Tomangataanani na batɛli ba epulu. Bakadoe odii no balwali bisendja ba bhata, endolo otei badii swa. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Obadjebaleani na mikɔ ma bobo. Tebatswɛ mbuma dja vino ta mole ma ndjubɛ kaoko otswa mbuma dja figi ta mole ma ndjubɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Mole mopele mokabote oko mbuma ipele endolo mole mobe mokabote oko mbuma mbe. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Mole mopele temobote mbuma mbe, endolo mole mobe motabota mbuma ipele. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Mole mosusu imokadae pɛpɛ obota mbuma ipele bakamokeke, ko bakamodumbe ta mosa. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Na bea, odjebaleani batɛli ba epulu na mikɔ ma bobo.»<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Obala na okɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luk 13, 25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />«Editi otoko bato basusu ibakabale na mbai boo: “Kumu, Kumu”, ibaingeabi ta Okumu ba diko, endolo oko bia ibakakɔe opala ba Tata ona odii odiko. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Ta iswi la esambi, bato bike babalabi na mbai boo: “Kumu, Kumu, edii ta kombe ɛ wɛ latɛlɛkɛ; edii ta kombe ɛ wɛ labenganaka miembo mibe; ko edii ta kombe ɛ wɛ lakɔkɔ midjɔ minɛnɛ ma okamoa?” <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Bea nabalabi na bu boo: “Nataodjebakani noko osinɛɛ, sasuani na mbai ino bato babe!”»<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Indjɛ la ndako ibae</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luk 6, 47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />«Bea, moto na moto ooki bibaeli ibahulake mbai abala ko abisumi akoani na moto ɔ owɛi ona ɔpika ndako ɛ nde diko la mondeke. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Ehole ɛkwa mbua, pela ɛlinda, lungu ɛboma ndako ena, endolo ɛibukea tina ɛ boo miboko ma yu mabakama diko la mondeke. <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Endolo moto na moto ooki midjɔ mahulake mbai abala ko amisumiti akoani na endanga ona ɔpika ndako ɛ nde diko la djɛlo. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Mbua akwa, pela ɛlinda, lungu ɛboma ndako ena ko ndako ɛbukeana: obeha ba yu badaka na osusu.»<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kpati ɛ Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Ehole ebɛtɛ Yesu obala bibaeli bii, bato basusu bakamoa obuke na moda ma nde ma oleha; <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />tina ɛ boo aidaka elengɛɛ bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko, endolo abalehaka na kpati.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai moto ɔ mabha</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mal 1, 40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5, 12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Ehole ɛtita Yesu ta ngomba, emumu ɛ bato ɛmokimana. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Moto omɔti ɔ mabha asabatea ko akwa magunda boso ba nde ko abala boo: «Molehi, okapala, sɛnɔdjani.» <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yesu aninodja ebɔ, amopea ko abala boo: «Napali ɛdae bea, sɛnɔdjama!» Ambuku, asɛnɔdjama na mabha ma nde. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Ko Yesu abala na nde boo: «Hokamedja opele: pɛpɛ otɔndɔɔ moto omɔti modjɔ mu. Endolo kɛɛ asaenɛmɛdjae odii nganga ɔ Ndjambe, ko pa epeeli okimana na mobeko ma Mose, bɛngɛ edae tati ta miiso ma bobo boo oheli.»<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai mosali ɔ kumu ɔ basoda</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luk 7, 1-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 5:12-16">Yoa 5, 12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Ehole ɛingea Yesu ta Kapalanauma, kumu omɔti ɔ basoda adoa odii yo ko amohɔdja boo amokɔmɛdjae. <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />«Kumu, mosali ɔ mbai asambi ta ndako, atahɔnɔko odala ko adii na epeko epipo.» <verse eid="MAT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Nadoake amoheledja.» <verse eid="MAT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Endolo kumu ɔ basoda asɔmbɛdja boo: «Kumu, naboaniti boo naosɛ ta ndako ɛ mbai. Endolo bala etoko kɔpɛ emɔti ko mosali ɔ mbai ahelalea. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Tina ɛ boo mbai mɛɛnɛ nadii nase dja bakumu ibanoini ko nadii na basoda ibadi nase dja okumu ba mbai. Nakabala na omɔti boo: “kɛɛ!”, akakɛɛ, nakabala na okina boo: “dua!”, akadoe; ko nakabala na mobuli ɔ mbai boo: “kɔɔ boo”, akakɔe.» <verse eid="MAT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Ehole ɛoka Yesu bibaeli bia, akamoa obuke ko abala na bato ibamokimanaka boo: «Nabalaka na nu, sooti, mɛɛnɛ boo: napakita tanea moto ɔ odhima moda mu ta Isalɛlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Nabalaka na nu, bike badongabi ta dɔngɔ likaimane diiso la busa na dɔngɔ likatite diiso la busa ko badabi ta mesa ɛ Okumu ba Ndjambe engbanga na Abalayama, Isaka na Yakobo. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Endolo bato ibaboanaka osangoa Okumu badumbamabi osokolu, ta modidi, ehoo bayeabi ko bakpɛkɛɛnɛbi miino.»<verse eid="MAT 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Bea Yesu abala na kumu ɔ basoda boo: «Sɔmbɔ ta ndako ɛ wɛ, yɛɛ ekɔɔme okimana na odhima ba wɛ!» Ko mosali ɔ kumu ɔ basoda ahela oko ta ehole ena.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai bato bike ba bipeko</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mal 1, 29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4, 38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Ngɔngɔ djia Yesu akɛɛ ta ndako ɛ Piɛlɛ. Atanea okio ba Piɛlɛ asambi: tina ɛ boo adaka na mokuku mosa. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Yesu amopea ta ebɔ ko mokuku mosa masia, bea aɛma ko amobɔngedja mia ma oya.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Ehole ɛimea mɔkɔmɔkɔ, badua odii Yesu na bato ba miembo mibe bike. Abengana miembo mibe na ebaeli ɛ nde ko aheledja bato basusu ba bipeko. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Ɛkɔɔmɔ bea bɛngɛ boo bibaeli babala motɛli Isaya bakokedjame: «Atomba bigo ba booso ko aloheledja na bipeko ba booso.»<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibapalaka okimana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luk 9, 57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Ehole ɛenɛ Yesu emumu ɛ bato emohiki, abala na batingami ba nde boo bakatise ta dɔngɔ ikina la dua. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Moto ɔ edjebeli ɛ mobeko abatama ko abala na nde boo: «Molehi, naokimanalea ngise susu idjikɛbi wɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Bibanga badii na mikpo ma obolama ko mbulu badii na meepu, endolo Mwana ɔ moto aditi na esika ɛ osambea molo ma nde.»<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Moto okina ta ndanda ɛ batingami ba nde, abala na nde boo: «Kumu, pani ndjia nakɛɛ boso apusea tata.» <verse eid="MAT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Endolo Yesu amosɔmbedja boo: «Kimanani ko kina bato bago basapusee ibo mɛɛnɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asii lungu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mal 4, 35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8, 22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Yesu atitea ta bwato ko batingami ba nde bamokimana. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Mbala emɔti, lungu epipo ɛkwa ta ibeke inɛnɛ ko mula masamaka ta bwato. Ta ehole ena Yesu adaka ahwɛli hiɔ. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Batingami basabatea na nde ko bamongɔdjaa ena bagama boo: «Kumu, loheledja! Logwalea!» <verse eid="MAT 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Yesu abala na bu boo: bato ba edhimeli ekɛkɛ, tina ebangaka no nda? Bea aemaa, agamea lungu na mula ko ogoo bonɛnɛ basɔmbɔ. <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Ibo basusu bakamoa ko basabaleana boo: «Moto hoo adii moda nda bɛngɛ boo noko na lungu na mula la mosume?»<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai bato babae ba miembo mibe</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mal 5, 1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8, 26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Ehole ɛimea yo ta dɔngɔ ikina la ibeke iinɛnɛ, ta ekenge ɛ mokpɔtɔ ɛ Gadala, bato babae ba miembo mibe baimana ta makila ko badoa asaka na Yesu. Badaka bato ba mondea mopipo ko bato babangaka onɔɔ ta ndjia ena. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Babangaka ogama boo: «Mwana ɔ Ndjambe, modjɔ ma booso na wɛ nda? Odoi haa bɛngɛ olotungee boso ba ehole ɛbɔngɛdjama?»<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Bwela ba ngulu badaka bayaka maa ohali na esika ɛdaka bo. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Miembo mibe maongɔɔnɔ Yesu boo: «Nga okapala ɔlobengane, loloma ta bwela buu ba ngulu.» <verse eid="MAT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Yesu abala na miembo mibe mia boo: «Imanani». Baimana odii bato bia babae ko bakɛɛ aingea odii ngulu. Bea bwela bosusu ba ngulu bahilingoana diko la ngomba mbunoko ta ibeke inɛnɛ ko bagwa ta madiba. <verse eid="MAT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Babanyeli ba ngulu batia, bakɛɛ ta ibonga atɔndɔɔ gala dja midjɔ misusu imanɔɔ ko imatanea bato bia babae ba miembo mibe. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Bea bato basusu ba ibonga baimana bɛngɛ basake na Yesu; ehole ɛmoenɛ bo, bamoongɔɔnɔ boo adonge ta ekenge ɛ bobo ɛ mokpɔtɔ.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai etumbɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mal 2, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5, 17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Yesu atitea ta bwato, akatisa ibeke inɛnɛ ko akɛɛ ta ibonga la nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Bamolwɛɛ etumbɛ asambi ta bwanga. Ehole ɛenɛ Yesu edhimeli ɛ bobo, abala na etumbɛ boo: «Sapingedja, mwana ɔ mbai! Masumu ma wɛ mayɛɛmi!» <verse eid="MAT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Ta tina ena ekenge ɛ bato ba edjebeli ɛ Mobeko basabalea ibo mɛɛnɛ boo: «Moto hoo asɛtɔdjaka Ndjambe!» <verse eid="MAT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Ɔdjeba Yesu malɛi ma bobo abahɔdja boo: «Tina ndani odiini na malɛi mabe ta milema ma boono? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Modjɔ monɔi na opɛtɛpɛtɛ nda obala boo: “Masumu ma wɛ mayɛɛmi”, kaoko obala boo: “Ema ko dala”? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Endolo napalaka ɔdjebeni boo: Mwana ɔ moto adii na kpati ɛ oyɛɛ masumu ta tei ɛ ngondo.» Bea abala na etumbɛ boo: «Emaa, tomba bwanga ba wɛ ko sɔmbɔ ta ndako ɛ wɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Moto ona aemaa ko ayana ta ndako ɛ nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Ehole ɛenɛ emumu ɛ bato bea, baluma na bɔɔ ko bakumedja Ndjambe ona ɔɔpa kpati moda mua odii bato.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abei Matie</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mal 2, 13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5, 27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yesu adonga ena ko aenɛ, anɔe, moto ɔbeaka bo Matie adii ta esika ɛ nde ɛ mosala ma oputedja puti. Abala na nde boo: «Kimanani!» Matie aema ko amokimana. <verse eid="MAT 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Ena ɔdaka Yesu ayaka ta ndako ɛ Matie; baputedjeli ba puti bike na bato bakina ba masumu badoa ko bayaka engbanga na Yesu na batingami ba nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Ɔenɛ Bafalusai bea bahɔdja batingami ba Yesu boo: «Tina ndani molehi ɔ boono adii oya na baputedjeli ba puti ko na bato ba masumu?» <verse eid="MAT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Yesu abaoka ko abala na bu boo: «Bato ba pɛpɛ bipeko tebakambe na mosaboli, endolo bato ba bipeko bakakambe na nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Kɛɛ aikoeni tingo ɛ bibaeli bii: “Nakasepe na molema ma bwɛli onɔ mbeka.” Tina ɛ boo naidua ahomba bato ba odjoo, endolo bato ba masumu.»<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na osabekea</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mal 2, 18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5, 33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Bea batingami ba Yoani badoa ko bahɔdja Yesu boo: «Tina ndani batingami ba wɛ tebasabekee, endolo iso na Bafalusai lokasabekee?» <verse eid="MAT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Ko Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Bato ibabeami ta tɛkɛ ɛ moki baboani odaa na ndjokwa ehole edii moomi ɔ moki engbanga na bu? Maswi imadoake, imabadongedjabi bo moomi ɔ moki; bea ta ehole ena basabekeabi.»<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />«Moto atakatanedja yaale ɛ esendja ɛ tɛtɛli na eeyou; tina ɛ boo ekenge ɛ esendja ɛ tɛtɛli ekalalea esendja eeyou ko iposi dia idalea inɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Edii oko moda momɔti tina ɛ vino ɛ yanie ta mbola eeyou, tina ɛ boo mbola ehɔni oolea ko vino esopealea esusu. Ena bea, bakaise vino ɛ yanie oko ta mbola dja tɛtɛli bɛngɛ boo vino na mbola djabanyeame opele.»<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oheledjama ba mwali ko opusoama ba mwana mwali ɔ kumu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mal 5, 21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8, 40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Ehole ɛbala Yesu na bu bea, kumu omɔti aimea, akwa magunda boso ba nde ko abala boo: «Mwana ɔ mbai mwali asagwa oko hadɛdi, dua, amobakee ebɔ ko asɔmbɔlea koko ta mohelo.» <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yesu aema ko amokimana engbanga na batingami ba nde.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Oko ta ohole ena, mwali omɔti adaka na epeko ɛ itanga la makia ko epeko ena ɛnɛngɛdja mbua doomi na babae, bea abatama sangɔngɔ dja Yesu ko abinga mopɛpɛ ma esendja ɛ nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Tina ɛ asabaleaka boo: «Nga nakabinga etoko esendja ɛ nde, nahelalea.» <verse eid="MAT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Yesu ahombana ko ehole ɛmoenɛ yo abala na nde boo: «Sapingedja, mwana ɔ mbai mwali! Edhimeli ɛ wɛ eoheledjai.» Oko ambuku, mwali ahela.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Ehole ɛimea Yesu ta ndako ɛ kumu, aenɛ babomeli ba ngɔmbi ko emumu ɛ bato ta moyeke monɛnɛ, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />abala na bu boo: «Imanani! Mwana agwiti, ahwɛli.» Endolo bamosɛkɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Ngɔngɔ dja oimana ba bobo osokolu, Yesu aingea ta ekenge ɛ ndako, apea yɛngɛ mwali ta ebɔ ko asaemedja. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Gala ɛ modjɔ mua ɛnangana ta ekenge ena esusu ɛ mokpɔtɔ.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai bato babae ba miiso mago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Ehole ɛdonga Yesu ena, bato babae ba miiso mago bamokimana ena bagame boo: «Lookea ndjokwa, mwana ɔ Davidi!»<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Ehole ɛimea Yesu ta ndako, bato ba miiso mago babatama mbuti na nde ko abahɔdja boo: «Odhimini boo nahɔni okɔ mua imahɔdjakani no?» Bamosɔmbedja boo: «Edii bea, Kumu.» <verse eid="MAT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Bea Yesu abinga miiso ma bobo ko abala boo: «Yɛɛ makɔɔme okimana na edhimeli ɛ boono!» <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Oko ambuku, baenɛ. Bea Yesu abakebedja boo: «Kebani boo moto omɔti atadjeba modjɔ muu mokɔɔmi na nu.» <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Endolo ehole eimana bo bananganedja gala ɛ nde ta ekenge ena ɛ mokpɔtɔ esusu.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai emimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Ena oimana bato bia babae, badoa odii Yesu na moto ona ɔdaka nase dja okumu ba mwembo mobe ko adaka emimi. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Yesu abengana mwembo mua mobe, ko emimi aimea obala. Emumu ɛ bato ɛkamoa ko ɛbala boo: ta Isalalɛlɛ «Lopakitaa enɛ modjɔ moda muu!» <verse eid="MAT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Endolo Bafalusai babala boo: «Edii na ndjia ɛ kpati ɛ kumu ɔ miembo mibe adii obengana miembo mibe!»<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aokei bimumu ndjokwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Yesu adaka adale ta ngando na mabonga masusu; alehaka ta ndako dja miongɔɔnɔ dja Bayuda ko atɔndɔkɔ Mwako Mopele ma Okumu ko aheledjaka bipeko bisusu na biɛmɛ bisusu. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Ehole ɛenɛ yo emumu ɛ bato abaokea ndjokwa, tina ɛ boo bato babenaa ta milema ko badaka na bwɛmbu bonɛnɛ elɛngɛ bhata ibataki mobanyeli. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Abala na batingami ba nde boo: «Gue edii enɛnɛ, endolo basali badii bakɛkɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Bea ongɔɔnɔni moswa gue boo alome basali ta gue ɛ nde.»<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s1">Baapotele doomi na babae</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mal 3, 13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6, 12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Yesu abea batingami ba nde doomi na babae ko abapa kpati ɛ obengana miembo mibe ko ɛ oheledja bipeko bisusu na biɛmɛ bisusu. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Hokea kombe dja batingami bia doomi na babae: ɔ boso Simo, ɔbeaka bo Piɛlɛ, na mwanango Andele; Djake na mwanango Yoani, ibo basusu babae bana ba Zebedai; <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Pilipo na Batelemi; Toma na Matie moputedjeli ɔ puti; Djake mwana ɔ Alefe na Tade; <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simo mosweeli ɔ ngando na Yudasi Isikaliote, ona ɔkaba Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elomu ɛ batingami doomi na babae</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mal 6, 7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9, 1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Edii bato bii doomi na babae ibaloma Yesu ngɔngɔ dja obala na bu na opipo boo: «pɛpɛ okɛni ta bikomi bikina ko pɛpɛ oingeani ta mabonga ma Samalia. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Endolo kɛɛni odii bhata ibabunga ba bato ba Isalɛlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Ngise susu idjinɔlea no, lehani boo: “Okumu ba busa bobatami!” <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Heledjani bato ba bipeko, pusoani bago, sɛnɔdjani bato ba mabha, benganani miembo mibe. Pani ngasa, tina ɛ boo ino koko ɔdihani ngasa. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Pɛpɛ otombani na ɔlɔ, na palata, na falanga ta misenge ma boono; <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />pɛpɛ otombani tɔmbi tina ɛ mwɛngɔ, pɛpɛ mikoto mibae, pɛpɛ otomba sapato, na pango. Tina ɛ boo mosali aboani oyaka ta mosala ma nde.»<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />«Ta ibonga kaoko ta ngando esusu eingealea no, hombani moto ona oboani boo aosɛni ko daani ta ndako ɛ nde mbunoko ehole edongalea no. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Okaingeani ta ndako ena, iseani bato ibatanealea no ena na obala boo: “Yɛɛ ogoo badae na nu.” <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Nga bato ba ndako ena bakabɔngɔ na ogoo bua, yɛɛ ogoo banɛngɛdjae ta tei ɛ bobo; nga bamiti oosɔni, yɛɛ ogoo basɔmbɛ odii no. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Bakalona oosɔni ko ookani, dongani ta ndako kaoko ta ibonga dia ko pupolani mabutu ma bigbota ba boono. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Nabalaka na nu sooti boo: ta iswi la esambi, etumbu ɛ bato ba ibonga kaoko ngando ena edabi epipo onɔɔ etumbu ɛ Sodɔmɔ na Gomɔla.»<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Minɔngɔ ta tei ɛ elomu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mal 13, 9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luk 21, 12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />Naolomakani elɛngɛ bhata ta ndanda ɛ swa. Bea daani na okeba elɛngɛ ndjɔ ko na bwɛli elɛngɛ bimbenga. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Tomangataanani, tina ɛ boo bato baokababini ta tibinalo ko baobomabini pimbo ta ndako dja bobo dja miongɔɔnɔ dja Bayuda. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Baotombabini na ngulu boso ba bagupunɛlɛ na bakumu ta tina ɛ mbai, edabi enɔli tina ɛ boono ɛopaa tati boso ba bobo na bapagano. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Ehole eopundabini boo boso ba balɔndi, pɛpɛ osatungeani na midjɔ ma obala kaoko na moda ma osɔmbɛdja; tina ɛ boo midjɔ miboani no obala mipamabi na nu oko ta ehole ena; <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />editi ino bato babalabi, endolo Mwembo ma Sangwanu abalabi na ndjia ɛ minɔkɔ ma boono. <verse eid="MAT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />Mwɛngɛmoto akababi mwanango bɛngɛ bamoowoe ko sɛngɛmoto akababi mwana ɔ nde bɛngɛ bamoowoe; bana batɔmbɔbi na baboti ba bobo, ko babanɔdjabi ta ogwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Bato basusu baolonabini ta tina ɛ kombe ɛ mbai; endolo moto odabi na ingbangba mbunoko ɔ suka ahelabi. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Ehole eonyɔkɔlɔbini bo ta ibonga imɔti, tiani ta ibonga ikina. Nabalaka na nu sooti boo: obɛtetebini odala ta mabonga masusu ma Isalɛlɛ boso boo Mwana ɔ moto adoe.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />«Motingami tanɔe molehi ɔ nde; mobuli tanɔe moswa nde. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Endolo edii opele motingami adae elɛngɛ molehi ko mobuli adae elɛngɛ moswa nde. Bakabea moswa ndako Belezebulu, edalea moda ndani tina ɛ bato ibadii ta ndako ɛ nde!»<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moto oboani bo obanga</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luk 12, 2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />«Pɛpɛ obangani moto omɔti. Modjɔ mosusu ma mbombi moenɛmɛbi, ko modjɔ mosusu ma pɛpɛ odjebama modjebamabi. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Midjɔ imaotondokɔni mbai hadɛdi ta modidi, mibalani na moi; ko mia imabalaka bo na nu ta itoi, mibalani diko la etondo. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Pɛpɛ obangani bato ibahɔni oowa mokuku endolo batahɔnɔ oowa mwembo; bangani Ndjambe ona ohɔni oowa mokuku engbanga na mwembo ta ipelu. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Tebatɛke basoketele babae na ikota imɔti? Endolo, pɛpɛ omɔti ɔ bobo ohɔni okwa ta kpɔtɔ nga Sangwanu amiti djeba. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Tina ɛ boono, Ndjambe akadjebe noko motwuia ma swee dja boono. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Ta tina ɛna pɛpɛ obangani: ino onɔini basoketele na motswuia!»<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Odhima mabunga kaoko oingaana Yesu Klisto</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luk 12, 8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />«Moto mosusu oopalea tati boso ba bato boo adii moto ɔ mbai, mbai koko napalea tati boso ba Tata oodii ta busa boo adii tina ɛ mbai; <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />endolo moto oinganaaleani ta miso ma bato, mbai koko namoinganaalea boso ba Tata ona odii odiko.»<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Titi ogoo endolo mopata</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luk 12, 51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14, 26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />«Pɛpɛ olɛdjani boo nadoa tina ɛ olwɛni ogoo ta ngondo: naiolwɛni ogoo, endolo mopata. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Nadoa aisa mabɔtɔ ta ndanda ɛ mwana moomi nɔbɔ sango, mwana mwali nɔbɔ nango, mwali ɔ moki nɔbɔ okio ba nde mwali; <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Baloni ba moto badabi oko bato ba ibota la nde. <verse eid="MAT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />Moto okapale sango kaoko nango onɔ mbai aboaniti odaa moto ɔ mbai; moto okapale mwana ɔ nde moomi kaoko mwana ɔ nde mwali onɔ mbai abaoniti odaa moto ɔ mbai. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Moto mosusu odii pɛpɛ otomba ekulusu ɛ nde tina ɛ okimanani aboaniti odaa moto ɔ mbai. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Moto ona ɔpalaka obanyea mohelo ma nde amobungedjalea; endolo moto obungedjalea mohelo ma nde tina ɛ mbai amodihalea koko.»<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ona oosini aosini</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mal 9, 41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />«Moto oosini aosini; ko ona oosini aosi ona ɔlomani. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Moto oosɔbi motɛli tina ɛ boo adii motɛli, adihabi iputi moda momɔti na motɛli; ko moto oosi moto ɔ odjoo tina ɛ boo adii na odjoo adihabi iputi moda momɔti na moto ɔ odjoo. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Nabalaka na nu, edii sooti: moto mosusu oopabi noko kɔbɔ ɛ madiba ma piɔ odii omɔti ɔ bana bii bakɛkɛ tina ɛ boo badii batingami ba mbai adihabi iputi la nde.»<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s1">Balomami ba Yoani Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luk 7, 18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Ehole ebɛtɛ Yesu obala na batingami ba nde doomi na babae, adonga ena, akɛɛ aleha ko ananganedja Mwako Mopele ta mabonga ma bobo.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Yoani Mobatisi adaka ta bolɔkɔ, aoka gala ɛ midjɔ misusu imakɔkɔ Klisto. Bea aloma batingami ba nde <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />ahɔdja Yesu boo: «Odii Masia hoo ɔboanaka odoa kaoko laombe okina?» <verse eid="MAT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Kɛɛni atɔndɔe Yoani midjɔ imieni no ko imioki no: <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />bato ibagwa miiso baeni, bitumbɛ badali, bato ba mabha baheli, bato ibagwa matoyi baoki, bago bapusoi ko Mwako Mopele motɔndɔmi odii bakwali. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Sepi odii moto oodabi pɛpɛ odumba edhimeli ɛ nde diko la mbai.»<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Ehole ɛyana batingami ba Yoani, Yesu abanda obala diko la Yoani odii bato boo: «Modjɔ mokɛki no aindja ta esobe nda? Mososongo imakumanaka na epoipoi ngise susu? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Bea eka ekɛki no aindja nda? Moto ona olwali bisendja bipele? Endolo bato ibakalwae bisendja bipele bakadae ta ndako dja bakumu. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Ekɛki no aindja ta esobe yee? Motɛli? Sooti, nabalaka na nu, anɔi noko motɛli. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Tina ɛ boo Yoani adii moto obala bo ta Makomi boo: “Nalomabi molomami boso ba wɛ bɛngɛ boo aobɔngedjae ndjia.” <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Nabali na nu sooti boo: ta ndanda ɛ bato ibabotama na mwali, pɛpɛ omɔti onɔi Yoani Mobatisi na onɛnɛ; tina ɛ boo, moto odii mokɛkɛ ta Okumu ba busa anɔi Yoani Mobatisi na onɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Donga ehole ɛdaka Yoani mobatisi aleha mbunoko hadɛdi, oingea ta Okumu ba busa edii modjɔ ma ingbangba ko edii oko bato ibaonaka ta edhimeli bahɔni oingea oho. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Na bea batɛli basusu na Mobeko batɛlɛ mbunoko Yoani. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Ko nga okahɔnɔni odhima bea, djebani boo Yoani adii Elia ona ɔboanaka boo adoe. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Yɛɛ boo, ona odii na matoi ma ooka aoke!»<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />«Ona ndani oboani na mbai okoanedja bato ba ehole hee? Bakoani na bana bakɛkɛ ibadii ta esika ɛ masaka ma bato bike ko badii ogama odii bakina boo: <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />“Lobomeini piololo endolo obuitini ko loembeakini biembo ba kɔndɔ endolo oyeitini!” <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Tina ɛ boo, Yoani adoa, aiya, aimwa ko babalaka boo: “adii na mwembo mobe ta tei ɛ nde!” <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Mwana ɔ moto adoa, ayaka, amwa endolo babala boo: “Adii na mohweo ko adii momwɛli ɔ mana, mopalani ɔ baputedjeli ba puti na bato ba masumu!” Endolo owɛi ba Ndjambe bodii oenɛmɛ sooti ta misala ma nde.»<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mabonga imalona odhima</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luk 10, 13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Bea Yesu apɛlɛ mabonga imakɔɔ yo midjɔ ma okamoa mike, tina ɛ boo bato ba mu baisɔmbɔtɔnɔ. Abala boo: <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />«Ndjokwa tina ɛ wɛ, Koladjini! Ndjokwa tina ɛ wɛ, Betesaida! Tina ɛ boo nga midjɔ ma okamoa imakɔɔmɔ odii no makɔɔmɔ ta Tula na Sidona, eke basɔmbɔtɔnɔ milema ehele ko balwa ngɔtɔ na osasua mihulu. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Na bea, nabalaka na nu boo, ta iswi la esambi etumbu ɛ boono edabi epipo onɔ etumbu ɛ Tula na Sidona. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Ko wɛ, Kapalanauma, olɛdjaka boo oihwedjamabi mbunoko odiko? Pɛpɛ. Otitedjamabi mbunoko ngando ɛ bago. Tina ɛ boo midjɔ ma okamoa imakɔɔmɔ ta tei ɛ wɛ makɔɔmɔ ta Sɔdɔmɔ eke Sɔdɔmɔ adii oko busabu. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Ta tina ena, nabalaka na nu boo, ta busa ba esambi, etumbu ɛ wɛ edabi epipo onɔ etumbu ɛ Sɔdɔmɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abei bato ibadii na mina</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luk 10, 21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Ta ehole ena, Yesu agama boo: O Tata, Kumu ɔ busa na kpɔtɔ, naosakoi tina ɛ boo oenɛmɛdjai odii bato ibakɛkɛkɛ midjɔ imabombea wɛ bato ba owɛi ko na bato ba ɛdjebeli. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Bea, Tata, ɔpala boo ɛdae bea.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />Tata apani leka losusu. Moto atadjeba Mwana dongedja oko Tata, ko pɛpɛ moto ɔdjebaka Tata dongedja oko Mwana ko na ona osepi na Mwana omoenɛmɛdja.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />«Doani odii mbai ino bato basusu baembi na mina ma mandi ko naopaleani iheme. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Tombani mosɔngɔ ma mbai, molwani ko ikoani na mbai tina ɛ boo nadii moto ɔ molema ma bwɛli ko ma osatitedja, bea miembo ma boono midihalea iheme. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Sooti, mosɔngɔ ma mbai moditi na djɔɔlɔ ta olwa ko mandi ma mbai madii na ohahanu.»<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ko sabata</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mal 2, 23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6, 1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Ta ehole ena, Yesu anɔɔ ta gue dja ndongo busa ba sabata. Batingami ba nde baoka ndja; babanga obuka ndongo ko odjiya. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Ehole ɛenɛ Bafalusai bea, babala na Yesu boo: «Hokea, batingami ba wɛ bakɔkɔ modjɔ imasiama okɔɔmɔ ta iswi la sabata!» <verse eid="MAT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Opakitalangani oko midjɔ imakɔɔ Davidi ehole ɛdaka yo na ndja engbanga na bato ibadalaka na nde? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Moda imaingɛa yo ta ndako ɛ Ndjambe ko yo engbanga na bato ibadalaka na nde baya mapa imabudjeama; ena bea ɛdae yo kaoko bato ba nde pɛpɛ ɔboanaka omaya dongedja oko Banganga ba Ndjambe. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Kaoko opakitalangani ta Mobeko boo ta iswi la sabata, Banganga ba Ndjambe ibakasale ta tepelo baisuma mobeko ma sabata, endolo baikwa ta ibunga ta tina ena? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Bea, mbai nabalaka na nu boo, edii haa na moto omɔti oonɔi tepelo na onɛnɛ! <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Nga okɔki no sipoa tingo ɛ ebaeli hee: “Nakasepe na molema ma ndjokwa onɔ mbeka”, okɔkitini dumba bato bii na ikambo tina ɛ boo bakoiti obe. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Tina ɛ boo Mwana ɔ moto adii Kumu ɔ sabata.»<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai moto ɔgwa ebɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mal 3, 1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6, 6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Ɔdonga Yesu ena, akɛɛ ta ndako ɛ miɔngɔɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Moto omɔti ɔgwa ebɔ adaka oho. Bafalisai bapalaka bapunde Yesu, ta tina ena bamohɔdja boo: «Mobeko ma booso mapa ndjia ɛ ɔheledja bato ta iswi la sabata?» <verse eid="MAT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Nga omɔti ta ndanda ɛ boono akadaa oko na bhata omɔti ko bhata ona akwii ta mombɔndɔ ma mbɛngɛ ta iswi la sabata, atamodubodja? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Moto adii na motwuia monɛnɛ onɔ bhata! Bea, Mobeko ma booso mapaka enɔli ɛ okɔɔ opele ta iswi la sabata.» <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Bea Yesu abala na moto ona boo: «Ninodja ebɔ ɛ wɛ.» Moto ona aninodja ebɔ ɛ nde ko ebɔ ena ɛhela elengɛɛ ena ekina. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Bafalusai baimana ko basabolea tina ɛ ohomba ndjia ɛ oowa Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu mosali ɔhɔɔ Ndjambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Ehole ɛdjeba Yesu boo bahombaka bamoowoe, adonga ena ko emumu ɛ bato ɛmokimana. Aheledja bato ba bipeko basusu, <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />endolo abasia na ngulu boo batabala tina ɛ nde. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Akɔɔ bea bɛngɛ boo ebaeli ɛ motɛli Isaya ɛkokedjame:<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />«Hokea mosali ɔ mbai ɔhɔɔ mbai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">ona okapale mbai ko ona okasepedjaeni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Naisaalea Mwembo ma mbai diko la nde</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">ko alehalea osooti ta bikomi ba bakɛndɛli.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Asoetebi ko agametebi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:19">baoketebi moholi ma nde ta ndjia.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Abuketebi mososongo imaimbama</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">ko adimeetebi moinda imapalaka madimee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">Akɔbi bea mbunoko odjoo balonge;<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />ko bikomi bisusu ba bakɛndɛli balɛndɛbi ta kombe ɛ nde.»<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abengani miembo mibe</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 3:22-30">Mal 3, 22-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11, 14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Balwɛɛ Yesu moto omɔti ɔ miso mago ko emimi ona ɔdaka nase dja okumu ba miembo mibe. Yesu aheledja moto ona, aimea obala ko oenɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Bato basusu bakamoa ko babala boo: «Moto hoo aditi mwana ɔ Davidi?» <verse eid="MAT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Ehole eoka Bafalusai midjɔ mia, babala boo: «Moto hoo abenganaka miembo mibe oko na kpati ɛ Belezebulu, kumu ɔ miembo mibe!» <verse eid="MAT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Ɔdjeba Yesu malɛi ma bobo, abala na bu boo: Okumu bosusu ibobɔtɔi ta tei ɛ bu botanɛngɛdja. Ibonga kaoko ibota ilibɔtɔi ta tei ɛ lu itanɛngɛdja. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Nga Satana akabengana Satana, asaonedjaka yo mɛɛnɛ. Bea moda ndani okumu ba nde bonɛngɛdjalea? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Ko nga mbai nakabengana miembo mibe na kpati ɛ Belezebulu, batingami ba boono bakamibengane na kpati ɛ nda? Ta tina ena, batingami ba boono badalea ibo mɛɛnɛ badjudji ba boono! <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Nga nabengana miembo mibe na kpati ɛ Mwembo ma Ndjambe, einedjaka boo Okumu ba busa bodoi mbunoko odii no.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />«Moda ndani moto ahɔni oingea ta ndako ɛ moto ɔ ngulu, ko atombi leka la nde, pɛpɛ opeta monanga mbɔti? Edii ta ehole ena apundjalea ndako ɛ nde. <verse eid="MAT 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />Moto odii pɛpɛ odaa engbanga na mbai adii moloni ɔ mbai; ko moto odii pɛpɛ okɔmedjani na oputoanedja akananganedjae. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Na bea, nabali nanu sooti boo: masumu masusu ko matsio masusu mayɛɛmebi odii bato; endolo itsio isusu la Mwembo iyɛɛmetebi. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Moto mosusu obalabi obe tina ɛ Mwana ɔ moto ayɛɛmɛbi; endolo moto mosusu obalabi obe na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ayɛɛmetebi ɛdae ta mohelo ma nde ma ehole hee kaoko ma ehole eduake.»<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mole na mbuma dja mu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luk 6, 43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />«Mole mopele mokabote oko mbuma djipele, mole mobe, mokabote oko mbuma djibe. Tina ɛ boo mole mokadjebame oko na mbuma dja mu. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Ibota la mabate! Moda ndani ohɔnini obala midjɔ mipele, ena bea odiini bato babe? Tina ɛ boo midjɔ imaimanaka ta monɔkɔ mikadonge ta molema. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Moto mopele akabale midjɔ mipele imikadonge ta molema ma nde; moto mobe akabale midjɔ mibe imikadonge ta molema ma nde. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />Nabalaka na nu boo: ta iswi la esambi, bato basambabi tina ɛ bibaeli ba bobo ba pɛpɛ tina ibaimanedjaka bo. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Tina ɛ boo edii na ndjia ɛ ebaeli ɛ wɛ mɛɛnɛ oboani olonga kaoko okwa.»<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Embete ɛ Yona</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mal 8, 11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luk 11, 29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Bea ekenge ɛ bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko ko Bafalusai babala na Yesu boo: «Molehi, lapalaka oloinedjae embete emɔti ɛ midjɔ ma okamoa.» <verse eid="MAT 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Yesu abasɔmbedja boo: «Bato ba yangola hee, badii bato babe ko bataki isuma ta miso ma Ndjambe, endolo bahɔdjaka embete ɛ midjɔ ma okamoa, endolo pɛpɛ embete emɔti epamalea na bu dongedja oko embete ɛ motɛli Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Tina ɛ boo, moda madaka Yona ta sɔpɔ dja moswi monɛnɛ maswi masato ko bulu isato, moda momɔti Mwana ɔ moto akɔbi maswi masato ko bulu isato ta nase dja kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Ta iswi la esambi, bato ba Niniwe baemabi ko baleneabi bato ba yangola hee etumbu, tina ɛ boo bato ba Niniwe basɔmbɔtɔnɔ milema ma bobo ehole ɛoka bo Yona aleha. Ko moto onɔi Yona adii haa! <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Ta iswi la esambi, kumu mwali ɔ Sudi aemabi engbanga na bato ba yangola hee ko abaleneabi etumbu, tina ɛ boo adonga ta suka ɛ ngondo adoa tina ɛoka bibaeli ba owɛi ba Sɔlɔmɔ. Ko moto onɔi Sɔlɔmɔ adii haa!»<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Osɔmbɔ ba mwembo mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luk 11, 24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />«Ehole eimani mwembo mobe odii moto, mokakɛɛ alebalebe ta bisobe ahomba esika ɛ ohema. Endolo momitidiha esika ena, <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />bea mosabalealea boo: “Enɔi na opele osɔmbɔ ta ndako ena ɛkina mbai.” Mokasɔmbɔ motanei ndako ena bwase, eombɔmɔke ko ebɔngedjamake. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Mokɛlea koko atomba miembo mikina sambo imimonɔi na obila; basɔmbi engbanga adaa ta ndako. Bea, mohelo ma moto ona moimeabi mobe onɔɔ moda imadaka mo boso. Edabi oko bea tina ɛ bato babe ba yangola hee.»<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nɛngɛ ɛ Yesu na bana ba nango</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mal 3, 31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8, 19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Ena ɔdaka Yesu abala na bato, nango na bana ba nango baami badaka baemi osokolu. Ko bahombaka basoole na nde. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Bea moto omɔti atɔndɔɔ Yesu boo: «Ngwao na bana ba ngwao baami baemi osokolu ko bahombaka basoole na wɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Odii inga nda? Badii bana ba inga ba nda?» <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Bea Yesu ainedja ebɔ ɛ nde ngise ɛdaka batingami ba nde ko abala boo: «Hokea: Inga na bana ba inga ibibi. <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Tina ɛ boo moto okakɔe opala ba Tata ona odii ta busa adii mwanainga, ngɛnɛ kaoko inga.»<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la mooneli</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mal 4, 1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8, 4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Oko ta iswi dia, Yesu aimana ta ndako ko akɛɛ adaa ta ekulu ɛ ibeke inɛnɛ tina ɛ oleha. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Emumu ɛ bato bamohika, Yesu atitea ta bwato ko adaa otei ba bu. Bato basusu badika ena baemi ta ekulu. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Abala na bu midjɔ mike na ndjia ɛ mandjɛ ko abala na bu boo: «Iswi imɔti, mooneli omɔti akɛɛ aona ta gue ɛ nde. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Ena ɔdaka yo aona, kona ikina djakwa mbuti na ndjia: mbulu badjiyaka. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Ikina djakwa ta esika ɛ ndeke ena kpɔtɔ djaidaka inɛnɛ. Kona djatɔɔ pɛpɛlɛ tina ɛ boo kpɔtɔ djaidaka na mbɛngɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Ehole ɛimana moi, matumba kona: tina ɛ boo djaidaka na nginga. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Ikina kona djakwa ta mele ma ndjubɛ. Ndjubɛ djakandoa ko djadjikamamedja. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Endolo ikina djakwa ta mokpɔtɔ mopele ko djabota mbuma: ikina kona djabota mbuma mokama momɔti, ikina tuku isamano ko ikina tuku isato.» <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Ko Yesu abakea boo: «Moto odii na matoi ma ooka, aoke!»<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tina ekabale Yesu na mandjɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mal 4, 10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8, 9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Batingami babatama na Yesu ko bamohɔdja boo: «Tina ndani ɔbalaka na bu na mandjɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Ndjambe aopini, ino, edjebeli ɛ midjɔ ma mbombi ma Okumu ba busa endolo ɛipama na moto mosusu. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Tina ɛ boo moto odii na eka bamopalea koko bɛngɛ aimee na lu luke; endolo moto odii pɛpɛ odaa na eka bamokatoalea noko okɛkɛ bopeli yo. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Hokeani tina ɛbalaka mbai na bu na mandjɛ: tina ɛ boo badii na miso ko tebaenɛ, bakaoke ko tebasipoe. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Ebaeli ɛ motɛli Isaya ta tina ɛ bobo ekokedjami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">“Ookabini opele, osipoetebini;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">ohokeabini opele, oenɛtebini.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Tina ɛ boo milema ma bato bii maapinga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">baditea matoi ma bobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">badipa miiso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">bɛngɛ boo bataɛnɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">badipa matoi ma bobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">bɛngɛ basaka sipoa ta milema ma bobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">badae pɛpɛ osɔmbɔtɔnɔ milema</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">ko nabaheledjae.”»<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />«Endolo ino, daani bato ba sepi: tina ɛ boo miiso ma boono maenɛkɛ ko matoi ma boono maokaka! <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Nabalaka na nu, sooti boo: batɛli bike ko bato bike ba milema mipele badaka na posa oenɛ midjɔ mii imaenɛkɛ no, endolo baimienɛ, ko baoke midjɔ imaokakano, endolo baimioka.»<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atingodjai indjɛ la mooneli</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mal 4, 13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8, 11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />«Okani tingo ɛ indjɛ la mooneli. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Nga moto akaoka ebaeli ɛ Okumu ko ayesipoiti, Satana akadoe adongedja midjɔ imaonama ta molema ma moto ona: Ena edii tingo ɛ kona idjakwa ta mokpɛngɔ ma ndjia. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Mbuma idjakwa ta mokpɔtɔ ma ndeke edii moto ooki ebaeli ko ayeɔsi na sepi. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Endolo aditi na nginga dja edhimeli, anɛngɛdjalea oko maa ehole mokɛkɛ. Bea, ehole ɛ monɔngɔ kaoko ɛ omekama ekaimea ta tina ɛ ebaeli ɛ Ndjambe, asundolalea edhimeli ambuku. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Mbuma idjakwa ta mele ma ndjubɛ: edii moto ooki ebaeli, endolo posa ɛ ngondo na posa ɛ odiheli ikamamedjai ebaeli ta tei ɛ nde, bea atabota mbuma. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Mbuma idjakwa ta mokpɔtɔ mopele: edii moto ooki ebaeli ko ayesipoi opele; bea abotalea mbuma, mokama momɔti, dɔngɔ ikina tuku isamano ko dɔngɔ ikina koko tuku isato.»<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la mondjani mobe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yesu abala na bu indjɛ ikina boo: «Okumu ba busa bokoani na moto ooni kona djipele ta gue ɛ nde. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Endolo, ehole ɛhwɛɛ bato basusu, moloni ɔ nde adoa ko aona ndjani djibe ta gue ɛ nde ɛ ndongo ko akɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Ehole ɛbanga ndongo otɔɔ ko oimanedja mingbɔndu, ndjani djibe djakandoa koko. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Basali ba moswa gue badua ko babala na nde boo: “Kumu, wɛ ɔiona kona ipele ta gue ɛ wɛ: bea odongi ndjani dji ibe hɔɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Moswa gue abasɔmbɛdja boo: “Edii moloni moto okɔi bea.” Bea basali bamohɔdja boo: “ɔpalaka lakɛɛ abikoa ndjani djia ibe?” <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Moswa gue abasɔmbɛdja, pɛpɛ, tina ɛ boo okadongedjani ndjani ibe ohɔnini koko obikoa ndongo engbanga na dju. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Kinani djakandoe isusu engbanga mbunoko ehole ɛ obuka mbuma, ta ehole ena, nabalalea na bato ibabukaka mbuma boo: Dongedjani boso ndjani ibe, djinangani bibolo ko djitumbani, endolo bukani ndongo ko djiboleani ta ebombelo ɛ mbai.»<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la mbuma ɛ sinapi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mal 4, 30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13, 18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Yesu abala na bu indjɛ ikina boo: «Okumu ba busa bokoani na kona ɛ sinapi ɛtomba moto omɔti ko ayeona ta gue ɛ nde. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Kona ena enɔi kona isusu na okɛkɛ; endolo ehole ekandoa yo, ɛnɔɔ ndjua susu dja gue na oyai ko na onɛnɛ: ɛimea mole ma bitape binɛnɛ ibikadoe mbulu ayoa meepu ma bobo.»<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la nɛngɛɛ mapa</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luk 13, 20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yesu abala indjɛ ikina boo: «Okumu ba busa bokoani na nɛngɛ mapa ɛtomba mwali ko aputoanedja na biidjɛli bisato ba falini mbunoko pɔtɔpɔtɔ ɛhuula.»<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eleho na ndjia ɛ mandjɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mal 4, 33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Yesu alehaka na mandjɛ tina ɛ obala midjɔ mia misusu odii bato; ko ehole esusu abalaka na bu oko mandjɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Abalaka bea bɛngɛ boo bibaeli ba motɛli bakokedjame:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">«Nadipoabi monɔkɔ tina ɛ obala na mandjɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">Natɛlɛbi midjɔ ma mbombi donga ibange la ngondo.»<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atingodjai indjɛ la mondjani mobe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Bea Yesu akina emumu ɛ bato ko aingea ta ndako. Batingami ba nde badua odii yo ko bamohodja boo: «Lotingodja indjɛ la mondjani mobe ta gue.» <verse eid="MAT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Mooneli ɔ kona epele, edii Mwana ɔ moto; <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />gue, edii ngondo; kona ipele edii bana ba Okumu ba busa; ndjani ibe edii bana ba Satana; <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />moloni ona ɔonaka ndjani ibe, edii Satana; ehole ɛ obuka mbuma, edii suka ɛ ngondo; ko bato ibabukaka mbuma, edii babwɛndi. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Moda mokabikoe bo ndjani ibe ko mokadjitumbe bo ta mosa, edii oko moda mua imodabi ta suka ɛ ngondo: <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Mwana ɔ moto alomabi babwɛndi ba nde, badongedjabi ta Okumu ba nde leka losusu lokalome bato bakɔe masumu na bato ibakakɔe obe, <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />babadumbabi ta ipombe la mosa esika edabi bo bayea ko bakpɛkɛnɛ miino. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Bea bato ba odjoo bangɛngɛbi elɛngɛ diiso la busa ta Okumu ba Sangwabu. Yɛɛ boo moto odii na matoi ma ooka, aoke!»<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la odiheli iba mbombi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />Okumu ba busa bokoani na odiheli ibabomba bo ta gue. Moto omɔti aboeni ko abobombi koko. Na sepi ena boo akɛlea atɛkɛ leka la nde losusu bɛngɛ asombe gue ena.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />«Okumu ba busa bokoani koko na motɛki ɔ leka ona ohombaka mayaka mapele. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Akaenɛ mayaka ma motwuia monɛnɛ, akɛlea atɛkɛ leka la nde losusu bɛngɛ amasombe.»<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la ehea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />«Okumu ba busa bokoani koko na ehea ena ekadumbe bo ta ibeke inɛnɛ ko etɛdjai swi ba mindumba na mindumba. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Ekaluma, baowoli ba swi bayedubodjai o ngondo, badalea ko baisalea swi bapele ta ngombe ko badumbalea ibabe. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Edabi oko moda mua ta suka ɛ ngondo: babwɛndi badoabi akaana bato babe ta ndanda ɛ bato ba odjoo <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />bea badumbabi bato babe ta ipombe la mosa mopipo oho bayeabi ko bakpɛkɛnɛbi miino.»<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Odiheli ba yanie ko boyou</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Yesu ahɔdja batingami ba nde boo: «Osipoini midjɔ mii misusu?» Bamosɔmbɛdja boo, «Edii bea». <verse eid="MAT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Bea abala na bu boo: «Moto mosusu ɔ edjebeli ɛ mibeko ona oimea motingami ɔ midjɔ ma Okumu ba busa akoani na moswa ndako ona oimanedja ta ebombelo ɛ nde odiheli ba yanie na iboyou.»<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bato ba Nasaleta baloni odhima Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mal 6, 1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4, 16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Ngɔngɔ dja Yesu obala mandjɛ mia, adonga ta esika ena <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />ko asɔmbɔ ta ibonga ilakandoa yo. Aimea oleha ta ndako ɛ miongɔɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda ko bato basusu bakamoa. Babala boo: «Ohulaka owɛi buu ba nde hɔɔ? Moda ndani akɔkɔ midjɔ ma okamoa? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Hoo titi mwana ɔ mosali ɔ mabaya? Malia titi nango? Djake, Yosepu, Simo nɔbɔ Yuda titi bana ba nango baami? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Ko bangɛnɛ basusu baditi nasu haa engbanga? Odihi yo kpati hee esusu hɔɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Bea adaka ibaku tina ɛ odhima ba bobo. Yesu abala na bu boo: «Motɛli akatiolame oko ta ngando ɛ nde ko ta ibota la nde.» <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Yesu akɔɔ midjɔ ma okamoa mikɛkɛ ena tina ɛ boo baidaka na odhima.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ogwa ba Yoani Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mal 6, 14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9, 7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Ta ehole ena, gala ɛ Yesu ɛnangana na ngulu ko ɛimea ta matoi ma Elode, kumu ɔ Galilai. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Abala na basali ba nde boo: «Edii Yoani Mobatisi: apusoi ta ndanda ɛ bago! Ta tina ena adii na kpati ɛ okɔ midjɔ ma okamoa.»<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Tina ɛ boo, Elode apa ndjia bapee Yoani, bamonange mbɔti ko bamomae ta bɔlɔkɔ. Ta ɛlɔkɔ ɛ Elodiade, mwali ɔ mwanango moomi Pilipo. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Tina ɛ Yoani abalaka na Elode boo: «Oditi na enɔli ɛ omotomba elɛngɛɛ mwali!» <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Bea Elode ahombaka ndjia ɛ owa Yoani, endolo abangaka bato, tina ɛ boo batombaka Yoani elɛngɛɛ motɛli. <verse eid="MAT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Bea, ta iswi la tɛkɛ ɛ obotama ba Elode, mwana mwali ɔ Elodiade abua boso ba bato ibabeama ta tɛkɛ. Asepedja Elode obuke <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />ko alena seleka ɛ omopa eka esusu ehɔdjalea yo. <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Na pangolaki ɛ nango, ko mwana abala na Elode boo: «Pani hadɛdi molo ma Yoani Mobatisi ta saani!» <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Kumu aoka ndjokwa enɛnɛ ta molema; endolo ta diko la seleka elena yo ko ta tina ɛ bato ibabea yo ta tɛkɛ, apa enɔli boo bamopɛ mo. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Aloma moto boo akɛɛ alena molo ma Yoani Mobatisi ta bɔlɔkɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Badoa na molo ta saani, bamopa odii mwana mwali ko amolwɛɛ nango. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Batingami ba Yoani badoa atomba ndjemba ɛ nde ko bakɛɛ ayepusea; ko bakɛɛ atɔndɔɔ Yesu midjɔ misusu imanɔɔ.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayedjai bato koto itano</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mal 6, 30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9, 10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoa 6, 1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Ehole ɛoka Yesu gala ena, atitea ta bwato ko akɛɛ ta esika ehɔni yo oda yo mɛɛnɛ. Ko ena ɔoka bato bea; badonga ta mabonga ma bobo ko bamokimana ena badale ta ekulu ɛ dua. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Ehole ɛduboa Yesu ta bwato, aenɛ emumu ɛ bato; ko abaokea ndjokwa enɛnɛ bea abanga oheledja bana ba bangwabu ibadaka na bipeko. <verse eid="MAT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Mɔkɔmɔkɔ, batingami babatama na nde ko babala boo: «Esika hee edii esobe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Esobe ɛtingodjaka boo: esika ekadae bato pɛpɛ oda</char></note> ko busa botiti. Bea yanedja bato bɛngɛ bakɛɛ asasombea mia ma oya ta ngando idja mbuti.» <verse eid="MAT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Baditi na tina ɛ okɛ oho; ino mɛɛnɛ bapani mia ma oya!» <verse eid="MAT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Batingami bamosɔmbedja boo: «Lodii oko na mapa matano na swi babae.» <verse eid="MAT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Yesu abala boo: «Doani na lu haa.» <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Yesu apa enɔli odii bato boo badae ta ndjani; atomba mapa matano na swi bia babae, angangodja miso odiko ko asakoa Ndjambe. Abuka mapa mia ko apa bikengakengi bia odii batingami ba nde bɛngɛ babikaane odii bato. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Bato basusu baya ko bagola. Bea batingami batuta bikengakengi ibadikaa ko balumedja mapole doomi na mabae. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Bato ibaya badaka mbuti na baami koto itano, pɛpɛ olanga bali na bana.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adali diko la madiba</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mal 6, 45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yoa 6, 15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Ambuku, Yesu aloma batingami ba nde boo batitee ta bwato ko bakɛɛ boso ba nde ta dɔngɔ ikina la dua, bɛngɛ yo mɛɛnɛ ayanedjae emumu ɛ bato. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Ngɔngɔ dja nde oyanedja bato, aihwea ta ikoli bɛngɛ aongɔɔne. Ɔimea mɔkɔmɔkɔ, adaka ena, oko yo buki; <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />bwato baimea ohali na ibongu, ko mula makumana bwato na ngulu, elɔkɛ lungu ɛdaka ɛsɔmbɛdja bwato ongɔngɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Ta eyɛ ɛ busa, Yesu adala diko la madiba bɛngɛ abakinane. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Ehole ɛenɛ batingami Yesu adale diko la madiba, bayeketana ko babala boo: «Edii mongɔli!» Ko bagama na bɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Endolo ambuku Yesu abala na bu boo: «Sapingedjani, edii mbai, pɛpɛ odani na bɔɔ!» <verse eid="MAT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Piɛlɛ abala na nde boo: «Kumu, nga ekadaa wɛ sooti, bala na mbai nadoe asaka na wɛ diko la madiba.» <verse eid="MAT 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Doa!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 14:29">Mbala emɔti Piɛlɛ aduboa ta bwato ko adala diko la madiba bɛngɛ akɛɛ asaka na Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Endolo ehole ɛenɛ yo lungu epipo, abanga. Ko ena ɔbanga yo odinda ta madiba agama boo: «Kumu, heledjani!» <verse eid="MAT 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Ambuku, Yesu aninodja ebɔ, amopea ko abala na nde boo: «Moto ɔ edhimeli ekɛkɛ! Tina ebomi na wɛ kitɛ nda?» <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Batitea ibo basusu babae ta bwato ko lungu ɛsia. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Bato basusu ibadaka ta bwato bakwa magunda boso ba Yesu ko babala na nde boo: «Sooti mɛɛnɛ odii Mwana ɔ Ndjambe!»<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai bato ba bipeko ta Genesalɛte</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mal 6, 53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Ngɔngɔ dja bobo okatisa dua baimea ta mokpɔtɔ ma Genesalɛte. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Ehole ɛdjeba bato ba esika ena boo edii Yesu, bananganedja gala ɛ nde ta ngando dja mbuti mbuti ko badoa na bato basusu ba bipeko. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Bamongɔɔnɔ boo apɛ bikɔnɛ enɔli boo babinge noko mopɛpɛ ma mokoto ma nde; ko bato basusu ibamobinga bahela ta bipeko ba bobo.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Bileho ba okɔkɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mal 7, 1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Bafalusai na bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko ibadonga ta Yelusalɛmɛ badoa odii Yesu ko babala na nde boo: <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />«Tina ndani batingami ba wɛ tebasume okɔkɔ ba booso? Tina ɛ boo tebasose mabɔ mabobo boso baoya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hokea koko Luk 11, 38.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Bea ko ino, tina ndani tosumeni mibeko ma Ndjambe endolo okasumeni oko okɔkɔ ba boono? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Tina ɛ Ndjambe abala boo: “Suma sangwao na ngwao”, na koko boo: “moto ona olakedjai sango na nango aboani na etumbu ɛ ogwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hokea koko Oim 20, 12 ko Det 5, 16; Oim 21, 17 ko Lew 20, 9.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Endolo ino okaleheni boo: moto ona obali na sango kaoko na nango boo: “Ekɔmɛdjɛli epalaki mbai naopɛ, nayepi elengɛɛ epeeli odii Ndjambe”, <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />abukiti mobeko ma opa nango na sango isuma. Na moda mua odiini oimedjaa ebaeli ɛ Ndjambe ngasa bɛngɛ oihwedjaeni okɔkɔ ba boono! <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Bato ba owɛi bobe! Isaya atɛlɛ opele mɛɛnɛ ta tina ɛ boono:<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />Bato bii bakasumeni etoko na eposo ɛ monɔkɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:8">endolo milema ma bobo midii ohali na mbai.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Miongɔɔnɔ mika ongɔɔneni bo midii etoko ma ngasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:9">tina ɛ bileho ba bobo bidii oko mibeko ma bato.»<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Midjɔ imikaimedjae moto mbindo</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mal 7, 14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Yesu abea emumu ɛ bato ena ko abala na bu boo: «Okani ko sipoani midjɔ mii: <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Eka ekaingee ta monɔkɔ ma moto temoimedjae mbindo. Endolo edii wɛte eka ena ekaimane ta monɔkɔ ekaimedjae moto mbindo.» <verse eid="MAT 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Bea batingami basabatea mbuti na Yesu ko babala na nde boo: «Otadjebaka boo kɔpɛ djibali wɛ itɛdjai Bafalusai ibaku?» <verse eid="MAT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Kona esusu ɛdaa Tata ɔ mbai odii odiko pɛpɛ oona ebikoamalea. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Bakinani: edii bato ba miso mago ibadaledjaka bato bakina ba miso mago! Ko nga moto ogwa miso akadaledja mina nde okina ogwa miso, ibo basusu babae bakweala ta mombɔndɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Piɛlɛ atomba kɔpɛ ko abala na Yesu boo: «Lotingodja indjɛ dii.» <verse eid="MAT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yesu abala boo: «Ino koko odiini, pɛpɛ owɛi? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Otasipoakani boo eka esusu ekaingee ta monɔkɔ ekakɛɛ ta sɔpɔ ko ngɔngɔ ekadumbame ta ibela? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Endolo ena ekaimane ta monɔkɔ ekadonge ta molema, ko yo ekaimedjae moto mbindo. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Tina ɛ boo malɛi mabe makadonge ta molema imaka molome ta oowa, ta bɔɔli, ta ndukeli, ta iba, ta tati ɛ epulu na masingi odii bamina nde. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Hokea midjɔ imikaimedjae moto mbindo! Endolo oyaka pɛpɛ ososa mabɔ boso, teimedjae moto mbindo.»<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwali mokɛndeli adhimi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mal 7, 24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Yesu adonga ena ko akɛɛ ta ekenge ɛ mokpɔtɔ ɛ Tula na Sidona. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Mwali omɔti ɔ Kanana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kombe ena ɛ mwali ɔ Kanana ɛinedjaka mwali ona ɔdaka ɔ baswa ngando ta ekenge ɛ mokpɔtɔ ma Fenisia. Noko akadaa mwali ɔ pɛpɛ odaa Moyuda etasiaka boo adae pɛpɛ ooka babala ta tina ɛ Yesu.</char></note> ɔhelamaka ta ekenge ena ɛ mokpɔtɔ adoa odii Yesu ko agama boo: «Kumu, Mwana ɔ Davidi, okeani ndjokwa! Mwana ɔ mbai mwali atungeami obuke na mwembo mobe!» <verse eid="MAT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Endolo Yesu aimosɔmbɛdja noko kɔpɛ. Batingami babatama mbuti na Yesu ko bamohɔdja boo: «Mobengana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mobengana eboani koko otingodja boo: mopaa eka ɛsɛngɛkɛ yo</char></note>, tina ɛ boo agamaka ngɔngɔ dja booso.» <verse eid="MAT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Nalomama oko odii bhata ibabunga ba Isalɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hokea koko Mat 10, 5-6.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Endolo mwali ona adua akwa magunda boso ba nde ko abala boo: «Kumu, kɔmɛdjani!» <verse eid="MAT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yesu asɔmbedja boo: «Editi opele otomba ipa la bana ko olidumba odii mvua.» <verse eid="MAT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />«Mwali ona asɔmbɛdja boo: Edii sooti, Kumu, noko bea mvua bakayɛ oko bikenge ba mapa bikakwae ta mesa ɛ moswa bu.» <verse eid="MAT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Bea Yesu abala na nde boo: «Mwali! Edhimeli ɛ wɛ edii enɛnɛ! Yɛɛ boo ekɔɔme na wɛ oko moda mopali wɛ.» Ko mwana ɔ nde mwali ahela oko ta ehole ena.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai bato ba bipeko bike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yesu adonga ena ko akɛɛ ta ibeke inɛnɛ la Galilai. Aihwea ta diko la ikoli ko adaa. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Bimumu ba bato badoa odii yo, badoa na bato ba mitɛngu, bato ba miso mago, bato ba biɛmɛ, bimimi na bato bakina bike ba bipeko. Babadedjaa ta mako ma Yesu ko abaheledja. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Bato bakamoa obuke ɔenɛ bo bimimi babali, bato ba mitɛngu baheli, bato ba biɛmɛ badali ko bato bagwa miso baeni, bea bakumedja Ndjambe ɔ Isalɛlɛ.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayedjai bato koto inei</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mal 8, 1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Yesu abea batingami ba nde ko abala na bu boo: «Naokeaka emumu he ɛ bato ndjokwa, tina ɛ boo bakɔi maswi masato engbanga na mbai ko baditi na eka ɛ oya. Naloni obayanedja sɔpɔ bwase; basaka embɛ mikuku na ndjia.» <verse eid="MAT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Batingami ba nde basɔmbɛdja boo: «Ha ta esobe, esika ndani ehɔni so odiha mapa bɛngɛ layedjae emumu ɛ bato moda muu?» <verse eid="MAT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yesu abahɔdja boo: «Odini na mapa meka?» Ko bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Lodii na mapa sambo na baa swi bakɛkɛkɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Bea, Yesu abala na emumu ɛ bato boo badae ta kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Atomba mapa sambo na swi, asakoa Ndjambe, amabuka ko apa bikenge bia odii batingami, ko batingami babikaana odii bato. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Bato basusu bayaka ko bagola. Bea batuta bikengakengi ko balumedja ngombe sambo. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Bato ibayaka badaka koto inei, pɛpɛ olanga bali na bana. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Ngɔngɔ dja oyanedja emumu ɛ bato, Yesu atitea ta bwato ko akɛɛ ta ekenge ɛ mokpɔtɔ ɛ Magadania.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s1">Bafalusai na Basadukai bahɔdjai embete ɛ okamoa</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mal 8, 11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luk 12, 54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Bafalusai na Basadukai badoa odii Yesu bɛngɛ bamopekee nduka. Bamohɔdja boo abainedjae embete emɔti ɛ okomoa ɛenɛmɛdjaka boo adonga ta busa. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Endolo Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Mɔkɔmɔkɔ, okabaleni boo: “Puma edalea iswi ipele, tina ɛ boo busa bodii bokpetu.” <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Ko sɔɔ mɛɛnɛ, okabaleni boo: “Mbua akwalea busabu, tina ɛ boo busa bohindi.” Odjebini otikoanedja bimbete bikainedjae boo kaoko mbua akwalea kaoko akwaetelea, endolo otasipoakani bimbete ba ehole! <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Bato ba yangola hee, badii bato babe ko bataki isuma ta miso ma Ndjambe, bahɔdjaka embete ɛ okamoa, endolo badihetelea embete ekina ɛ okamoa noko osinɛɛ dongedja oko embete ɛ Yona.» Bea abakina ena ko akɛɛ.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nɛngɛ ɔ mapa ɔ Bafalusai na Basadukai</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mal 8, 14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Ehole ɛkatisa batingami ta dɔngɔ la dua ikina la ibeke inɛnɛ, babosaa otomba mapa. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Bea Yesu abala na bu boo: «Tomangataanani na nɛngɛ mapa ɔ Bafalusai na Basadukai.» <verse eid="MAT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Batingami balɛdjana ko basahɔdjana boo: «Abalaka bea tina ɛ boo lotombiti mapa.» <verse eid="MAT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Yesu asipoa malɛi ma bobo ko abahɔdja boo: «Tina ɛsabaleanaka no mɛɛnɛ ɛlɔkɛ oditini na mapa nda? Bato ba edhimeli ekɛkɛ! <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Opakitaa sipoani oko? Obosaini mapa matano imakabanea no bato koto itano, ko motswua ma mapole imatomba no? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Obosaini koko mapa saambo imakabanea no bato koto inei ko motswua ma ngombe idjatomba no? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Moda ndani otasipoakani boo natabalaka ta diko la mapa ehole ebalaki mbai na nu boo: Tomangataanani na nɛngɛ mapa ɔ Bafalusai na Basadukai?»<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Bea batingami basipoa boo aibalaka na bu boo bangataane na nɛngɛ mapa, endolo bangataane na bileho ba Bafalusai na Basadukai.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piɛlɛ adhimi boo Yesu adii masia</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mal 8, 27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9, 18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yesu aimea ta ekenge ɛ mokpɔtɔ ma Sezale ɛ Pilipo. Ahɔdja batingami ba nde boo: «Bato bakabale boo Mwana ɔ Moto adii nda?» <verse eid="MAT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Bakina babalaka boo odii Yoani Mobatisi, bakina Elia, ko bakina koko odii Yelemia kaoko omɔti ɔ batɛli.» <verse eid="MAT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />«Yesu abahɔdja koko boo: bea ino, obalakani boo mbai nadii nda?» <verse eid="MAT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simo Piɛlɛ asɔmbɛdja boo: «Odii masia, Mwana ɔ Ndjambe ɔ mohelo.» <verse eid="MAT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Sepi odii wɛ, Simo mwana moomi ɔ Yoani, tina ɛ boo moto aotɔndɔiti midjɔ mii, endolo Tata ɔ mbai ona odii o diko. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Ko mbai, nabalaka na wɛ boo, odii Mondeke ko ta diko la mondeke muu nayoalea Ekelesia ɛ mbai. Ko kpati ɛ ogwa etadiha ngulu boso ba mu. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Naopalea fungola dja Okumu ba diko: midjɔ misusu minangalea wɛ haa ta kpɔtɔ minangamalea koko o diko; ko misusu miloloalea wɛ haa ta kpɔtɔ miloloamalea koko o diko.» <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Bea Yesu asia batingami ba nde na ngulu boo batatɔndɔ moto boo adii Masia.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjebedjai ogwa na opusoa ba nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mal 8, 31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9, 1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9, 22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Donga ehole ena, Yesu abala na batingami ba nde ohuu boo: «Eboani boo nakɛɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ ko nanɔngɔme obuke ta mabɔ ma basuku, bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe na bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko. Baowaleani ko, napusoalea ta iswi la basato.» <verse eid="MAT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Piɛlɛ atomba Yesu ɔyɛɛlɛ ko abanga omoosa dosa: «Kumu, yɛɛ boo Ndjambe aobanyee ohali na midjɔ moda mua. Pɛpɛ, midjɔ mia miotanetelea!» <verse eid="MAT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Endolo Yesu ahombana ko abala na Piɛlɛ boo: «Kɛɛ ohali na mbai, Satana! Odii ibaku tina ɛ mbai, elɔkɛ boo malɛi ma wɛ maditi malɛi ma Ndjambe, endolo malɛi ma bato.»<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Bea Yesu abala na batingami ba nde boo: moto mosusu opali okimanani, asalone yo mɛɛnɛ, atombe ekulusu ɛ nde ko akimaneni. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Tina ɛ boo, moto mosusu opali oheledja mohelo ma nde amobungedjalea, endolo moto mosusu obungedjalea mohelo ma nde diko la mbai amodihalea koko. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Tɛtɔ ndani edalea na moto nga akadiha ngondo esusu, endolo abungedjai mohelo ma nde? Ehɔni moto opa bɛngɛ asikoe mohelo ma nde yee? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Tina ɛ boo, Mwana ɔ Moto adoalea engbanga na babwɛndi, ba nde ta ekumu ɛ Sango ko aputalea moto na moto okimana na misala ma nde. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Nabalaka na nu sooti mɛɛnɛ boo: Ta ndanda ɛ bato ibadii haa bakina bagwɛtelea mbunoko baenɛ odoa ba Mwana ɔ Moto ta ekumu ɛ okumu ba nde.<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Mose, Elia na Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mal 9, 2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9, 28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Ngɔngɔ dja maswi masamano, Yesu atomba Piɛlɛ, Djake na Yoani, mwɛngɛ ɛ Djake, akɛɛ na bu oyɛɛlɛ ta diko la ngomba emɔti eyai. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Asendja ta miso ma bobo, mbanda ɛ nde ɛ ngɛngɛ elɛngɛɛ diso la busa ko bisendja ba nde baimea bipu mɛɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Sasimo baenɛ Mose na Elia basoola na Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Piɛlɛ abala na Yesu boo: «Kumu, enɔi opele tina ɛ booso odikama haa. Nga okapala, napikalea mitɔbɛ misato, momɔti ta tina ɛ wɛ, momɔti ta tina ɛ Mose ko momɔti ta tina ɛ Elia.» <verse eid="MAT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Oko ena ɔdaka yo abala, itutɛ imɔti iladaka langɛngɛ labadipa, ko moholi momɔti maokama ta itutɛ boo: «Hoo adii Mwana ɔ mbai ɔ epaeli nakasepe na nde obuke. Mookani!» <verse eid="MAT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Ehole ɛoka batingami moholi mua, bakwaa mbanda ta kpɔtɔ tina ɛ bɔɔ bonɛnɛ babapea. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Endolo Yesu abatama mbuti na bu, ababinga ko abala boo: «Emani, pɛpɛ odani na bɔɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Bangangodja miso ko baenɛ oko Yesu yo buki. <verse eid="MAT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Ena ɔdakabo batite ta ngomba, Yesu abasia na opipo boo: «Pɛpɛ otɔndɔni moto omɔti midjɔ mahulake no aenɛ mbunoko Mwana ɔ moto apusoe ta ndanda ɛ bato bago.»<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Batingami bahɔdja Yesu boo: «Tina ndani bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko bakabale boo Elia aboani odoa boso?» <verse eid="MAT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yesu asɔmbɛdja boo: «Sooti Elia aboani odoa bɛngɛ asɔmbɛdjae midjɔ misusu ta odjoo. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Endolo mbai, nabalaka na nu boo: Elia adoa ehele, endolo bato baimodjeba ko bamokɔɔ midjɔ imipala bo. Oko moda mua banyɔkɔlɔlea Mwana ɔ moto.» <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Batingami basipoa boo abalaka na bu diko la Yoani Mobatisi.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai mwana ɔ mosinga</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mal 9, 14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9, 37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Yesu na batingami ba nde babatama mbuti na emumu ɛ bato; moto omɔti adoa akwa magunda boso ba nde, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />ko abala boo: «Kumu, okea mwana ɔ mbai moomi ndjokwa. Adii na mosinga ko akapeke obuke, eengi ehole, akakwae ta mosa kaoko ta madiba. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Nakɛki na nde odii batingami ba wɛ endolo bahɔniti omoheledja.» <verse eid="MAT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yesu abala boo: «Yangola ebe ko ɛ taka ɛ edhimeli! Mbunoko ehole ndani nadalea engbanga na nu? Mbunoko ehole ndani naoikealeani molema? Doani na mwana ona haa odii mbai.» <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Yesu abengana mwembo mobe; maimana odii mwana ko ahela oko ta ehole ena. <verse eid="MAT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Bea batingami bakɛɛ ibo mɛɛnɛ odii Yesu ko bamohɔdja boo: «Moda ndani modaiso pɛpɛ ohɔnɔ obengana mwembo mua?» <verse eid="MAT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Edii tina ɛ boo odini na edhimeli ekɛkɛ. Nabalaka na nu, sooti boo: okɔki no daa na edhimeli elɛngɛɛ mbuma ɛ sinapi, ohɔnɔkini obala na ngomba hee boo: “Donga haa kɛɛ boo”, ko ekɛɛlea sooti. Pɛpɛ eka emɔti ehɔni oda pɛpɛ okɔɔmɔ na nu. [ <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Endolo edii oko na ndjia ɛ miongɔɔnɔ ko na osabekea oboanini obengana mwembo moda mua.]»<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abali mbala ɛ babae diko la ogwa na opusoa ba nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mal 9, 30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9, 43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Busa bomɔti batingami baputoana ta Galilai, Yesu abala na bu boo: «Bakabalea Mwana ɔ Moto ta mabɔ ma bato, <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />bamoowalea; endolo, ta iswi la basato, apusoalea.» Bea batingami baoka ndjokwa enɛnɛ.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Piɛlɛ baputi puti ɛ tepelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Ehole ɛimea Yesu na batingami ba nde ta Kapalanauma, baputedjeli ba puti ɛ tepelo badoa odii Piɛlɛ ko bamohɔdja boo: «Molehi ɔ boono tapute puti ɛ tepelo?» <verse eid="MAT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />«Piɛlɛ asɔmbɛdja boo, akapute.» Ehole ɛingea Piɛlɛ ta ndako, Yesu atomba ebaeli ko amohɔdja boo: «Simo, ɔlɛdjaka wɛ ɛnao? Bakapute puti odii bakumu ba ngondo ba nda? Bana ba bobo kaoko bakɛndɛli?» <verse eid="MAT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Piɛlɛ asɔmbɛdja boo, «bakɛndɛli.» « Ko Yesu abala na nde, boo edii bea, baswa ngando baboaniti oputa. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Endolo, ta olona boo losaka batɛdja ibaku. Kɛɛ ta ibeke inɛnɛ, maa ilɔpi, ko moswi ɔ boso otalea, modipoa monɔkɔ: otanealea pata emɔti yetomba ko puta puti ɛ mbai na puti ɛ wɛ; ta mabɔ ma bobo.»<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Moto ɔnɔi na tina ta Okumu ba busa</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mal 9, 33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9, 46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Oko ta ehole ena, batingami babatama mbuti na Yesu ko bamohɔdja boo: «Moto ɔnɔi na tina ta Okumu ba busa nda?» <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Yesu abea mwana omɔti mokɛkɛ, amoemea ta ndanda ɛ bobo <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />ko abala boo: nabalaka na nu, sooti boo: omiti sɔmbɔtɔnɔni ko nga omiti imeani elɛngɛɛ bana bakɛkɛ, oingeetebini ta Okumu ba busa. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Ta tina ena moto mosusu osatitedjalea elɛngɛɛ mwana mokɛkɛ hoo adabi moto ɔnɔi na tina ta Okumu ba busa. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Ko moto mosusu oosi ta kombe ɛ mbai mwana mokɛkɛ elɛngɛɛ hoo, aɔsi mbai mɛɛnɛ.<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekebedjeli tina ɛ mabaku</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mal 9, 42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17, 1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />«Endolo nga moto omɔti akakwedja ta isumu omɔti ta ndanda ɛ bana bakɛkɛ ibadhimeeni, enɔi opele ta tina ɛ nde bamonange mondeke monɛnɛ ta dɔli ko bamomae ta madiba ma mbɛngɛ ma ibeke inɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Ndjokwa ndani tina ɛ ngondo elɔkɛɛ boo midjɔ imikwedjai bato ta masumu midii mike! Midjɔ mia miboani oko madae, endolo ndjokwa ndani tina ɛ moto okamidodjae na ndjia ɛ nde! <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Nga ekada tina ɛ ebɔ kaoko eko ɛ wɛ ekaokola ta isumu, yelena ko yedumba ohali na wɛ; tina ɛ boo enɔi opele oingea ta mohelo na ebɔ emɔti kaoko na eko emɔti ta esika ɛ boo odae na mabɔ mabae kaoko na mako mabae ko ɔdumbame ta mosa ma kɔbili. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Ko nga ekada diso la wɛ likaokole ta isumu, lidongedja ko lidumba ohali na wɛ; tina ɛ enɔi opele tina ɛ wɛ oingea ta mohelo na diso imɔti ta esika ɛ boo ɔdae na miso mabae ko odumbame ta mosa ma gena.»<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la bhata ɔbunga ko ɔboloa</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luk 15, 3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />«Tomangataanani boo otatsiolani omɔti ɔ bana bii bakɛkɛ; tina ɛ boo nabalaka na nu sooti, babwɛndi ba bobo odiko bakaenɛ bihole bisusu mbanda ɛ Tata ɔ mbai ona odii odiko.» [<verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Tina ɛ boo Mwana ɔ Moto adoa asikoa bato ibabunga ndjia.]<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />«Olɛdjakano enao? Nga moto omɔti akada na bhata mokama ko omɔti ɔ bobo abungi, akinetelea bhata tuku ibua na ibua diko la ngomba bɛngɛ boo akɛɛ ahomba omɔti ona obungi? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Ko, nga akamoenɛ, nabali na nu sooti adalea na sepi enɛnɛ tina ɛ bhata ona onɔ bhata tuku ibua na ibua iba pɛpɛ obunga. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Edii moda momɔti, Tata ɔ boono ona odii odiko atapalaka boo omɔti ta tei ɛ bana bii abunge.»<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moda ma oyɛɛ mwangwao ta ibunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />«Nga mwangwao akaokɔmɛɛ obe, kɛɛ amoinedjae obe ba nde ino babae. Nga akaokea, omosɔmbɛdjai ta ndjia epele. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Endolo amitiokea, tomba moto okina kaoko bato babae engbanga na wɛ, tina ɛ boo, moda mabalaka Makomi, “sooti ɛ modjɔ mosusu ekadhimame oko na tati ɛ bato babae kaoko basato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hokea koko Det 19, 15.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Endolo akalona obaokea, djebedja Ekelesia; ko akalona ookea Ekelesia, motombani elɛngɛɛ mopangano kaoko moputedjɛli ɔ puti.»<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />«Nabalaka na nu, sooti boo: misusu minangaleano haa ta kpɔtɔ minangamalea koko ta busa; misusu miloloalea no haa ta kpɔtɔ miloloamalea ta busa.»<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />«Nabalaka koko na nu boo nga ekada bato babae ta ndanda ɛ boono, haa ta kpɔtɔ, baokani tina ɛ osɛnge eka ndani, Tata odii odiko abapalea yo. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Tina ɛ boo esika eputoani bato babae kaoko basato ta kombe ɛ mbai, nadii ena ta ndanda ɛ bobo.»<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la mosali okalone oyɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Bea Piɛlɛ abatama mbuti na Yesu ko amohɔdja boo: «Kumu, mbala djeka nahɔni oyɛɛ mwaninga ehole ekɔmɛini yo obe? Mbunoko mbala saambo?» <verse eid="MAT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Nabaliti na wɛ mbunoko mbala saambo, endolo tuku saambo mbala saambo. <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Edii tina ena, Okumu ba diko: bokoani na kumu omɔti ona ɔpalaka abɔngɛdjae na basali ba nde midjɔ ma falanga. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Ehole ebandi yo oindja midjɔ mia, badoa na mosali omɔti ona odaka na nyongo ɛ nde ɛ falanga dja bibende koto doomi. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Elɛngɛɛ otaka yo eka ɛ oputa; kumu ɔ nde aloma boo bamotɛke, engbanga na mwali ɔ nde, na bana ba nde ko na leka la nde losusu bɛngɛ boo apute nyongo ɛ nde. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Endolo mosali ona akwa magunda boso ba nde ko abala boo: “Kumu ikeani molema ko naputalea nyongo ɛ wɛ esusu!” <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Kumu amookea ndjokwa: amoyɛɛ na nyongo ɛ nde ko amokina akɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />Ena oimana yo, asaka na minande mosali ona ɔbeka odii yo falanga dja bibende mokama momɔti. Amopea, amohinyia ta moholi ko abala na nde boo: “Puta nyongo ɛ mbai!” <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Minande akwa magunda ta mako ma nde ko amongɔɔnɔ boo: “Ikiani molema, naputalea nyongo ɛ wɛ!” <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Endolo yo alona; akɛɛ amomaa ta ndako ɛ bɔlɔkɔ mbunoko ehole abɛtɛlea yo oputa nyongo ɛ nde. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Ehole ɛenɛ baminde ba mosala moda manɔɔ modjɔ mua, baoka ndjokwa enɛnɛ ko bakɛɛ atɔndɔ midjɔ misusu odii kumu ɔ bobo. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Bea kumu abea mosali ona ko abala na nde boo: “Mosali mobe! Mbai naoyɛɛ nyongo ɛ wɛ esusu ɛdaka na wɛ odii mbai tina ɛ boo ongɔɔnɔni. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Okɔkiti okea minawɛ ndjokwa moda maokea mbai wɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Ko kumu ɔ nde alemoa ko amokaba ta mabɔ ma basindjili ba bolɔkɔ mbunoko ehole eputalea yo nyongo esusu.»<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Ko Yesu abakea: «Edii oko moda mua Tata odii odiko aokɔbini nga moto na moto ta ndanda ɛ boono amiti yɛɛ mwanango na molema ma nde mosusu.»<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Eleho ɛ Yesu ta diko la oowa moki</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mal 10, 1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Ehole ɛbɛtɛ Yesu obala midjɔ mia, adonga ta Galilai ko akɛɛ ta ekenge ɛ mokpɔtɔ ma Yuda ta dɔngɔ la dua la Yolodani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Bimumu ba bato bamokimana oho, ko abaheledja. <verse eid="MAT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Bafalusai babatama mbuti na nde bɛngɛ bamomeke. Bamohɔdja boo: «Mobeko ma booso mapaka enɔli odii moomi boo adongedjae mwali ɔ nde tina ɛ modjɔ momɔti bea?» <verse eid="MAT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yesu asɔmbɛdja boo: «Tolangeni ta Makomi? “Ta ibange, Moyoli abayoa moomi na mwali”, <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />ko abala boo: tina ena, moomi akinabi nango na sango akataanabi na mwali ɔ nde, ko ibo babae baimeabi muni momɔti. <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Bea, baditi koko bato babae endolo baimei moto omɔti. Yɛɛ boo moto adae pɛpɛ obɔtɔdja eka ɛputoanedja Ndjambe.» <verse eid="MAT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Endolo Bafalusai bamohɔdja boo: «Bea tina ndani Mose aloma boo moomi apɛ mwali ɔ nde mokanda ma oowa moki ehole emodongedjai yo?» <verse eid="MAT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Mose aopani enɔli ɛ odongedja bali ba boono ta meki tina ɛ milema ma boono mipipo. Endolo ta ibange, ɛidaka bea. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Nabalaka na nu boo: nga moomi akadongedja mwali ɔ nde ta moki, dongedja oko akakwa ta bɔɔli, ko aosi mwali okina, akɔi bɔɔli.»<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Batingami babala na nde boo: «Nga moomi akaboana odaa bea boso ba mwali ɔ nde, enɔi opele moomi adae pɛpɛ oosɔ mwali.» <verse eid="MAT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Baami basusu batahɔnɔ odhima bileho moda muu, oko bii ibapama makoki tina ɛ bu. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Tina idii itikoanake idjika sie baami boo bataosɔ bali: baami bakina donga sɔpɔ dja bangwabu batahɔnɔ oosɔ bali, bakina babadongedja mbuma dja baami; baami bakina balona oosɔ bali tina ɛ Okumu ba diko. Yɛɛ boo moto ona odii na makoki ma odhima eleho hee aye dhime!»<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjongoi bana bakɛkɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mal 10, 13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18, 15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Bato badoa na bana bakɛkɛ odii Yesu bɛngɛ ababakee mabɔ ko aɔngɔɔne tina ɛ bobo, endolo batingami bagamea bato ibadoa na bana bia. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Bea Yesu abala boo: «Kinani bana bakɛkɛ badoe odii mbai ko pɛpɛ obasiani tina ɛ boo Okumu ba diko bodii tina ɛ bato ibadii elɛngɛɛ ibo.» <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Ababakea mabɔ ko adonga ena.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na mwenga moomi modiheli</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mal 10, 17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18, 18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Mwenga moomi omɔti abatama mbuti na Yesu ko amohɔdja boo: «Molehi, modjɔ mopele ndani mohɔni mbai okɔ bɛngɛ nadihe mohelo ma kɔbili?» <verse eid="MAT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yesu abala na de boo: «Tina ɛ hɔdjakani na wɛ diko la modjɔ mopele nda? Oko moto omɔti adii mopele. Nga okapala ɔingee ta mohelo, suma mibeko.» <verse eid="MAT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Mwenga moomi ona ahɔdja koko boo: «Mibeko mia nda?» Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Pɛpɛ oowa moto; pɛpɛ okɔ bɔɔli, pɛpɛ oiba, pɛpɛ opa tati ɛ epulu; <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />suma sangwao na ngwao; pala minɔ elengɛɛ okasapale wɛ mɛɛnɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Mwenga moomi abala na nde boo: «Nakasume mibeko mia misusu. Eboani mbai okɔ koko yee?» <verse eid="MAT 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Nga okapala ɔdae moto ona ɔkoka, kɛɛ atɛkɛ leka la wɛ ko pa bakwali falanga idjidihalea wɛ, bea odalea modiheli o diko; ngɔngɔ djia doa ko kimanani.» <verse eid="MAT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Endolo ehole ɛoka mwenga moomi modjɔ mua, akɛɛ na ndjokwa, tina ɛ boo adaka na odiheli bonɛnɛ.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Bea Yesu abala na batingami ba nde boo: «Nabalaka na nu sooti boo: edii opipo tina ɛ modiheli oingea ta Okumu ba diko. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Nabalaka na nu koko boo: edii opɛtɛpɛtɛ tina ɛ kamela onɔ ta iposi la tonga, endolo edii opipo mɛɛnɛ tina ɛ modiheli oingea ta Okumu ba diko.» <verse eid="MAT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Ehole ɛoka batingami Yesu abala modjɔ mua, bakamoa obuke ko bahɔdjana boo: «Bea ona ohelabi nda?» <verse eid="MAT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yesu abahokea ko abala na bu boo: «Modjɔ mua motakɔɔmɔ na bato, endolo odii Ndjambe misusu midii okɔɔmɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Piɛlɛ atomba ebaeli ko abala na Yesu boo: «Iso lakina losusu, bɛngɛ boo laokimane. Odabi mo tina ɛ booso enao?» <verse eid="MAT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yesu abala na bu boo: «Nabalaka na nu, sooti: ehole eimeabi midjɔ misusu ma yanie ko Mwana ɔ moto akadabi ta ngbɛndɛ ɛ nde ɛ ekumu, ino doomi na babae ibakimanani, odabini ta ngbɛndɛ tina ɛ osambedja mabota doomi na mabae ma Isalɛlɛ. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Ko bato basusu ibakina ndako dja bobo, banaangwabu baami, kaoko bangɛnɛ bali, sangwabu, kaoko ngwabu, bana ba bobo kaoko gue dja bobo badihabi onɔ mbala mokama engbanga na mohelo ma kɔbili. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Endolo bike ibadii hadɛdi bato ba boso badabi bato ba ngɔngɔ ko bike ibadii hadɛdi bato ba ngɔngɔ badabi bato ba boso.»<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s1">Basali ba gue ɛ vino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />«Tina ɛ boo hokea, moda modii Okumu ba diko: edabi elengɛɛ moswa gue ɛ vino ona ɔimana sɔɔ mɛɛnɛ bɛngɛ atombe basali tina ɛ osala ta gue ɛ nde. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Adhimeana na bu boo moto na moto adihake iputi la falanga emɔti ɛ ebende tina ɛ mosala ma iswi imɔti, ko abaloma ta gue ɛ nde ɛ vino. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Aimana koko ta ehole ɛ ibua ɛ sɔɔ ko aenɛ bato bakina baemi ta djaando pɛpɛ mosala ma osala. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Abala na bu boo: “Ino koko kɛɛni asala ta gue ɛ mbai ɛ vino ko naopaleani iputi la odjoo ilikoki.” <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Bea bakɛɛ oho. Moswa gue aimana koko ta ehole ɛ midi, ko ta ehole ɛ basato ngɔngɔ dja midi ko akɔɔ oko moda momɔti. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Aimana, ta ehole ɛ batano ɛ mɔkɔmɔkɔ, aenɛ koko bato baemi ta esika ena ɛ masaka. Abala na bu boo: “Tina eemi no bea busa bosusu pɛpɛ osala noko mosala momɔti nda?” <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: “Tina ɛ boo moto alotombiti ta mosala.” Bea abala na bu boo: “Ekadaa bea, ino koko, kɛɛ asaleni ta gue ɛ mbai ɛ vino.”<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />Ehole ɛimea mɔkɔmɔkɔ, moswa gue ɛ vino abala na modaledjeli ɔ misala ma gue boo: “Bea basala basusu ko baputa. Banga na bato ibatombi mbai ngɔngɔ ko sukedja na bato ibatombi mbai boso.” <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Bia ibabanga mosala ta ehole ɛ batano ɛ mɔkɔmɔkɔ badoa ko badiha omɔti na omɔti falanga ɛ ebende emɔti. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Ehole ɛimea polo ɛ bato ibatomba bo ta mosala boso, balɛdjaka boo badihalea falanga djike onɔ; endolo babapa koko omɔti na omɔti falanga ɛ ebende emɔti. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Ehole ɛyetomba bo, bahɔlɔkɔnɔ na moswa gue <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />ko babala boo: “Bato ibatombi wɛ ngɔngɔ basali etoko ehole emɔti ko obaputi moda momɔti na iso ibasali mosala mopipo busa bosusu ta diso la busa ipipo!” <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Endolo moswa gue asɔmbɛdja omɔti ɔ bobo boo: “Mopalani ɔ mbai, naokɔiti obe. Lookanakiti boo ɔsale mosala tina ɛ iputi la falanga emɔti ɛ ebende? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Tomba iputi la wɛ ko kɛɛ. Napalea moto ɔ ngɔngɔ iputi moda momɔti na dii liopi mbai. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Naditi na enɔli ɛ okɔ na falanga dja mbai misusu mipalaka mbai? Olemoi na mbai tina ɛ boo nadii moto mopele?” <verse eid="MAT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Bea, Yesu abakea boo, bato ba ngɔngɔ badabi bato ba boso ko bato ba boso badabi bato ba ngɔngɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjebedjai mbala ɛ basato ogwa na opusoa ba nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 10:32-33">Mal 10, 32-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18, 31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Yesu adaka akɛɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ. Akola batingami ba nde doomi na babae oyɛɛlɛ ko abala na bu, ena badale boo: <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />«Hokamedjanini, oho Mwana ɔ moto akabamalea ta mabɔ ma bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe na bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko. Bamolenealea etumbu ɛ ogwa <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />ko bamokabalea ta mabɔ ma bapagano, bɛngɛ boo bamotae, bamobome pimbo ko bamobake ta ekulusu. Ko iswi la basato, apusoalea.»<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esɛngɛ ɛ nɛngɛɛ bana ba Djebedai</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mal 10, 35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Bea mwali ɔ Djebedai adoa odii Yesu engbanga na bana ba nde baami babae; akwa magunda boso ba nde tina ɛ omosɛngɛ modjɔ momɔti. <verse eid="MAT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yesu amohɔdja boo: «Ɛpalaka wɛ?» Amosɔmbedja boo: «Bunedjani boo bana ba mbai babae baami badae ta tei Okumu ba wɛ omɔti ta dɔngɔ la ebɔ ɛ wɛ ɛ baami ko okina ta dɔngɔ la ebɔ ɛ wɛ ɛ bali.» - <verse eid="MAT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Otadjebakani modjɔ imasɛngɛkɛ no. Ohɔnini omwa kɔbɔ ɛ monɔngɔ eemwalea mbai?» - Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Lohɔni oyemwa.» <verse eid="MAT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yesu abala na bu boo: «Sooti, omwaleani kɔbɔ eemwalea mbai. Endolo modjɔ ma oda ta dɔngɔ la ebɔ ɛ mbai ɛ baami kaoko ta dɔngɔ ɛ mbai ɛ bali; mbai natahɔnɔ opa enɔli; bisika bia bipamabi odii bato ibabɔngɛdja Tata tina ɛ bu.»<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Ehole ɛoka batingami bia bakina doomi midjɔ mia, baisepa na banangwabu babae. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Bea Yesu ababea ibo basusu ko abala na bu boo: «Odjebakani boo bakumu ba bikomi bakakondjɛ bato ko bakulaka ba bikomi bakanɔngɛdjae bato ibadii nase dja ekumu ɛ bobo. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Eboaniti boo ɛdae bea ta ndanda ɛ boono. Endolo moto mosusu ɔpalaka adae moto ɔ tina ta ndanda ɛ boono adae mosali ɔ boono, <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />ko nga omɔti ɔ boono akapala oda moto ɔ boso, adae mobuli ɔ boono: <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Tina ɛ boo Mwana ɔ moto aidoa bɛngɛ bamosalee, endolo adoa asalea bato, na opa mohelo ma nde elɛngɛɛ isiko la bato bike.»<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai bato bagwa miso babae</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mal 10, 46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18, 35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Ehole ɛdonga Yesu na batingami ba nde ta Yeliko, emumu ɛ bato ɛmokimana. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Bato bagwa miso babae badaka badii ta mokpɛngɔ ma ndjia baoka Yesu anɔe; bagama boo: «Kumu, Mwana ɔ Davidi, lookea ndjokwa!» <verse eid="MAT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Bato babagamea bɛngɛ badipe minɔkɔ, endolo bagama koko na ngulu boo: «Kumu, Mwana ɔ Davidi, lookea ndjokwa!» <verse eid="MAT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yesu aemaa, ababea ko abala na bu boo: «Ɛpalaka no nakɔe ta tina ɛ boono yee?» <verse eid="MAT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Kumu, kɔɔ boo laenɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Yesu abaokea ndjokwa abinga miso ma bobo; ambuku, baenɛ ko bamokimana.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aingei ta Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mal 11, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19, 28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoa 12, 12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Ehole ɛbatama bo mbuti na Yelusalɛmɛ ko ɛimea bo mbuti na ngando ɛ Betefadje, diko la ngomba ɛ mele ma Olive, Yesu aloma batingami babae: <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />«Abala na bu boo: Kɛɛni ta ngando enaho edii boso ba boono. Otanealeani punda mwali anangi na ngɔli ko mwana ɔ punda mbuti na nde. Tingoani basusu babae ko doani na bu odii mbai. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Nga moto akabala na nu modjɔ tina ɛ bu, mosɔmbɛdjani boo: “Kumu akambaka na bu.” Ko mbala emɔti abakinalea bakɛɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Midjɔ mia misusu makɔɔmɔ bɛngɛ bibaeli ba motɛli bakokedjame:<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />«Balani na bato ba Siona boo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Hokea, kumu ɔ wɛ adoi odii wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">alumi na bwɛli, adii diko la punda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">ko diko la mwana ɔ punda, mwana ɔ punda ɔ punda mwali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hokea koko Djak 9, 9.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Batingami bakɛɛ ko bakɔɔ oko moda mabaloma Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Batomba punda engbanga na mwana ɔ nde, baondea bisendja diko la bobo ko Yesu adaa odiko. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Emumu ɛ bato ɛonda bisendja ba bobo ta ndjia; bakina balena bitape ba mele ko babionda koko ta ndjia. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Bato ibadalaka boso ba Yesu na bii ibamokimanaka bagamaka boo: «Iyakoko odii Mwana ɔ Davidi! Yɛɛ boo adjongoame ona odoi ta kombe ɛ Kumu! Ekumu odii Ndjambe odiko!»<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Ehole ɛingea Yesu ta Yelusalɛmɛ, ibonga isusu lakumana. Basahɔdja boo: «Moto hoo adii nda?» <verse eid="MAT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />«Bato basɔmbɛdja boo: Edii motɛli Yesu, ɔ Nasalɛta ta Galilai».<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ta tepelo</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mal 11, 15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19, 45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoa 2, 13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Yesu aingea ta lopango la tepelo ko abengana bato basusu ibadaka batɛkɛ ko basomba leka ta lopango la tepelo; ahombanedja mesa dja bato ibasɔmbɔtɔnɔkɔ falanga na bidie ba bato ibatɛkɛkɛ bimbenga. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Abala na bu: «Ɛkomama boo: “Ndako ɛ mbai ebeamabi ndako ɛ miongɔɔnɔ.”Endolo ino, oyeimedjaini ndako ɛ baibi!»<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Bato ba miso mago na iba mitɛngu babatama mbuti na Yesu ta lopango la tepelo ko abaheledja. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Ba kumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe na bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko baoka obe ehole ɛenɛ bo midjɔ ma okamoa makɔɔ Yesu na madaka baana bagama ta lopango la tepelo boo: «Ekumu odii Mwana ɔ Davidi!» <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Bea babala na Yesu boo: «Ɔokaka midjɔ mabalaka bo?» - «Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: edii bea. Opakitaa langani ta Makomi boo: na ndjia ɛ baana bakɛkɛ na bii ibanungaka mabɛɛ, ɔdiha ekumu ɛ wɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Bea abakina, aimana ta ibonga dia ko akɛɛ ta Betania oho ɔnɔdja yo bulu.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alakedjai mole ma figi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mal 11, 12-14</ref>. <ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Ngɔngɔ dja iswi imɔti ta imane la bobo ta Betania, Yesu aoka ndja. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Aenɛ mole momɔti ma figi mbuti na ndjia ko abatama mbuti na mu, endolo aienɛ noko mbuma emɔti oko kasa. Abala na mole mua boo: «Owetebi bota koko mbuna tina ɛ seko!» Oko ta ehole ena mole ma figi mahɔlɔngɔnɔ. <verse eid="MAT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Ehole ɛenɛ batingami modjɔ mua bakamoa obuke ko bahɔdja Yesu boo: «Moda mohɔlɔngɔni na mole ma figi mbala emɔti nda?» <verse eid="MAT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Nabalaka na nu, sooti boo: okadani na edhimeli ko nga omiti dani na kitɛ, okɔetebini etoko modjɔ mokɔi mbai na mole mu ma figi, endolo obalabini na ngomba hee boo: “Donga ena sadumba ta ibeke ilinɔi na onɛnɛ”, ko modjɔ mua mokɔmɔbi. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Nga okadani na edhimeli, odihabini misusu imisɛngɛbi no na ndjia ɛ miongɔɔnɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kitɛ tina ɛ okumu ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mal 11, 27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20, 1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Yesu aingea ta lopango la tepelo ko abanga oleha; bea bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe na basuku ba bayuda babatama mbuti na nde ko bamohɔdja boo: «Odihi wɛ kpati ɛ okɔ midjɔ mii hɔɔ? Ona ɔopa kpati ena nda?» <verse eid="MAT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Mbai koko naohɔdjaleani ihɔdja imɔti, nga okasɔmbɛdjanini, bea naotɔndɔleani kpati ndani ɛkɔkɔ na mbai midjɔ mia. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Oinama ba Yoani Mobatisi ɔdonga bo hɔɔ? Odii Ndjambe kaoko odii bato?» Bea balɛdjana ta ndanda ɛ bobo ko babala boo: «Nga lokabala boo: “Odii Ndjambe”, alohɔdjalea boo: “Bea ɔimodhimeani tina nda?” <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Nga lokabala boo: “badonga odii bato”, lodii na bɔɔ ba emumu ɛ bato, tina ɛ boo bato basusu bakatombe Yoani elɛngɛɛ motɛli.» <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Bea basɔmbɛdja Yesu boo: «Lotadjeba.» - «Yesu, abala na bu boo: Mbai koko, nataotɔndoni kaoko na kpati ɛ ndani nakɔkɔ midjɔ mia.»<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la baana bami babae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />«Yesu abala koko boo: ɔlɛdjaka no enao? Moto omɔti adaka na baana bami babae. Akɛɛ odii mwana ɔ boso ko abala na nde boo: “mwana ɔ mbai, kɛɛ asale mosala busabu ta gue ɛ vino.” <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Mwana asɔmbedja boo: “Naloni”, endolo ngɔngɔ, asɔmbɔtɔnɔ ilɛi ko akɛɛ ta gue ɛ vino. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Sɛngɛ moto akɛɛ odii mwana okina ko abala na nde oko moda momɔti. Mwana ona asɔmbɛdja boo: “Edii bea, moswa mbai, nakɛi oho”, endolo aikɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Ta ndanda ɛ bana bia babae ɔkɔɔ opala ba sango nda?» Basɔmbɛdja boo: «Mwana ɔ boso». Bea, Yesu abala na bu boo: «Nabalaka na nu, sooti boo: baputedjɛli baputi na bali ba ndukeli baingealea boso ba boono ta Okumu ba Ndjambe. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Tina ɛ boo Yoani Mobatisi adoa odii no bɛngɛ aoinedjaeni ndjia ɛ odjoo endolo ɔimodhimeani; endolo baputedjɛli baputi na bali ba ndukeli bamodhimea. Ko noko ɔenɛ no midjɔ mia na miso ma boono, ɔisɔmbɔtɔnɔni milema ko ɔimodhimeani.»<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la basali babe ba gue ɛ vino</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mal 12, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20, 9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />«Hokamedjani koko indjɛ ikina: moto omɔti aona gue ɛ nde ɛ vino; ayehika na lopango, alongea eomeli ɛ vino ko ayoa ndako eyai ɛ basindjili. Ngɔngɔ djia, akina gue ena ta mabɔ ma basali bɛngɛ boo bayeputele ko akɛɛ ta mwɛngɔ. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Ena ɔbatama ehole ɛ obuka mbuma, aloma basali ba nde odii basali ibaputelaka gue bɛngɛ bakɔngɔle dja nde mbuma. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Endolo bato ibaputelaka gue bapea basali ba nde, babomi okina, baowoi okina ko bala ɔ basato ndeke. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Bea moswa gue aloma basali bakina, bike onɔɔ ibakɛɛ boso, endolo bato ibaputelaka gue babakɔɔ oko moda momɔti. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Ta osukedja, moswa gue abalomea mwana ɔ nde moomi ko asabalea boo: “Badalea na isuma tina ɛ mwana ɔ mbai.” <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Endolo ehole ɛenɛ basali ba gue ɛ vino mwana, basabaleana boo: “Hokea mosangoli! Doani, lamoowoe ko isango la gue idalea la booso!” <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Bamopea, bamodumba o sokolu ɛ gue ɛ vino ko bamoowa.»<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Yesu ahɔdja boo: «Ehole edoalea moswa gue, ekɔlea yo na basali bia ibaputelaka gue yee?» <verse eid="MAT 21:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Aowodjalea bato bia babe na ogwa ba mokpangala ko apalea gue ena ɛ vino ta mabɔ ma baputeli bakina, ibamopakalea mbuma ta ehole ekabuke bo.»<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Yesu abala na bu boo: «Opakitalangani ta Makomi boo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">“Ikwe iladumba bapikeli ba ndako</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">limei ikwe la ndonga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Ena edii mosala ma Kumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">tina ɛ booso, edii modjɔ ma okamoa!”»<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />«Yesu abala boo: ta tina ena, Okumu ba Ndjambe bodongedjamalea ta ndanda ɛ boono bɛngɛ bapame odii bato ibahɔnɔlea oinedja misala ma bu. [<verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Moto mosusu okwalea diko la ikwe abukeanalea; ko ikwe likakwa diko la moto, limominakakalea.]»<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Ngɔngɔ dja ooka mandjɛ ma nde bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe na bafalusai basipoa boo Yesu abalaka tina ɛ bobo. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Bahombaka ndjia ɛ omopea, endolo badaa na bɔɔ ba bimumu ba bato ibatombaka Yesu elɛngɛɛ motɛli.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la tɛkɛ ɛ moki</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luk 14, 15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yesu abala na emumu koko na mandjɛ. Abala na bu boo: <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />«Okumu ba diko bokoani na: kumu omɔti ona ɔbɔngɛdja tɛkɛ ɛ moki tina ɛ mwana ɔ nde moomi. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Aloma basali ba nde abea bato ibabeama ta tɛkɛ boo badoe, endolo balona odoa. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Aloma koko basali bakina ko abala na bu boo: “Kɛɛ atɔndɔeni babeami boo nabɔngɛdjai mia ma tɛkɛ, naowoi ngɔmbɛ ba mbai baami na tito ba mbai ba miita, midjɔ misusu miboanedjami. Badoe ta tɛkɛ ɛ moki!” <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Endolo babeami ba tɛkɛ baikɛsɛlɛ na mbea ko bakɛɛ ta midjɔ ma bobo: omɔti ta gue ɛ nde, okina ta mombongu ma nde; <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />bakina bapea basali, babanyɔkɔla ko babaowa. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Kumu alemoa: aloma basoda ba nde baowoe baoowoli bia ko batumbe ibonga la bobo. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Bea abala na basali ba nde boo: “mia ma tɛkɛ mabɔngɛdjami, endolo babeami baboaniti na yu. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Kɛɛni ta maatano ma ndjia ko beani bato basusu ibatanealea no ena bɛngɛ boo badoe ta tɛkɛ ɛ moki ɛ mwana ɔ mbai.” <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Basali bakɛɛ ta ndjia ko babea bato basusu ibatanea bo oho, bato babe na bato bapele; na bea, ekenge ndako ɛ tɛkɛ ɛluma na bato. <verse eid="MAT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />Kumu aingea bɛngɛ ahokee babeami ba tɛkɛ ko aenɛ moto omɔti ɔdaka pɛpɛ olwa esendja ɛ tɛkɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Amohɔdja boo: “Mopalani ɔ mbai, moda moingei na wɛ haa pɛpɛ olwa esendja ɛ tɛkɛ nda?” Endolo moto ona ataka ebaeli ɛ osɔmbɛdja. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Bea kumu abala na basali ba nde boo: “Monangani mbɔti ta mabɔ na mako ko modumbani o sokolu, ta modidi. Oho ayealea ko akpɛkɛnɛlea mino.” <verse eid="MAT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Tina ɛ boo, babeami badii bike endolo bahɔmi badii bakɛkɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Puti tina ɛ Kaisala</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mal 12, 13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20, 20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Bea bafalusai bakɛɛ aputoana bɛngɛ babɔngɛdjae ndjia ɛ otɛdja Yesu ta nduka na mibalo ma nde mɛɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Baloma ekenge ɛ batingami ba bobo engbanga na bato ba Elode abala na Yesu boo: «Molehi, ladjebaka opele boo odii moto ɔ sooti: okalehe sooti ndjia ɛ Ndjambe; tokɛsɛlɛ na moto tina ɛ boo tohokee mbanda dja bato. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Lotɔndɔɔ malɛi ma wɛ tina ɛ modjɔ muu: mobeko ma booso mapaka enɔli ɛ oputa puti ɛ kumu Kaisala kaoko pɛpɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Endolo Yesu adjeba owɛi ba bobo bobe; abala na bu boo: «Bato ba owɛi bobe, tina ɛ mekakani na nu nda? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Inedjanini falanga ikapute na nu puti.» Bamoinedja falanga emɔti ɛ ebende, <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />ko Yesu abahɔdja boo: «Epoya na kombe ekomi bo haa la nda?» - <verse eid="MAT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «La Kaisala», bea Yesu abala na bu boo: «Pani Kaisala ilodii la Kaisala, ko Ndjambe ilodii la Ndjambe.» <verse eid="MAT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Ehole ɛoka bo esɔmbɛdjɛli ɛ Yesu, bakamoa. Bamokina ko bakɛɛ.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihɔdja diko la opusoa</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mal 12, 18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20, 27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Oko ta iswi dia, ekenge ɛ Basadukai ibakabale boo opusoa boditi, badoa odii Yesu ko bamohɔdja boo: <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />«Molehi, Mose abala boo: “Nga moomi akagwa pɛpɛ okina mwana, mwanango aboani oosɔ mwali ona okini mowei bɛngɛ amobotedjae baana ibatitanalea mowei.” <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Ta ndanda ɛ booso ladaka na bami saambo ba ngwabu omɔti sangwabu omɔti. Mwana moomi ɔboso aosɔ mwali ko agwa, endolo aibota na nde; bea akina mwali ɔ nde ta mabɔ ma mwanango. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Ekɔɔmɔ moda momɔti na ɔ babae, na ɔ basato mbunoko mwana ɔ saambo. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Ngɔngɔ dja ibo basusu, mwali agwa koko. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Ta iswi ilipusoabi bato ta ndanda ɛ bago, mwali ona adabi mwali ɔ nda ta tei ɛ bami bia saambo? Tina ɛ boo ibo basusu bamoosɔ!» <verse eid="MAT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Odini ta ibunga, tina ɛ boo todjebeni na Makomi, na ngulu ɛ Ndjambe. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Tina ɛ boo ehole epusomabi bago, bali na bami baosɔnetebi, endolo badabi elengɛɛ babwɛndi ta busa. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Ta modjɔ moeni opusoama ba bago, opakitalangani moda mabala Ndjambe na nu? Abala boo: <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />“Nadii Ndjambe ɔ Abalayama, Ndjambe ɔ Isaka na Ndjambe ɔ Yakobo.” Yesu abakea boo, Ndjambe adii Ndjambe ɔ bato bamohelo, endolo titi ɔ bago.» <verse eid="MAT 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Bato ibamooka bakamoa obuke na bileho ba nde.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mobeko imonɔi na tina</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mal 12, 28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10, 25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Ehole ɛoka Bafalusai boo Yesu asukedjai Basadukai, bea baputuana. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Ko omɔti ta ndanda ɛ bobo, moto ɔ edjebeli ɛ mobeko, ahɔdja Yesu ihɔdja dii bɛngɛ amomeke: <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />«Molehi, mobeko monɔi na tina ta mibeko misusu nda?»<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: « “Oboani opala Kumu Ndjambe ɔ wɛ na molema ma wɛ mosusu, na dongi la wɛ isusu ko na malɛi ma wɛ masusu.” <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Ena edii mobeko ma tina ko monɔi na onɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Ko hokea mobeko ma babae mokoani na mua: “Oboani opala mopalani ɔ wɛ moda mokasapale wɛ mɛɛnɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Mobeko mosusu na bileho ba batɛli bitingi ta mibeko mia mibae.»<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masia na Davidi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mal 12, 35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20, 41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Ena ɔputoana bafalusai esika emɔti, Yesu abahɔdja boo: <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />«Ekalɛdjaeno tina ɛ Masia yee? Adii mwana ɔ nda?» Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Adii mwana ɔ Davidi.» <verse eid="MAT 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Ko Yesu abala na bu boo: «bea moda ndani Davidi, na ilɔndi la Mwembo Mosɛnɔke, amobea “Kumu”? Tina ɛ Davidi abala boo:<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />“Kumu Ndjambe abala na Kumu ɔ mbai boo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">Doa adae ta ebɔ ɛ mbai ɛ bami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">mbunoko naise baloni ba wɛ nase dja bigbota ba wɛ.”»<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />«Bea nga Davidi akamobea “Kumu”, moda ndani ahɔni koko oda mwana ɔ nde?» <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Pɛpɛ noko moto omɔti ɔhɔnɔ omosɔmbedja ebaeli, ko donga iswi dia, pɛpɛ moto ɔsoboa koko boo amohɔdjae mahɔdja.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu akebedjai bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko na Bafalusai</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mal 12, 38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luk 11, 43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20, 45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Bea Yesu abala na emumu ɛ bato, ko na batingami ba nde boo: <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />«Bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko na Bafalusai badii na elomu ɛ otingodja bato mibeko ma Mose. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Bea, basumani ko kɔɔni midjɔ misusu mabalaka bo na nu, endolo pɛpɛ oikoanani misala ma bobo, tina ɛ boo tebaise bileho bikalehe bo ta mosala. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Bakanange mina ma mandi enɛnɛ, ko bakamibakee ta malokuloku ma bato bakina; endolo ibo mɛɛnɛ tebapale noko omibinga na mosapi. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Misala misusu mikakɔe bo bakamikɔe oko bɛngɛ bato babaenɛ. Bea, banɛngɛdja bikenge ba mikanda imakoma bo Makomi ko bakamikadee ta mbanda na ta mabɔ na ta sɔngɔ ndjai dja mikoto ma bobo. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Bakapale oda ta bisika ba ekumu ta tɛkɛ ko ta bigboto ba boso ta ndako dja miɔngɔɔnɔ dja Bayuda; <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />bakapale boo bato babaiseake ta bisika ba masaka ko bababeake “Molehi”. <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Endolo ino, pɛpɛ opalani boo bato baobeeni “Molehi”, tina ɛ odini na Molehi oko omɔti ko ino basusu odini moda momɔti. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Pɛpɛ obeani noko moto omɔti haa ta ngondo “Tata”, tina ɛ odini na Sangwanu oko omɔti, ona odii o diko. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Pɛpɛ opalani boo bato baobeeni “Molehi”, tina ɛ odini na Molehi oko omɔti, Klisto. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Moto ɔ tina ta ndanda ɛ boono adalea mosali ɔ boono. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Moto ɔ osaihwedja bamotitedjalea, endolo moto ɔ osatitedja bamoihwedjalea.»<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndjokwa na bakumu ba Ekelesea</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mal 12, 40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-52">Luk 11, 39-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">20, 45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />Ndjokwa ɛ boono bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko na Bafalusai, bato ba owɛi bobe! Ɔdipakani edipako bɛngɛ boo bato bakina badae pɛpɛ oingea ta Okumu ba diko; ino mɛɛnɛ oingeetebini ta bu endolo ɔsiakani bato ibadii na posa ɛ oingea boo badae pɛpɛ oingea.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 23:13">[<verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Ndjokwa ɛ boono, bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko na Bafalusai, bato ba owɛi bobe! Okakatoeni leka la bali ibagwedja baami, oko ta ehole ena okaongɔɔneni miɔngɔɔnɔ miyai tina ɛ osaenɛmɛdja odii bato. Ta tina ena osambedjamabini na opipo!]<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />Ndjokwa ndani tina ɛ boono, bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko na Bafalusai, bato ba owɛi bobe! Okadaleni ta ngondo esusu na ta mabeke imanɔi na onɛnɛ tina ɛ odiha mopagano noko omɔti ona oboani oongɔɔnɔ Ndjambe ɔ boono, ko ta ehole emodihi no omoimedjaini moto ɔ ipelu mbala ibae onɔ ino.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />«Ndjokwa ndani tina ɛ boono, balɔndi ba miso mago! Okabaleni boo: “Nga moto omɔti akalena seleka na kombe ɛ tepelo, editi na modjɔ; endolo nga moto omɔti akalena seleka na kombe ɛ ɔɔlɔ ɛ tepelo, aboani boo akokedjae seleka ɛ nde.” <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Bindanga ko bato ba miso mago! Eka enɔi kito nda: ɔɔlɔ kaoko tepelo ena ekasɛnɔdjae ɔɔlɔ? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Okabaleni koko boo: “Nga moto omɔti akalena seleka na kinda ɛ mbeka, editi na modjɔ, endolo nga moto omɔti akalena seleka na epeeli edii diko la kinda ɛ mbeka, aboani asume seleka ɛ nde.” <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Odini bato ba miso mago! Enɔi na kito, epeeli kaoko kinda ɛ mbeka ekasɛnɔdjae epeeli? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Tina ɛ boo moto ona okalene seleka na kombe ɛ kinda ɛ mbeka ayeleni na kombe ɛ leka losusu lodii diko la kinda ɛ mbeka; <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />moto ooleni seleka na kombe ɛ tepelo ayeleni na kombe ɛ Ndjambe ona odii ta tei ɛ yu. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Moto oleni seleka ta kombe ɛ busa ayeleni ta kombe ɛ ngbɛndɛ ɛ Okumu ba Ndjambe ko ta kombe ɛ ona okayedae.»<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />«Ndjokwa ndani na nu, bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko na Bafalusai, bato ba owɛi bobe! Okapɛni odii Ndjambe ibondo la doomi la ndunduumba, la musikade na baa leka bakɛkɛkɛ ba soo epele, endolo okaenɛni midjɔ iminɔi kito ta ndanda ɛ mobeko ngasa, elɛngɛɛ odjoo, ookea bato ndjokwa na edhimeli: ena edii midjɔ miboani no okɔ ko na pɛpɛ obosa opa ibondo la doomi. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Balɔndi ba miso mago! Okakɔngɔleni mongi akakwea ta mana ma boono, endolo okameeni kamela!»<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />«Ndjokwa ndani tina ɛ boono, bato ba edjebeli ɛ mobeko na Bafalusai, bato ba owɛi bobe! Okasoseni sokolu ɛ kɔbɔ na ɛ saani, endolo otei ilumi na leka la iba na posa ibe dja boono. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Mofalusai ɔ miso mago! Sosa boso kɔbɔ na saani otei bea sokolu esɛnɔlea.»<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />«Ndjokwa ndani tina ɛ boono, bato ba edjebeli ɛ mobeko na Bafalusai, bato ba owɛi bobe! Okoanini na ikila ilasinga bo langi epu likaenɛme opele osokolu endolo laluma na kua dja bato bago na bipɔlu. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Moda momɔti na nu, osokolu okaenɛmeni elɛngɛɛ bato ba odjoo ta miso ma bato, endolo otei olumini na epulu na obe.»<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />«Ndjokwa ndani tina ɛ boono, bato ba edjebeli ɛ mobeko na Bafalusai, bato ba owɛi bobe! Okatongeni makila mapele tina ɛ batɛli, ko okasɔnɛni mibombo ma bato ba odjoo, <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />ko okabaleni boo: “Ɔkɔkɔso hela ta ehole ɛ bataata su, laikɔkɔ putoana na bu ta tina ɛ otangedja makia ma batɛli.” <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Bea, na bibaeli ba boono mɛɛnɛ okadhimeni boo odini batitani ba bato ibaowa batɛli. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Na bea, landoani, na mosala mabanga bataata nu ma oowa batɛli. <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Ino ndjɔ, ibota la mabate! Moda mohɔni no olɛdja boo otiabini etumbu ɛ ipelu nda? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Hokamedjani opele: mbai naolomealeani batɛli, bato ba owɛi na bato ba edjebeli ɛ mobeko ba sooti. Oowaleani bakina, obakaleani bakina ta ekulusu, obomaleani bakina pimbo ta ndako dja boono dja miongɔɔnɔ ko obanyɔkɔlɔleani ta ibonga imɔti na imɔti, <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />bɛngɛ boo, makia ma bato basusu ba odjoo, imasopa bo ta kpɔtɔ, masopee ta melo ma boono, donga makia ma Abele moto odjoo mbunoko makia ma Djakalia, mwana moomi ɔ Balasi, ɔɔwa no pakasa ɛ esika esɛnɔke na kinda ɛ mbeka. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Nabalaka na nu, sooti boo: ino bato ba yangola hee odihaleani etumbu tina ɛ midjɔ mia misusu.»<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayei tina ɛ Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luk 13, 34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />Yelusalɛmɛ, Yelusalɛmɛ, ona ookaowoe batɛli ko ookaowoe bato ibakamolomee Ndjambe na ndeke! Mbala djeka djapalaka mbai naoputoanedjae na bana ba wɛ moda mokaputoanedjae kɔkɔ mwali bana ba nde nase dja mapapulapu, endolo ɔlona! <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Hadɛdi, ndako ɛ boono edalea esundolamake. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Tina ɛ boo, nabalaka na nu: donga busabu, owetelea enɛnini koko mbunoko okabalaleani boo: «Yɛɛ adjongoame, ona odoi ta kombe ɛ Kumu!»<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Obedjama ba tepelo</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mal 13, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21, 5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Ena ɔdaka Yesu aimane ta lopango la tepelo, batingami ba nde babatama mbuti na nde bɛngɛ bamoinedjae moda mapika bo tepelo. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Endolo Yesu abala na bu boo: «Oenini mii misusu? Nabalaka na nu sooti boo: pɛpɛ noko mondeke momɔti modikalea mobaki diko la mondeke mokina. Losusu lobedjamalea.»<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bimbete ba suka ɛ ngondo</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mal 13, 3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21, 7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Ena ɔdaka Yesu adii ta ngomba ɛ mele ma olive, batingami babatama mbuti na nde ko bamohɔdja boo: «Lotɔndɔɔ ehole ndani ekɔɔmɔbi midjɔ mia? Ko embete ndani einedjabi odoa ba wɛ na suka ɛ ngondo.» <verse eid="MAT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Tomadingani boo moto omɔti adae pɛpɛ ookoseani. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Tina ɛ boo bato bike badoabi na kombe ɛ mbai ko babalabi boo: “Mbai nadii Masia!” Ko bakoseabi bato bike. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Ookabini gala dja bila na ngilimo dja bila; endolo pɛpɛ osatungeani: tina ɛ midjɔ mia miboani boo makɔɔme, endolo edaetebi suka ɛ ngondo. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Ekomi emɔti eonɛdjalea ekomi ekina, okumu bomɔti bonɛdjalea okumu bokina; ndja idabi pipo ko mokpɔtɔ mokumanabi mɔɔngɔ na mɔɔngɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Midjɔ mia misusu midabi oko elengɛɛ mbangi ɛ epeko ɛ ibota la mwali. <verse eid="MAT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />Bea, baokababini bɛngɛ ɔokeni saya ko baowabini. Bikomi bisusu biokeabini swɛ tina ɛ kombe ɛ mbai. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Ta maswi mia, bato bike badumbabi edhimeli ɛ bobo; bakababi ko bainabi baminabu. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Batɛli bike ba epulu badoabi ko bakoseabi bato bike. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Ta tina ɛ boo obe bonɛngɛbi oko onɛngɛ, epaeli ɛ bato bike etitabi. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Endolo moto oikabi molema mbunoko suka ahelabi. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Mwako Mopele ma Okumu ba Ndjambe motɔndɔmɔbi ta ngondo esusu; edabi tati tina ɛ bikomi bisusu. Ngɔngɔ djia suka edaobi.»<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Monɔngɔ monɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mal 13, 14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21, 20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />«Ehole eenɛbi no ona okabee bo “Mbeedji ɔ manene” ona ɔbala motɛli Danyɛlɛ; ona odedjamabi ta esika esɛnɔke. Yɛɛ boo molangi asipoe opele modjɔ mua! <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Ta ehole ena, bia ibadabi ta Yuda batie ta ngomba; <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />yɛɛ boo ona odabi o sokolu adae pɛpɛ osɔmbɔ atomba eka ta ndako; <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />ko yɛɛ boo ona odabi ta gue atasɔmbɔ atomba esendja ɛ nde. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Ndjokwa ndani, ta maswi mia, tina ɛ bali iba meemi ko ibadabi banungea baana! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Ongɔɔnɔni bɛngɛ boo midjɔ mia madae pɛpɛ okɔɔmɔ ta ehole ɛ piɔ epipo, kaoko ta iswi la sabata! <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Tina ɛ boo, ta ehole ena, monɔngɔ modabi mopipo onɔ imakɔɔmɔ donga ibange la ngondo mbunoko hadɛdi, ko mokina ma moda mua modaetebi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hokea koko Dan 12, 1.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Ko nga ɔkɔkɔ daa Kumu pɛpɛ okuhedja maswi mia, pɛpɛ noko moto omɔti ɔkɔkɔ hela. Endolo ta tina ɛ bato ibahɔɔ yo akuhedja maswi mia. <verse eid="MAT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Bea nga moto akabala na nu boo: “Hokeani! Klisto adii haa” “kaoko adii boo” pɛpɛ omodhimeani. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Tina ɛ boo ba masiya ba epulu na batɛli ba epulu badoabi; bakɔbi bimbete ba okamoa mindumba na mindumba tina ɛ okosea, ehole ekina, noko bato ibahɔɔ Ndjambe. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Hokamedjani! Naotɔndɔini boso bɛngɛ boo oangataneni.»<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />«Bea nga bakabala na nu boo: “Hokeani, adii ta esobe”, pɛpɛ okɛɛni oho. Kaoko nga bakabala na nu boo: “Hokeani, abolami haa!”, pɛpɛ omodhimeani. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Tina ɛ boo, Mwana ɔ moto adoabi elengɛɛ mokaikai imokangɛngɛ dɔngɔ ikaimane diso la busa mbunoko dongo ikatite lo. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Esika esusu esambi ndjemba, mbulu ibakayake ndjemba bakaputuane ena.»<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Odoa ba Mwana ɔ Moto</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mal 13, 24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21, 25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />«Ehole enɔbi maswi mia ma monɔngɔ, diso la busa imeabi modidi, songe apɛtebi ohuu ba nde, ndjɔtɔ bakwabi donga odiko ko ngulu dja diko ikumanabi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hokea koko Isa 13, 10; 34, 4; Edje 32, 7; Yoe 2, 10; 3, 4.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Bea, embete ɛ Mwana ɔ moto eenɛmɛbi ta busa; bikomi bisusu ba ngondo bisayeanabi ko baenɛbi odoa ba Mwana ɔ moto diko la matutɛ ma diko na ngulu ko na ekumu enɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Na kilingo enɛnɛ ɛ kɛlɛlɔ, alomabi babwɛndi ba nde ta makono masusu ma ngondo: baputoanedjabi bato ibahɔɔ yo.»<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la mole ma figi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mal 13, 28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21, 29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />«Yɛɛ boo indjɛ la mole ma figi laoleheni: Nga bitape ba mu bikaembɛ ko bibangi oimanedja kasa, okadjebeni boo ehole ɛ moi mopipo ebatami. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Moda momɔti na nu, ehole eenɛbi no midjɔ mia misusu, odjebabini boo Mwana ɔ moto aimei mbuti ta bidipako. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Nabalaka na nu sooti boo: bato ba yangola hee banɔetelea mbunoko midjɔ mia misusu mikakɔɔmɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Busa na kpɔtɔ lonɔbi, endolo ebaeli dja mbai inɔetebi.»<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moto omɔti tadjebe iswi na ehole</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mal 13, 32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luk 17, 26-30</ref>. <ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />«Tina ɛ modjɔ moeni iswi kaoko ehole, pɛpɛ moto okadjebe, ɛdae babwɛndi ba diko kaoko Mwana; oko Tata yo buki moto okalodjebe. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Moda makɔɔmɔ ta maswi ma Noa, moda mua momɔti mokɔɔmɔbi ta odoa ba Mwana ɔ moto. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Tina ɛ boo, boso pela ɛlinde, bato bayaaka ko bamwaaka, baosɔnɔkɔ ko baosɔdjaka baana ba bobo bali, mbunoko iswi laingea Noa ta masua; <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />baidjebaka noko modjɔ momɔti diko la mua imapalaka makɔɔme, mbunoko pela enɛnɛ ɛdoa ko ebadindedja ibo basusu. Edabi oko bea ta odoa ba Mwana ɔ moto. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Bea, baami babae badabi ta gue: omɔti atombamabi ko okina adikabi. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Bali babae badabi bainda mbuma: omɔti atombamabi ko okina adikabi. <verse eid="MAT 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Bea, sɛndjɛlɛni tina ɛ boo otadjebakani iswi ilidoabi Kumu ɔ boono. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Sipoani modjɔ mu opele: nga moswa ndako adjeba ehole ndani edoalea moibi na bulu, eke asɛndjɛlɛ ko aimokina boo aingee ta ndako ɛ nde. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Ta tina ena, ino koko, salingoani, tina ɛ boo Mwana ɔ moto adoalea ta ehole edii no pɛpɛ olɛdja.»<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mosali ɔ odjoo na mosali ɔ owɛi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luk 12, 41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />«Bea odii mosali ɔ odjoo ko ɔ owɛi nda? Edii ona ɔbala moswa nde boo: naopi mosala muu, yakedja basali bakina ta ehole eboani. <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Sepi odii mosali ona, nga ta ihule la moswa nde ko amotanei asala mosala mua. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Nabalaka na nu, sooti boo: moswa nde amopalea mandi ma obanyea odiheli ba nde bosusu. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Endolo nga mosali ona akada mosali ɔ pɛpɛ owɛi, ko asabalei boo: “Moswa mbai atahula pɛpɛlɛ”, <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />ko abangi oboma bamina nde ba mosala, oyaka na omwa esika emɔti na bato ba ilangoa la mana. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Bea, moswa nde ahulalea ta iswi idii mosali pɛpɛ omolɛndɛ ko ta ehole edii yo pɛpɛ odjeba; <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />abenganalea mosali ona ko amopalea etumbu epipo esika emɔti na bato ba owɛi bobe, oho okayee bo na okapkɛkɛnɛ bo mino.»<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la baseka doomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />«Okumu ba busa bokoanabi na baseka doomi ibatomba miinda ma bobo ko bakɛɛ asaka na moomi ɔ moki. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Ta ndanda ɛ bobo batano badaka bindanga ko batano badaka ba owɛi. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Baseka ba ondanga batomba oko miinda ngasa endolo baitomba munɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Endolo bii ba owɛi batomba miinda ma bobo na munɛ ta biiseli. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Ena ɔnɛngɛdja moomi ɔ moki pɛpɛ oimea; baseka bia basusu baoka hiɔ ko bahwɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />Ta ndanda ɛ bulu, moholi momɔti maokama boo: “Moomi ɔ moki ahuli! Kɛɛ asakeni na nde!” <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Baseka basusu baongɔɔ ko babɔngɛdja miinda ma bobo. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Bindanga babala na bii ba owɛi boo: “Lopani maa ekenge ɔ munɛ ma boono, tina ɛ boo miinda ma booso mahombaka madimee.” <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Endolo baseka ba owɛi basɔmbɛdja boo: “Ngasa, tina ɛ boo motakoka noko osinɛɛ tina ɛ booso na nu. Kɛɛ asombeni ma boono pɛpɛlɛ odii batɛki.” <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Ta ehole ɛkɛɛ bo asomba munɛ, moomi ɔ moki aimia. Baseka ibasabɔngɛdja baingea engbanga na moomi ta ndako ɛ tɛkɛ ko badipa edipako na mongbandi. <verse eid="MAT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />Ngɔngɔ djia, baseka bakina baimea ko babala boo: “Kumu, kumu, lodipoa!” <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Endolo moomi ɔ moki abasɔmbɛdja boo: “Nabalaka na nu, sooti boo: nataodjebakani.” <verse eid="MAT 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Bea Yesu abala boo: sɛndjɛlɛni tina ɛ otadjebakani na iswi, na ehole.»<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la taleta</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 19:12-27">Luk 19, 12-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />Edabi koko elɛngɛɛ moto omɔti ona ɔdaka mbuti na okɛ mwɛngo: abea basali ba nde ko abapa leka la nde. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Apa odii mosali ɔ boso taleta itano, odii mosali ɔ babae taleta ibae, ko mosali ɔ basato taleta emɔti: abapa okimana na ngulu ɛ moto na moto ko akɛɛ ta mwɛngɔ. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Ambuku ona ɔosɔ taleta itano adjisa ta mombongu ko adiha taleta ikina itano odiko. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Mosali ona ɔosɔ taleta ibae akɔɔ oko moda momɔti ko abakea taleta ikina ibae. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Endolo ona ɔosɔ taleta emɔti alongea mombɔndɔ ta kpɔtɔ ko abomba ikondja la kumu ɔ nde.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />«Ngɔngɔ dja maswi mike, kumu ɔ basali bia ahula ko abahɔdja moda makɔɔ bo na odiheli ba nde. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Mosali ona ɔosɔ taleta itano adoa na taleta ikina itano ko abala boo: “Kumu, ɔpani taleta itano. Hokea, nabakei ikina itano”. <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Kumu abala na nde boo: “Opele, mosali mopele ko ɔ sooti. Tina ɛ boo odaki na osooti ta leka lokɛkɛ, naopalea mandi ma obanyea leka luke. Doa asepe engbanga na kumu ɔ wɛ”. <verse eid="MAT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />Mosali ona ɔosɔ taleta ibae adoa ko abala boo: “Kumu, ɔpani taleta ibae, hokea, nabakei ikina taleta ibae.” <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Kumu amosɔmbɛdja boo: “Opele, odii mosali mopele ko ɔ sooti. Tina ɛ boo odaki na osooti ta leka lokɛkɛ, naopalea mandi ma obanyea leka luke. Doa asepe engbanga na kumu ɔ wɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />Bea mosali ona ɔosɔ taleta emɔti adoa ngɔngɔ ko abala boo: “Kumu, nadjebaka boo odii moto ɔmongangale: okabuke mbuma ta gue ɛdaa wɛ pɛpɛ oona ko okatute mbuma ta esika ɛdaa wɛ pɛpɛ omɛsɛ kona. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Nadaa na bɔɔ ko nakɛɛ abomba taleta ɛ wɛ ta kpɔtɔ. Hokea taleta ɛ wɛ iyeye.” <verse eid="MAT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />Kumu ɔ nde amosɔmbɛdja boo: “Mosali mobe, mohete! Ɔdjebaka boo nakabuke mbuma ta gue edii mbai pɛpɛ oona, ko nakatute mbuma ta esika edii mbai pɛpɛ omɛsɛ kona, <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />tina ndani, oisa taleta ɛ mbai odii bato ibakabombe ikondja, ko ta ihule la mbai, nayetombe na tɛtɔ? <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Bea, mokatoani taleta ena ko yepani odii moto ona odii na taleta doomi. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Tina ɛ boo moto ona odii na eka bamopalea onɔ ko aimealea na leka luke; endolo ona odii pɛpɛ eka, bamokatoalea noko ena edii na nde. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Bea tina ɛ mosali mobe hoo, modumbani osokolu ta modidi, ta esika edabi bie na okpɛkɛnɛ mino.”»<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esambi ɛ suka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />«Ehole edoabi Mwana ɔ moto ta ekumu ɛ nde engbanga na babwɛndi ba nde basusu, adabi ta ngbɛndɛ ɛ nde ɛ ekumu. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Bikomi bisusu ba ngondo biputoanabi boso ba nde ko abakaanabi mabondo mabae moda mokakaane mobanyeli ɔ bingbɛndɛ bhata na kambeli; <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />adedjabi bhata ta ebɔ ɛ nde ɛ baami ko kambeli ta ebɔ ɛ nde ɛ bali. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Bea Kumu abalabi na bato ibadabi ta ebɔ ɛ nde ɛ baami boo: “Doani, ino bato ibadjongoama na Tata, ingeani ta Okumu ibaboanedjama tina ɛ boono donga ibange la ngondo. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Tina ɛ boo nadaka na ndja ko opanini mia ma oya; nadaka na posa ɛ madiba ko opanini madiba ma omwa; nadaka mokɛndɛli ko ɔosɔnini opele; <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />nadaka mbundu ko olwɛdjanini bisendja; nadaka na epeko ko osaloanini; nadaka ta bɔlɔkɔ ko ɔdoa aindjanini.” <verse eid="MAT 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Bea, bato ba odjoo babalabi na nde boo: “Kumu, ehole ɔenɛ so na ndja ko laopa mia ma oya, kaoko na posa ɛ mdiba ko laopa madiba ma omwa nda? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Ehole ɛonɛ so mokɛndɛli ko laosɔ opele, kaoko mbundu ko laolwɛdja nda? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Ehole ɛonɛ so na epeko kaoko ta bɔlɔkɔ ko ladoa aoindja nda?” <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Kumu abasɔmbɛdjabi boo: “Nabalaka na nu sooti boo: bihole bisusu ibakɔkɔ no midjɔ mia odii baana ba inga iba pɛpɛ tina, djebani opele boo ɔkɔmɛkɛni wɛte mbai.”<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />Ngɔngɔ djia, abalabi na bato ibadabi ta ebɔ ɛ nde ɛ bali boo: “Dongani ta miso ma mbai, ino bato ibalakedja Ndjambe; kɛɛni ta mosa ma kɔbili imabɔngɛdjama tina ɛ satana na babwendi ba nde! <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Tina boo nadaka na ndja ko ɔipanini mia ma oya; nadaka na posa ɛ madiba ko ɔipanini madiba ma omwa; <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />nadaka mokɛndɛli ko ɔiosɔnini; nadaka mbundu ko ɔilwɛdjanini; nadaka na epeko ko naingea ta bɔlɔkɔ endolo ɔikɔmɛdjanini.” <verse eid="MAT 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Bea, bamohɔdjabi boo: “Kumu, ehole ɛonɛ so na ndja, kaoko na posa ɛ madiba, kaoko mokɛndɛli, kaoko mbundu, kaoko na epeko, kaoko ta bɔlɔkɔ ko laiokɔmɛdja nda?” <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Kumu abasɔmbɛdjabi boo: “Nabalaka na nu, sooti boo: bihole bisusu balonaka no okɔmɛdja ɔmɔti ɔ bii ibakɛkɛ, ɔlonakani wɛte okɔmɛdjani.” <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Ko bakɛbi adiha etumbu ɛ kɔboli, endolo bato ba odjoo bakɛbi adiha mohelo ma kɔbili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hokea koko Dan 12, 2.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s1">Kuta tina ɛ Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mal 14, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:45-53">Luk 22, 45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Ehole ɛbɛtɛ Yesu obala midjɔ mia misusu, abala na batingami ba nde boo: <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />«Ɔdjebakani opele boo edikai maswi mabae bɛngɛ tɛkɛ ɛ Pasika ɛbange: bakabalea Mwana ɔ moto bɛngɛ bamobake ta ekulusu.»<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Bea, bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe na basuku ba ngando baputoana ta ndako ɛ Kaifa, kumu ɔ banganga ba Ndjambe; <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />bea, baokana tina ɛ opea Yesu na owɛi bobe ko bamoowoe. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Noko bea babala boo: «Etaboana omopea ta ehole ɛ tɛkɛ, bato basakatɔmbɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwali asopei Yesu malasi ta molo</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mal 14, 3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoa 12, 1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Yesu adaka ta Betania, ta ndako ɛ Simo ona ɔdaka na mabha. <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />Mwali omɔti abatama mbuti na nde ena apeli molangi ma malasi ma motwuia monɛnɛ: amasopa diko la molo ma Yesu ehole ɛdaka yo ta mesa. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Ena ɔenɛ batingami bea, basuboa ko babala boo: «Tina ɛ obeedja malasi mii bea nda? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Bahɔnɔki omatɛkɛ na motwuia monɛnɛ ko ngɔngɔ djia opa falanga odii bakwali!»<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Ehole ɛenɛ Yesu bea abala na bu boo: «Tina ɛtungeaka na nu mwali hoo nda? Akokedjai modjɔ mopele tina ɛ mbai. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Tina ɛ boo okadaeni na bakwali bihole bisusu; endolo mbai, odaeteleani na mbai bihole bisusu. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Ena osopei yo malasi mii ta mokuku ma mbai, akɔi bea tina ɛ obɔngɛdja opuseama ba mbai. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Nabalaka na nu, sooti boo: mɔɔngɔ masusu malehabi bo Mwako Mopele muu ta ngondo esusu, batɔndɔbi koko modjɔ mokɔi mwali hoo ko bamolɛdjakabi.»<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudasi akabi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mal 14, 10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22, 3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Bea omɔti ɔ batingami doomi na babae, ɔbeaka bo Yudasi Isikalioti, akɛɛ odii bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />ko abala na bu boo: «Ɛpalaka no opani nga nakakaba Yesu odii no yee?» Bakumu ba banganga bamopa falanga dja bibende tuku isato. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Donga ehole ena, Yudasi abanga ohomba enɔli epele tina ɛ obakabea Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayi mia ma Pasika engbanga na batingami ba nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mal 14, 12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22, 7-14</ref>. <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoa 13, 21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Ta iswi la mbangi la tɛkɛ ɛ mapa mataki nɛngɛ ɛ mapa, batingami bahɔdja Yesu boo: «Esika ɛpalaka wɛ boo laobɔngɛdjae mia ma Pasika nda?» <verse eid="MAT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Kɛɛni ta ibonga odii moto omɔti bea ko balani na nde boo: “Kumu abali boo: Ehole ɛ mbai eimei; nayakalea mia ma Pasika engbanga na batingami ba mbai odii wɛ.”» <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Batingami bakɔɔ oko moda mabaloma Yesu ko babɔngɛdja mia ma Pasika.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Mɔkɔmɔkɔ, Yesu adaa ta mesa engbanga na batingami ba nde doomi na babae. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Ena ɔdaka bo baya, Yesu abala boo: «Nabalaka na nu, sooti boo: omɔti ta ndanda ɛ boono akabaleani.» <verse eid="MAT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Baoka ndjokwa enɛnɛ ko bamohɔdja omɔti na omɔti boo: «Kumu, edii mbai?» <verse eid="MAT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yesu asɔmbɛdja boo: «Moto ona odubeaka na mbai ipa la nde ta saani, edii yo moto okabaleani. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Mwana ɔ moto agwalea elengɛɛ ɔkomama mo tina ɛ nde; endolo ndjokwa ndani tina ɛ moto ona okabi Mwana ɔ moto! Ɛboanaka opele tina ɛ moto ona boo adae pɛpɛ obotama.» <verse eid="MAT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Yudasi, ona omokabalea ahɔdja boo: «Molehi, edii mbai?» Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Wɛ mɛɛnɛ obali.»<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mesa ɛ Kumu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mal 14, 22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22, 14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Ko 11, 23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Ena ɔdaka bo baya, Yesu atomba ipa ko, ngɔngɔ dja osakoa Ndjambe, alibuka ko alipa batingami ba nde; abala na bu boo: «Tombani ko yakani. Hee edii mokuku ma mbai.» <verse eid="MAT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Ngɔngɔ djia atomba kɔbɔ, asakoa Ndjambe, abapa ko abala boo: «Ye mwani ino basusu, <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />tina ɛ boo hee edii makia ma mbai, makia ma edhimaneli ɛ Ndjambe imasopei tina ɛ bato bike, tina ɛ oyɛɛmɛ ba masumu ma bobo. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Nabalaka na nu sooti boo: donga hadɛdi, nawetelea mwa koko vino hee mbunoko iswi ilimwabi mbai vino ɛ tɛtɛli engbanga na nu ta Okumu ba Tata.» <verse eid="MAT 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Ngɔngɔ djia baemba biembo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hokea koko Bie 113-118; 136. Bayuda bakaembe biembo bia ba okumedja na osakoa mbunoko busabu. </char></note>, ko bakɛɛ ta ngomba ɛ mele ma Olive.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjebedjai boo Piɛlɛ amoinganalea</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mal 14, 27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22, 31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoa 13, 36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Bea Yesu abala na bu boo: «Ta bulu buu mɛɛnɛ, ino basusu obungedjaleani odhima, tina ɛkomama ta Makomi boo: “Nabomalea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hokea koko Djak 13, 7.</char></note> mobanyeli ɔ bingbɛndɛ, ko bwela ba bhata bonanganalea mɔngɔ masusu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Endolo, Yesu abakea boo, ngɔngɔ dja opusoa ba mbai, nakɛɛlea aombani ta Galilai.» <verse eid="MAT 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Piɛlɛ abala na nde boo: «Noko ibo basusu bakabungedja odhima, mbai nabungedjaetelea noko osinɛɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Nabalaka na wɛ sooti boo: ta bulu buu mɛɛnɛ, boso boo kɔkɔ akɔkɔle, oinganaleani mbala isato.» <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Piɛlɛ abala na nde boo: «Noko ekada boo nagwɛ na wɛ esika emɔti, nabungedjaetalea edhimeli ɛ mbai.» Ko batingami basusu babala oko moda momɔti.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aongɔɔni ta Getesemani</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mal 14, 32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22, 39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Yesu aimea engbanga na batingami ba nde ta esika ɛbeaka bo Getesemani ko abala na bu boo: «Daani haa, mbai nasasui anaho tina ɛ ongɔɔnɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Atomba Piɛlɛ na bana baami babae ba Djebedai. Abanga ooka ndjokwa ko osatungea. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Abala na bu boo: «Molema ma mbai molumi na ndjokwa mbuti na ogwa; dikaani haa ko sɛndjɛlɛni engbanga na mbai.» <verse eid="MAT 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Asalinda oboso maa osinɛɛ, asadumba na mbanda ta kpɔtɔ ko aongɔɔnɔ boo: «Tata, okapala, dogedja kɔbɔ hee ɛ saya odii mbai. Endolo, titi opala ba mbai, endolo, elengɛɛ ɔpalaka wɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Bea asɔmbɔ odii batingami basato ko abatanea bahwɛli. Abala na Piɛlɛ boo: «Ohɔnitini osɛndjɛlɛ engbanga na mbai noko ehole emɔti? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Sɛndjɛlɛni ko ongɔɔnɔni bɛngɛ ɔdaeni pɛpɛ okwa ta lomeko. Mwembo modii na posa enɛnɛ ɛ okɔ opele, endolo mokuku modii na bwɛmbu.»<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Asasua maa ohali mbala ɛ babae ko aongɔɔnɔ boo: «Tata, kɔbɔ hee ɛ saya emiti donga, nga ekadaa boo nayemwɛ, yɛɛ boo opala baa wɛ bakɔɔme!» <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Asɔmbɔ koko odii batingami ba nde ko abatanea oko bahwɛli; tina ɛ boo miso ma hiɔ mabapea na ngulu. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Yesu abakina koko, asasua ko aongɔɔnɔ mbala ɛ basato ko asɔmbɛɛ oko bibaeli bia bimɔti. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Ngɔngɔ djia, asɔmbɔ koko odii batingami ba nde ko abala na bu boo: «Ohwɛlini oko ko ɔhemakani? Hadɛdi, ehole eimei tina ɛ okaba Mwana ɔ moto ta mabɔ ma bato ba masumu. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Emani, lakɛɛ! Hokeani, moto okabini odii bo adii haa!»<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Opeama ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mal 14, 43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22, 47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yoa 18, 3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Oko ena ɔdaka Yesu abala, Yudasi, omɔti ɔ batingami doomi na babae aimea. Adoa engbanga na emumu ɛ bato ibapeaka mipata na mangenda. Balomama na bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe na basuku ba Bayuda. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Yudasi, moto ona ɔkaba Yesu, abapa embete boo: «Moto ona obhimbanalea na mbai, edii yo. Mopeani.» <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Ambuku Yudasi abatama na Yesu ko abala na nde boo: «Molehi, bwanda!» Ko amobhimba. <verse eid="MAT 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Mopalani ɔ mbai, modjɔ modoi wɛ akɔ, mokɔɔ pɛpɛlɛ.» Bea, bato bakina ibadoa engbanga na nde babatama, baisa mabɔ diko la Yesu ko bamopea. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Omɔti ɔ bato ibadaka na Yesu aihwa mopata ta igbogbo, akeka mosali ɔ kumu ɔ banganga ba Ndjambe ko amolena itoi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hokea koko Yoa 18, 26.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Endolo Yesu abala na nde boo: «Sɔmbɛdja mopata ma wɛ ta igbogbo, tina ɛ bato basusu ibakaone na mopata bagwabi na mopata. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Otadjebaka boo nahɔni obea Tata boo akɔmɛdjaeni ko mbala emɔti alomeani babwɛndi koto na koto? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Endolo, nga ekakɔɔmɔ moda mua, Makomi matakokedjama; tina ɛ mabalaka boo midjɔ mia misusu miboani okɔɔmɔ bea.»<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Oko ta ehole ena Yesu abala na emumu ɛ bato boo: «Odii mo enao, edii mbai motɔmbɔki bɛngɛ boo ɔdoeni apeani na mipata na mangenda? Maswi masusu, nadaka nadii ta Tepelo tina ɛ oleha, ko ɔipeakanini. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Endolo midjɔ mii misusu makɔɔmɔ bɛngɛ Makomi ma batɛli makokedjame.» Bea batingami basusu bamosundola ko batia.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu boso ba tibinalo eenɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mal 14, 53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22, 54-55</ref>. <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yoa 18, 13-14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19">19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Bato ibapea Yesu bakɛɛ na nde odii Kaifa, kumu ɔ banganga ba Ndjambe, oho ɔputoana bato ba edjebeli ɛ mobeko na basuku. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Piɛlɛ akimana Yesu ohali, mbunoko ta ndako ɛ kumu ɔ banganga ba Ndjambe. Aingea ta tiangando ko adaa esika emɔti na basindjili bɛngɛ aenɛ moda mosukalea modjɔ mua.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe na bato basusu ba esambi eenɛnɛ ɛ Bayuda bahombaka tati ebe diko la Yesu bɛngɛ bamopɛ etumbu ɛ ogwa; <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />endolo baiyediha, noko bato bike ɔmokosea bo midjɔ. Ta osukedja, bato babae badoa: <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />ko babala boo: «Moto hoo abala boo: “Mbai nahɔni obuka Tepelo ɛ Ndjambe ko oyepika na maswi masato.”» <verse eid="MAT 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Kumu ɔ banganga ba Ndjambe aemaa ko ahɔdja Yesu boo: «Enao, oditi, na ebaeli ɛosɔmbɛdja diko la midjɔ mii maopundaka na bu?» <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Endolo Yesu adaa oko ogoo. Bea Kumu ɔ banganga ba Ndjambe abala na nde boo: «Lena seleka ta kombe ɛ Ndjambe ɔ mohelo, lotɔndɔɔ: kaoko odii Masia, Mwana ɔ Ndjambe?» <verse eid="MAT 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Wɛ mɛɛnɛ moto obali bea. Endolo nabalaka na nu boo: Donga hadɛdi oenɛbini Mwana ɔ moto adii ta ebɔ ɛ bami ɛ Ndjambe ɔ ngulu isusu; omoenɛbini koko adoe diko la matutɛ ma busa.» <verse eid="MAT 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Bea kumu ɔ banganga ba Ndjambe aola bisendja ba nde ko abala boo: «Atsioli Ndjambe! Tina ɛhombaka na su koko bato ba opa tati nda? Ino mɛɛnɛ ookini moda motsioli yo Ndjambe. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Ɔlɛdjaka no enao?» Basɔmbɛdja boo: «Aboani na etumbu ɛ ogwa.» <verse eid="MAT 26:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Bamotɔɔ masɔi ta mbanda ko bamola ndumɔ; bakina bamoboma mbata <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />ko babala nde boo: «Wɛ, Masia, loinedja boo odii motɛli! Moto oobomi nda?»<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piɛlɛ aingani Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mal 14, 66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22, 56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoa 18, 15-18</ref>. <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Piɛlɛ adaka adii osokolu, ta tiangando. Mosali omɔti mwali abatama mbuti ko abala na nde boo: «Wɛ koko, ɔdaka engbanga na Yesu, moto ɔ Galilai.» <verse eid="MAT 26:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Endolo Piɛlɛ aingani ta miso ma bato basusu boo: «Natadjebaka modjɔ mapalaka wɛ ɔbale.» <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Ngɔngɔ djia Piɛlɛ akɛɛ ta dɔngɔ la edipako ɛ tiangando. Mosali okina mwali amoenɛ ko abala na bato ibadaka ena boo: «Moto hoo adaka engbanga na Yesu ɔ Nasalɛtɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Piɛlɛ aingana koko ko akata seleka: «Natadjebaka moto ona.»<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Ngɔngɔ dja maa ehole, bato ibadaka ena babatama na Piɛlɛ ko babala na nde boo: «Sooti mɛɛnɛ, odii omɔti ɔ bobo: moda ma wɛ ma obala moopundi.» <verse eid="MAT 26:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Bea Piɛlɛ agama: «Yɛɛ boo Ndjambe alakedjaeni nga nakakosa! Naleni seleka, natadjebaka moto ona!» Oko ta ehole ena, kɔkɔ akɔkɔlɔ, <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />ko Piɛlɛ alɛdjaa modjɔ imabala Yesu na nde boo: «Boso boo kɔkɔ akɔkɔle, oinganaleani mbala isato boo otadjebakani.» Aimana ko ayea na ngulu.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s1">Bakɛi na Yesu boso ba Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mal 15, 1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luk 23, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yoa 18, 28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Ehole ɛya busa, bakumu basusu ba banganga ba Ndjambe na basuku ba Bayuda baputoana bɛngɛ baonge mwango ma oowa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Bamonanga mbɔti, bamotomba ko bamokaba ta mabɔ ma kumu Pilato.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudasi asakomi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Mis 1, 18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Yudasi ona ɔtɛkɛ Yesu, aoka gala boo bamolenei etumbu. Aoka saya enɛnɛ ta molema ko akɛɛ asɔmbɛdja falanga dja bibende tuku isato odii bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe na basuku ba Bayuda. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Abala na bu boo: «Nakɔi isumu, tina ɛ boo nakabi moto ona ootaki obe ta ogwa!» Endolo ibo bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Modjɔ mua moloeniti iso! Moeni wɛ mɛɛnɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Yudasi adumba falanga ta Tepelo ko adonga ena; bea akɛɛ asakoma. <verse eid="MAT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe batuta falanga djia ko babala boo: «Mobeko ma booso motapaka enɔli boo laise falanga djii ta odiheli ba Tepelo, tina ɛ boo idii falanga dja makia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Motswuia ma makia: motswuia ma mohelo ma moto.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Ngɔngɔ dja odhimeana, basomba na dju gue ɛ mosali ɔ poke tina ɛ okunda bakɛndɛli. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Ta tina ena mbunoko busabu bakabee gue ena «gue ɛ makia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hokea koko Mis 1, 19.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Bea bibaeli ibabala motɛli Yelemia bakokedjama: «Batomba falanga dja bibende tuku isato motswuia imalena bato ba Isalɛlɛ tina ɛ nde <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />ko basomba na dju gue ɛ mosali ɔ poke, moda imalomani Kumu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edii okokedjama ba bibaeli ba Djak 11, 12-13 engbanga na midjɔ imatomba yo odii Yel 18, 2-3; 19, 1-2; 32, 6-15.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asambi boso ba Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mal 15, 2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luk 23, 3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yoa 18, 33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Yesu asambi boso ba gupunɛlɛ. Gupunɛlɛ amohɔdja boo: «Odii kumu ɔ Bayuda?» Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Wɛ moto obali.» <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Ngɔngɔ djia, ehole ɛmopunda bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe na basuku ba Bayuda, aisɔmbɛdja noko eka emɔti. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Bea Pilato abala na nde boo: «Otaokaka midjɔ mia misusu mabalaka bo tina ɛ wɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Endolo Yesu aisɔmbɛdja noko ebaeli emɔti, ko gupunɛlɛ akamoa obuke mɛɛnɛ.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Balenei Yesu etumbu ɛ ogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mal 15, 6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23, 13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-40">Yoa 18, 39-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Eengi tɛkɛ ɛ Pasika, gupunɛlɛ adaka na modjebeano ma otingoa moto omɔti ta bɔlɔkɔ ona ɔhɔkɔ bato. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Ehole ena, moto ɔ bɔlɔkɔ omɔti adaka ena ona ɔdjebamaka obuke ɔ kombe ɛ Balabasi. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Bea Pilato ahɔdja emumu ɛ bato boo: «Ɔpalaka no boo naotingoeni nda: Balabasi kaoko Yesu okabee bo Masia?» <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Pilato adjeba opele boo, bakaba Yesu ta mabɔ ma nde ta tina ɛ ikua. <verse eid="MAT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Ena ɔdaka Pilato ta tibinalo, mwali ɔ nde amolomea mosise boo: «Pɛpɛ oingea ta midjɔ ma moto ona ɔ odjoo, tina ɛ boo, bulu ba busabu naeni saya mɛɛnɛ ta ndjɔti diko la nde.»<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe na basuku balongoa emumu ɛ bato boo bahɔdjae Pilato atingoe Balabasi ta bɔlɔkɔ ko aowoe Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Gupunɛlɛ abahɔdja koko boo: «Ta ndanda ɛ ibo babae ɔpalaka no naotingoeni nda?» - Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Balabasi!» <verse eid="MAT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilato abahɔdja boo: «Ɔkɔkɔ mbai na Yesu ona okabee bo Klisto enao?» Bato basusu basɔmbedja boo: «Abakame ta ekulusu!» - <verse eid="MAT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Pilato ahɔdja koko boo: «Obe bokɔi yo nda?» Endolo bagama na ngulu oonɔ boo: «Abakame ta ekulusu!» <verse eid="MAT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Ehole ɛenɛ Pilato boo atahɔnɔ okɔ eka emɔti, endolo wusuwusu ɛnɛngɛkɛ oko onɛngɛ, atomba madiba, asasosa mabɔ boso ba emumu ko abala boo: «Naditi na mandi ta ogwa ba moto hoo! Edii modjɔ ma boono!» <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Bato basusu basɔmbɛdja boo: «Yɛɛ boo makia ma nde mabakame diko la booso na diko la baana ba booso!» <verse eid="MAT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Pilato abatingoa Balabasi; ko ngɔngɔ dja obomedja Yesu pimbo, amopa ta mabɔ ma bobo bɛngɛ bamobake ta ekulusu.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basoda basɛki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mal 15, 16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoa 19, 2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Bea bakɛɛ na Yesu ta ndako ɛ gupunɛlɛ ko basoda bike bamohika. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Bamoihwa bisendja ba nde ko bamolwɛdja mokoto mokpetu. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Bayoa egbala ɛ ndjubɛ bamobakea yo ta molo, ko bamopedja kusu ta ebɔ ɛ bami. Ngɔngɔ bakwaa magunda boso ba nde ko bamosɛkɛ ena babala boo: «Bwanda, kumu ɔ Bayuda!» <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Bamotɔkɔ masɔi ko batomba kusu ena bamoboma ta molo. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Bea ngɔngɔ dja omosɛkɛ, bamoihwa mokoto, bamolwɛdja bisendja ba nde ko bakɛɛ na nde bɛngɛ bamobake ta ekulusu.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babaki Yesu ta ekulusu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mal 15, 21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23, 26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoa 19, 17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Ehole ɛimana bo ta ibonga, basaka na moto omɔti ɔ Silɛne, ɔ beaka bo Simo; basoda bamopea na ngulu bɛngɛ atombe ekulusu ɛ Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Ehole ɛimea bo ta esika ɛbeaka bo Gologota, ɛtingodjaka boo «esika ɛ mokua ma engbongolo ɛ molo». <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Bapa Yesu mana ma ngai; endolo ehole ɛmalɛlɛ yo, alona omamwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Ngɔngɔ dja omobaka ta ekulusu, basakaanea bisendja ba nde na oboma djeke. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Ko badaa ena bɛngɛ bamosɛndjɛle. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Diko la molo ma Yesu, babaka ma yaale ɔ ibaya ɔkoma bo tina ɛ etumbu ɛ nde: «Moto hoo adii Yesu, kumu ɔ Bayuda.» <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Baowoli ba bato babae babakama engbanga na Yesu, omɔti ta ebɔ ɛ nde ɛ baami ko okina ta ebɔ ɛ nde ɛ bali.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Binɔ na ndjia badaka bamosinga ena bakumana melo; <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />babalaka boo: «Wɛ ona ɔbalaka boo obukalea Tepelo ko ɔyepikalea koko na maswi masato, saheledja wɛ mɛɛnɛ, nga okadaa Mwana ɔ Ndjambe, donga ta ekulusu!» <verse eid="MAT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe, bato ba edjebeli ɛ mobeko na basuku badaka koko basɛkɛ Yesu ko babalaka boo: <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />«Aheledjaka bato bakina, endolo yo mɛɛnɛ atahɔnɔkɔ osaheledja! Adii kumu ɔ Isalɛlɛ? Yɛɛ boo atite hadɛdi ta ekulusu ko lomodhimealea. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Aisaka molema odii Ndjambe, yɛɛ boo Ndjambe amotingoe hadɛdi nga akamopala, tina ɛ abala boo: “Nadii Mwana ɔ Ndjambe.”» <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Baowoli ba bato ibabaka bo engbanga na Yesu ta ekulusu badaka koko bamosinga moda momɔti.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ogwa ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mal 15, 33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23, 44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoa 19, 28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Donga ehole ɛ midi, mbunoko ehole ɛ basato ɛ mɔkɔmɔkɔ modidi makwa ta ngondo esusu. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Mbuti na ehole ɛ basato ɛ mɔkɔmɔkɔ, Yesu agama na moholi mopipo boo: «Eli, Eli, lema sabakatani?» Ɛbalaka boo: «Ndjambe ɔ mbai, Ndjambe ɔ mbai, osundolini tina nda?» <verse eid="MAT 27:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Bato bakina ibadaka ena bamooka ko bagama boo: «Abeaka Elia!» <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Ambuku omɔti ɔ bobo apeta atomba imbusu, alidubea ta vino ɛ ngai; alihangea ta sɔngɔ ɛ mokɛɛlɛ, ko alihwedja odii Yesu boo alimwɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Endolo bakina bato babala boo: «Omba, lahokee kaoko Elia adoalea amoheledja!»<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Endolo Yesu agama koko na ngulu ko agwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Oko ta ehole ena, lido ɛ Tepelo ɛolea biale bibae donga odiko mbunoko onase. Mokpɔtɔ makumana, ndeke inɛnɛnɛ djanangoa, <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />mibombo masadipoa ko mikuku ma basɛnɔke bike ibagwa mapusoa. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Baimana ta mibombo ko, ngɔngɔ dja opusoama ba Yesu, baingea ta Yelusalɛmɛ, ibonga isɛnɔke, ko baenɛmɛ na bato bike. <verse eid="MAT 27:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Kumu ɔ basoda ɔ Loma engbanga na basoda ibadaka babanyea Yesu ehole ɛenɛ bo moda imakumana mokpɔtɔ na midjɔ misusu imanɔɔ; badaa na bɔɔ bonɛnɛ ko babala boo: «Moto hoo adaki sooti Mwana ɔ Ndjambe!» <verse eid="MAT 27:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Bali bike badaka ena ko badaka bahokea ohali: bakimana Yesu donga Galilai bɛngɛ bamokɔmɛdjae. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Ta ndanda ɛ bobo, ɛdaka Malia ɔ ngando ɛ Magadala, Malia nɛngɛ Djake nɔbɔ Yosepu, na nɛngɛ baana bami ba Djebedai.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bapusei Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mal 15, 42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23, 50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoa 19, 38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Ehole ɛimea mɔkɔmɔkɔ, modiheli omɔti ɔ ngando ɛ Alimate aimea. Kombe ɛ nde Yosepu ona ɔdaka koko motingami ɔ Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Akɛɛ odii Pilato ko asɛngɛ mokuku ma Yesu. Bea Pilato apa enɔli boo bamopɛ yo. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Yosepu atomba mokuku ma Yesu, ayedinga na dhala ɛ soa ɛ tɛtɛli <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />ko ayesambea ta mobombo ma yanie imatɔdja yo ta mondeke monɛnɛ tina ɛ nde. Bea ahilingoanedja mondeke monɛnɛ tina ɛ odipa eingeli ɛ mobombo ko ayana. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Malia moto ɔ ngando ɛ Magadala na Malia okina badaka ena, bayɛli mobombo.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basindjili ba mobombo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Ngɔngɔ dja iswi imɔti, iswi ilakimana obɔngɛdjama ba sabata, bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe na Bafalusai bakɛɛ odii Pilato <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />ko babala na nde boo: «Kumu, lalɛdjaka midjɔ mabala moto ona ɔ epulu, ehole ɛdaka yo ta mohelo, abala boo: “Ngɔngɔ dja maswi masato, apusoalea.” <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Bea, pa enɔli boo basɛndjɛlɛ mobombo mbunoko iswi la basato, bɛngɛ boo batingami ba nde basakaa doa aiba mokuku ma nde ko babale na bato boo: “apusoi ta ndanda ɛ bago.” Epulu ena ɛ suka edalea ebe onɔɔ epulu ɛ boso.» <verse eid="MAT 27:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilato abala na bu boo: «Tombani basindjili ko kɛɛ asɛndjɛlɛni mobombo moda mapalaka no.» <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Bea bakɛɛ ko bakɔɔ midjɔ imaboanaka boo mobombo mabanyeame opele, badipa eingeli ɛ mobombo na mondeke ko badikaka basindjili.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Opusoa ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mal 16, 1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoa 20, 1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Ngɔngɔ dja sabata, na hindihindi ɛ busa ba eyenga, Malia ɔ Magadala na Malia okina bakɛɛ aindja mobombo. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Ambuku, mokpɔtɔ makumana; obwɛndi ɔ Kumu atita donga ta busa, ahilingoanedja mondeke ma mobombo ko adaa diko la mu. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Adaka angɛngɛ elengɛɛ mokaikai ko bisendja ba nde badaka bipu elengɛɛ monyɛngɛ. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Basindjili bangongoma na bɔɔ ko baimea elɛngɛɛ bato bago. <verse eid="MAT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Endolo obwɛndi abala na bali boo: «Pɛpɛ obangani. Nadjebi boo ɔhombakani Yesu, ona ɔbakama ta ekulusu. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Aditi haa, apusoi ta ndanda ɛ bago moda imabala yo. Doa aindjeni esika edaki mokuku ma nde mosambi. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Kɛɛni pɛpɛlɛ adjebedja batingami ba nde boo: “Apusoi ta ndanda ɛ bago ko asuaki boso aombani ta Galilai; omoenɛleani oho.” Hokeani modjɔ modaki na mbai boo naotɔndɔeni.» <verse eid="MAT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Badonga pɛpɛlɛ ta mobombo, balumake na bɔɔ ko na sepi enɛnɛ, bapeta tina ɛ okɛ atɔndɔɔ gala odii batingami ba Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Ambuku, Yesu akɛɛ asaka na bu ko abala na bu boo: «Ndese ɛ boono!» Babatama na nde, babinga mako ma nde ko bakwa magunda boso ba nde. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Yesu abala na bu boo: «Pɛpɛ obangani oko. Kɛɛ atɔndɔeni banainga boo banɔe ta Galilai: Edii oho esika eenɛleani bo.»<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tɔndɔ ɛ basindjili odii bakumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Ehole ɛdaka bo badala na ndjia, basindjili bakina bakɛɛ ta ibonga atɔndɔɔ bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe midjɔ misusu imakɔɔmɔ. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe baputoana na basuku ba ngando: ngɔngɔ dja odhimeana, bapa falanga djike odii basindjili <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />ko babala na bu boo: «Tɔndɔni boo batingami ba moto ona badoi aiba mokuku ma nde na bulu, ehole edakiso lohwɛli. <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Ko nga gupunɛle akadjeba, lomogɔmbɛdjalea ko lokɔlea na ngulu boo ɔdaeni pɛpɛ otungeama.» <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Basindjili batomba falanga ko bakɔɔ oko moda mabaloma bo. Isolo dia lanangana ta tei ɛ Bayuda ko ikabalame mbunoko busabu.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asaenɛmɛdjai odii batingami ba nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mal 16, 14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24, 36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoa 20, 19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Mis 1, 6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Batingami doomi na omɔti bakɛɛ ta Galilai, ta ngomba ena ɛbatɔndɔ Yesu boo asake na bu. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Ehole ɛmoenɛ bo, bakwa magunda boso ba nde; endolo bakina ta ndanda ɛ bobo, badaka na kitɛ. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yesu abatama na bu ko abala boo: «Kpati esusu epami na mbai odiko ko ta kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Bea kɛɛni ta bikomi bisusu ko baimedjani batingami; bainani ta kombe ɛ Tata, ɛ Mwana na ɛ Mwembo Mosɛnɔke, <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />ko balehani basume midjɔ misusu maolomani mbai. Djebani opele boo: nadii engbanga na nu maswi masusu mbunoko suka ɛ ngondo.»<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>